 de Diane Longines","grade":"1","raceDate":"June, 14 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":1156971,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"LONGCHAMP","raceName":"Emirates Poule d'Essai des Pouliches","grade":"1","raceDate":"May, 10 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":648271,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"LONGCHAMP","raceName":"Qatar Prix Marcel Boussac - Criterium des Pouliches","grade":"1","raceDate":"October, 05 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":469607,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"LEOPARDSTOWN","raceName":"Ballylinch Stud Irish E.B.F. Ingabelle S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 13 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":142000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CURRAGH","raceName":"Grand Hotel Malahide Irish E.B.F.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 09 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":37254,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":359554,"show":0,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":2236398,"show":1,"win":3,"place":1,"showP":"20","winP":"60","placeP":"20"},"lifetime":{"starts":8,"earnings":2595952,"show":1,"win":6,"place":1,"showP":"13","winP":"75","placeP":"13"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"20","winsP":"60","placesP":"20","starts":5,"earnings":2236398,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":3,"places":1},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":3,"earnings":359554,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":3,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eDiamond Necklace (IRE) has put together an impressive resume. The 3-year-old filly began the year with a win in the May 10 Poule d'Essai Des Pouliches (G1) at Longchamp. She took the French equivalent of England’s 1,000 Guineas (G1) by 3 lengths. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFollowing that win, Diamond Necklace won the June 14 Prix de Diane Longines (G1), or the French Oaks, at Chantilly by a neck. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor her next start, Diamond Necklace headed to Goodwood in England for the July 30 Nassau Stakes (G1), which she won by 2 ¾ lengths. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDiamond Necklace then finished second in the Aug. 23 Prix Jean et Louis Romanet (G1) behind Aventure (IRE). On Oct. 4, she finished third in the Prix de l’Arc de Triomphe (G1) behind Daryz (FR) and Bay City Roller (IRE). \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAs a 2-year-old, Diamond Necklace won all three of her starts, including the Prix Marcel Boussac - Criterium des Pouliches (G1). \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAidan O’Brien trains Diamond Necklace for Coolmore. M.V. Magnier bought her for $1,840,153 as a yearling. She was bred by Ecurie Des Monceaux and Skymarc Farm Inc. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDiamond Necklace is by St Mark’s Basilica (FR) and out of the Dansili (GB) mare Prudenzia (IRE).\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Ecurie Des Monceaux \u0026 Skymarc Farm Inc","uid":"blt4d23e81704e72e29","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt4d23e81704e72e29?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Diamond Necklace (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Derrick Smith, Mrs. John Magnier, Michael Tabor \u0026 Westerberg (Lucia Walder)","trainer":"Aidan P. O'Brien","country":{"uid":"blta32e5b692b12a246","title":"Ireland","abbreviation":"IRE","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt613f9a736c40223a/61aa4c2b2f8b9e70946988d3/ireland.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Diamond Necklace","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blta49f59444c186981/6a74b6c8ded0cfedaef4a391/Contender_Photo_Diamond_Necklace_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blta49f59444c186981/6a74b6c8ded0cfedaef4a391/Contender_Photo_Diamond_Necklace_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt21de548e7ed632cc","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":