(G1).\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLast year, Eccentric won the Premio Polla de Potrancas - Joaquin T Morande (G1), Gran Premio Nacional Ricardo Lyon (G1), Criadores Hembras Carlos Hirmas A (G2) and Julio Subercaseaux B. (G3). She also finished second in the Premio Arturo Lyon Pena (G1), Premio Las Oaks (G1) and Cotejo de Potrancas (G3) as well as third in the Premio El Ensayo Mega (G1).\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTrained by Patricio Baeza, Eccentric races as a homebred for Haras Don Alberto. She is by Ivan Denisovich (IRE) and out of the Seeking the Dia mare Elea (CHI).\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Haras Don Alberto","uid":"bltf6641ffd0559fb23","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltf6641ffd0559fb23?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Eccentric (CHI)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Don Alberto Stable (Carlos Heller)","trainer":"Wesley A. Ward","country":{"uid":"bltbade43d7316c55b9","title":"Chile","abbreviation":"CHL","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt3eb0d27a3a780275/61aa4b95425bc6598f47b3d0/chile.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Eccentric","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt75fcd9ba2b4854b2/6a736d70c8b7aca27051fc57/Contender_Photo_Eccentri_(CHI)_updated_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt75fcd9ba2b4854b2/6a736d70c8b7aca27051fc57/Contender_Photo_Eccentri_(CHI)_updated_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt21de548e7ed632cc","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Awtaad (IRE)","damName":"Pea