003cp\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c/span\u003eShe was the only female in the field but Survie (IRE) took the boys to school in the 1 ½-mile Christophe Clement Turf (G1) at Saratoga Aug. 15 as she once again displayed her devastating turn of foot and stamina, rallying from last to first through the lane under Manny Franco to become the first of her sex to win this prestigious event since 1988. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe 5-year-old daughter of European champion Churchill (IRE) has been a top-quality filly in Europe throughout her career with seven graded stakes placings and a win in the 2024 Prix de Malleret (G2) at Longchamp immediately after her runner-up finish in the Prix de Diane (G1) at Chantilly. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSince English trainer George Boughey sent her stateside this summer she has excelled. Just two weeks before winning the Christophe Clement, which is a “Win and You’re In” qualifier for the Breeders’ Cup Longines Turf (G1), she also turned for home and turned it on through the stretch to take the Glen Falls (G2) against fillies and mares on the same course at the same distance. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThree weeks after the Clement victory, Survie was back in Europe in the 1 1/2-mile Prix Vermeille (G1) at Parislongchamp. However, she did not fire in finishing a nonthreatening 10th of 13 being eased late after not finding racing room in the stretch. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSurvie, which means “survive” in English, is out of the Le Havre (IRE) mare Sotteville (FR). She was sold by her French connections at auction last December to Michael Tabor for $2,636.068.\u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(29, 34, 40);\"\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003cspan\u003e\u003c/span\u003e\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":16,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Franklin Finance S.A.","uid":"blta9ec55dad9f7143f","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blta9ec55dad9f7143f?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Survie (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Doreen Tabor","trainer":"George Boughey","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Survie","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt87c957fa18a46f11/6a74b6dbcbb9ed962953d7bf/Contender_Photo_Survie.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt87c957fa18a46f11/6a74b6dbcbb9ed962953d7bf/Contender_Photo_Survie.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt21de548e7ed632cc","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":true,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Lookin At Lucky","damName":"Joy of Learning","sex":"Colt","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"April, 27 2022 00:00:00","age":4,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Del Mar H. Presented by The Japan Racing Association","grade":"2","raceDate":"August, 29 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"COLONIAL DOWNS","raceName":"Arlington Million S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"August, 01 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":1000000,"positionAtFinish":6},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Resorts World Casino Manhattan S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"June, 06 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":1000000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Old Forester Bourbon Turf Classic S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"May, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":1500000,"positionAtFinish":8},{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":"Pegasus World Cup Turf Invitational S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"January, 24 2026 00:00:0