y Daman Markets By Daman Securities","grade":" ","raceDate":"January, 03 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":81690,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"Bet365 Feilden S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 17 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":68346,"positionAtFinish":7},{"trackName":"KEMPTON PARK","raceName":"Unibet","grade":" ","raceDate":"January, 10 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":10168,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KEMPTON PARK","raceName":"Unibet More Boosts In More Races Ebf Novice Stakes (Class 5) (Div I) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"December, 06 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":8565,"positionAtFinish":6}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":9,"earnings":1110197,"show":4,"win":3,"place":2,"showP":"44","winP":"33","placeP":"22"},"breedersCup":{"starts":1,"earnings":450000,"show":1,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"100","winP":"0","placeP":"0"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":160000,"show":1,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"50","winP":"0","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":14,"earnings":1275688,"show":5,"win":4,"place":2,"showP":"36","winP":"29","placeP":"14"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"50","winsP":"0","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":160000,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":0,"places":0},{"showsP":"44","winsP":"33","placesP":"22","starts":9,"earnings":1110197,"racingYear":2025,"shows":4,"wins":3,"places":2}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eEl Cordobes (IRE) represented himself well in his first start since February when he finished third in the Oct. 1 Joe Hirsch Turf Classic Stakes (G1) at Belmont Park. The 5-year-old gelding took the lead in the race but ultimately finished 2 ¾ lengths behind the winning Minaret Station. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn Valentine’s Day, El Cordobes finished fifth in the H. H. The Amir Trophy (G2) in Qatar. The race was won by Japan’s Deep Monster (JPN). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLast year, El Cordobes won the Sword Dancer Stakes (G1) and Princess Of Wales’s Stakes (G2). He also finished third in the Longines Breeders’ Cup Turf (G1), Joe Hirsch, Aston Park Stakes (G3) and Grand Cup Stakes. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn 2024, El Cordobes broke his maiden in January, ran one more time that April, and then was gelded in May and did not run again until 2025. He made one start as a juvenile in 2023. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCharlie Appleby trains El Cordobes for Godolphin. He is by Frankel (GB) and out of the Sea The Stars (IRE) mare Bold Lass (IRE). \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEl Cordobes was bred in Ireland by Bjorn Nielsen, and he was sold as a yearling for $2,379,118.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":4,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Bjorn Nielsen","uid":"blt5546e9a24399e588","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt5546e9a24399e588?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"El Cordobes (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Godolphin, LLC (Mohammed Al Maktoum, ET AL.) (Lessee)","trainer":"Charlie Appleby","country":{"uid":"blt440e3ce320965a9b","title":"United Kingdom / England","abbreviation":"GBR","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt02676e7705186e63/61aa4e462e86841fa22388f0/united-kingdom.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"El Cordobes","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltb565cb622cd77285/689b7cdd78032245e831d89e/Contender_Photo_El_Cordobes.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltb565cb622cd77285/689b7cdd78032245e831d89e/Contender_Photo_El_Cordobes.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt21de548e7ed632cc","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":18,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"18","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"