:"July, 29 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":240386,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"YORK","raceName":"Al Basti Equiworld Dubai Criterion S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"June, 28 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":137192,"positionAtFinish":6},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Queen Anne S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"June, 17 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":1077490,"positionAtFinish":5},{"trackName":"LONGCHAMP","raceName":"Prix du Palais Royal","grade":"3","raceDate":"May, 25 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":170511,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"ROSEHILL","raceName":"James Squire Golden Eagle","grade":" ","raceDate":"November, 02 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":6658951,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"NEWBURY","raceName":"Fidelity Energy Hackwood S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"July, 20 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":108856,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Commonwealth Cup","grade":"1","raceDate":"June, 21 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":918589,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"Juddmonte Middle Park S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 30 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":355819,"positionAtFinish":7},{"trackName":"YORK","raceName":"Al Basti Equiworld Dubai Gimcrack S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"August, 25 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":337079,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"British Stallion Studs Ebf Novice Stakes (Class 4) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 04 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":10167,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"Kingdom Of Bahrain July S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"July, 13 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":129886,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"HAYDOCK PARK","raceName":"Jewson St Helens Ebf Novice Stakes (Class 4) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 14 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":12611,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":7,"earnings":344934,"show":0,"win":0,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"0","placeP":"29"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":6,"earnings":601216,"show":0,"win":2,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"33","placeP":"33"},"lifetime":{"starts":21,"earnings":4539939,"show":0,"win":5,"place":7,"showP":"0","winP":"24","placeP":"33"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"33","placesP":"33","starts":6,"earnings":601216,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":2},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"0","placesP":"29","starts":7,"earnings":344934,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":2}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eLake Forest (GB) has been set some tough tasks by his connections, including international travel, long layoffs and short turnarounds, and faceoffs with some of the world's top sprinter/milers. Given all that, the 5-year-old No Nay Never gelding has compiled a nice record.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe was a busy lad in 2023 with five starts returning two wins, one in the Gimcrack Stakes (G1) at York's iconic Ebor meeting. When he started 2024 finishing second in both the Commonwealth Cup (G1) at Royal Ascot and the Hackwood Stakes (G3) at Newbury, trainer William Haggis packed him off to Australia, where he won the Golden Eagle over some of Australia's top names.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLake Forest went winless in his first five starts in 2025, then returned to Australia only to finish 12th and seventh in two Group 1s.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe won his 5-year-old debut easily, then was a close-up fifth in the Queen Elizabeth II Jubilee Cup (G1) at the Royal Meeting. When he next won the Lennox Stakes (G2) at Glorious Goodwood, Haggis shot for a rare double the very next day but Lake Forest could only manage a seventh in the ultra-tough Sussex Stakes (G1). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe came back fewer than four weeks later and finished second behind Notable Speech (GB) in the City of York (G1). Following that race, Lake Forest traveled to the U.S. for the Oct. 3 Coolmore Turf Mile (G1) at Keeneland in which he was in tight quarters in the stretch before getting clear late to finish second behind favored Rhetorical.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Sahara Group Holdings","uid":"blt041204e071083ccf","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt041204e071083ccf?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Lake Forest (GB)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Tony Bloom , Ian McAleavy","trainer":"William John Haggas","country":{"uid":"blt440e3ce320965a9b","title":"United Kingdom / England","abbreviation":"GBR","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt02676e7705186e63/61aa4e462e86841fa22388f0/united-kingdom.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Lake Forest","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9aa7b4897f1141cf/6ac3a5ff280ccc4a95665537/Contender_Photo_Lake_Forest.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9aa7b4897f1141cf/6ac3a5ff280ccc4a95665537/Contender_Photo_Lake_Forest.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt31ae65439327eecf","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Dubawi (IRE)","damName":"Swift Rose (IRE)","sex":"Horse","color":"Chestnut","foalingDate":"March, 10 2021 00:00:00","age":5,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":"Woodbine Mile S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 12 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":1000000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"YORK","raceName":"Sky Bet City Of York S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"August, 22 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":818672,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Queen Anne S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"June, 16