e":"May, 04 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":627352,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KEMPTON PARK","raceName":"Virgin Bet Best Odds Daily British Ebf Conditions Stakes (Class 2)","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 06 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":37914,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KEMPTON PARK","raceName":"European Road To The Kentucky Derby Conditions Stakes (Class 3) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"February, 21 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":75737,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KEMPTON PARK","raceName":"Unibet Supports Safe Gambling Maiden Stakes (Class 5) (Div Ii) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"January, 27 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":8892,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":6,"earnings":1851001,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"33","placeP":"17"},"breedersCup":{"starts":2,"earnings":1220000,"show":1,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"50","winP":"50","placeP":"0"},"currentYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":1237907,"show":0,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"60","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":19,"earnings":4428249,"show":1,"win":10,"place":1,"showP":"5","winP":"53","placeP":"5"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"60","placesP":"0","starts":5,"earnings":1237907,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":3,"places":0},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"33","placesP":"17","starts":6,"earnings":1851001,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":1}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eNotable Speech has been a steady performer in Godolphin's always powerful lineup since he started his career in 2024 with five wins from his first six starts, including victories in the Two Thousand Guineas (G1) at Newmarket and the Sussex Stakes (G1) at Goodwood.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTwo starts later, the son of Dubawi (IRE) found himself at Del Mar for the FanDuel Breeders' Cup Mile (G1), in which he finished a solid third, beaten just 1 length as the favorite in a field of 10. That was a taste of what was to come, with much of his success coming thanks to trainer Charlie Appleby's well-timed raids on North America's turf races.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNotable Speech came up short in his first four starts in\u0026nbsp;2025\u0026nbsp;but that fourth start did produce a second-place finish in the Prix Jacques le Marois (G1) at Deauville. That was good enough to get him back on a flight to North America, where he won the Woodbine Mile (G1) in September and avenged his year-earlier loss by winning the Breeders' Cup Mile back at Del Mar.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Godolphin homebred, out of the Invincible Spirit (IRE) mare Swift Rose (IRE), started 2026 slowly, with one win from his first three starts with the victory coming in the\u0026nbsp;Lockinge\u0026nbsp;Stakes (G1). However, Notable Speech returned to top form on Aug. 22 in the City of York (G1) with a 2 3/4-length victory in the 7-furlong test.\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Godolphin","uid":"blt1912434d1425503e","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt1912434d1425503e?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Notable Speech (GB)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Godolphin, LLC (Mohammed Al Maktoum, ET AL.) (Lessee)","trainer":"Charlie Appleby","country":{"uid":"blt440e3ce320965a9b","title":"United Kingdom / England","abbreviation":"GBR","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt02676e7705186e63/61aa4e462e86841fa22388f0/united-kingdom.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Notable Speech","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt525d3fddbc798ba6/6a739eb78bcd80e2372609cf/Contender_Photo_Notable_Speech_(GB).jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt525d3fddbc798ba6/6a739eb78bcd80e2372609cf/Contender_Photo_Notable_Speech_(GB).jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt31ae65439327eecf","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRan