"raceName":"Shoemaker Mile S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"May, 26 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Frank E. Kilroe Mile S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"March, 01 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":"Pegasus World Cup Turf Invitational S. presented by Qatar Racing","grade":"1","raceDate":"January, 25 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":1000000,"positionAtFinish":12},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Hollywood Derby","grade":"1","raceDate":"November, 30 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Caesars Sportsbook Del Mar Derby","grade":"2","raceDate":"September, 01 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Caesars Sportsbook Oceanside S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 20 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Audubon S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 01 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":275000,"positionAtFinish":6},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"American Turf S. presented by TwinSpires","grade":"2","raceDate":"May, 04 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":600000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"March, 29 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":67000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"February, 24 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":67000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"San Vicente S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"January, 06 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":6}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":374948,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"40","placeP":"20"},"breedersCup":{"starts":1,"earnings":10000,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"0","placeP":"0"},"currentYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":142281,"show":1,"win":0,"place":1,"showP":"20","winP":"0","placeP":"20"},"lifetime":{"starts":15,"earnings":618321,"show":1,"win":3,"place":5,"showP":"7","winP":"20","placeP":"33"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"20","winsP":"0","placesP":"20","starts":5,"earnings":142281,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":0,"places":1},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"40","placesP":"20","starts":5,"earnings":374948,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":1}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eA $130,000 Keeneland September yearling that developed into a $410,000 OBS Spring Sale juvenile purchase, Praying finished worse than second only once in five starts during her 2-year-old campaign. An impressive 7-length winner third time out in a 5 ½-furlong dirt maiden special weight that summer at Horseshoe Indianapolis, the dark bay finished runner-up in the 6-furlong Myrtlewood Stakes at Keeneland that fall.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAt 3, Praying made five starts in total, highlighted by wins in Saratoga’s Prioress Stakes (G3) and Thoroughbred Club of America Stakes (G2) at Keeneland. She rounded out her sophomore campaign with a seventh in the 7-furlong PNC Bank Breeders’ Cup Filly and Mare Sprint (G1) at Del Mar.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMarking her 2026 return with a fourth —10 ½ lengths behind victorious Eclatant — in Keeneland’s 7-furlong Madison Stakes (G1) on April 4. Praying was third in the 6 ½-furlong Vagrancy Stakes (G3) at Aqueduct in May before tiring to a well-beaten sixth behind top choice Ways and Means in the June 5 Bed o’ Roses Stakes (G2) at Saratoga.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCatching a yielding turf course in Saratoga’s Smart and Fancy Stakes (Listed) on Aug. 14, Praying was seventh behind favored Zeitlos.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGoing to the front in this year’s renewal of the TCA, a “Win and You’re In” qualifier for the Filly and Mare Sprint at Keeneland, the daughter of Vekoma went to the front and was outpunched by Evanescence, who earned a neck victory over the 14-1 chance.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePraying is trained by Robbie Medina, a former assistant to Hall of Fame trainer Shug McGaughey.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred by Jeff Kerber, the Kentucky-bred filly is campaigned by American-based construction magnate Maurice Regan’s Newtown Anner Stud Farm.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":5,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Jeff Kerber","uid":"bltc1379c747e25c065","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltc1379c747e25c065?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Praying","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Newtownanner Stud Farm (Samantha Regan)","trainer":"Robert Medina","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Praying","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt5e474c49d20c961d/6ac688370491eb4cf904943a/Contender_Photo_Praying.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt5e474c49d20c961d/6ac688370491eb4cf904943a/Contender_Photo_Praying.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltf0689a11ba6900ce","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Awesome Slew","damName":"Making Havoc","sex":"Mare","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"February, 13 2021 00:00:00","age":5,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"BELMONT PARK","raceName":"Gallant Bloom S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"October, 01 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":250000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Resorts World Casino Ballerina S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"August, 29 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":500000,"positionAtFinish":6},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Derby City Distaff S. presented by Ford","grade":"1","raceDate":"May, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":1000000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"Resolute Racing Madison S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"April, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":650000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":"Hurricane Bertie S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"March, 07 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":175000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Dream Supreme S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"November, 08 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"BELMONT AT THE BIG A","raceName":"Gallant Bloom S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"September, 27 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":250000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 20 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":120000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Honorable Miss S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"July, 20 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"DELAWARE PARK","raceName":"Rehoboth S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 31 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"BELMONT AT THE BIG A","raceName":"Vagrancy S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"May, 04 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":175000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":"Hurricane Bertie S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"March, 08 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":165000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"January, 18 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":96000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"TAMPA BAY DOWNS","raceName":"FTBOA City of Ocala Florida Sire S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"December, 14 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"November, 15 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":48000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 13 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":72000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 09 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":48000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 20 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":48000,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":8,"earnings":481800,"show":0,"win":4,"place":4,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"50"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":855085,"show":1,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"20","winP":"60","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":18,"earnings":1468265,"show":1,"win":10,"place":6,"showP":"6","winP":"56","placeP":"33"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"20","winsP":"60","placesP":"0","starts":5,"earnings":855085,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":3,"places":0},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"50","starts":8,"earnings":481800,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":4,"places":4}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eLike fine wine, former claimer R Disaster certainly has improved with age. After missing her entire 2-year-old campaign, the Florida-bred debuted in the summer of her 3-year-old year, finishing second against fellow Sunshine State-breds at Gulfstream. Winning her next three starts for trainer Saffie Joseph Jr. -- including a 7-furlong optional claimer at Gulfstream in November -- completed 2024 with a runner-up effort in the 7-furlong FTBOA City of Ocala Florida Sire Stakes at Tampa Bay Downs in December. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;R Disaster never finished worse than second in eight starts at 4. Her season was highlighted by a quartet of victories, including Delaware’s Rehoboth Stakes at 6 furlongs and the 6 ½-furlong Gallant Bloom Stakes (G2) at Aqueduct. Additionally, she finished second in the Hurricane Bertie Stakes (G3), Vagrancy Stakes (G3), Honorable Miss Stakes (G2) and Churchill Downs’ Listed Dream Supreme Stakes. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eKicking off her 5-year-old season with a wire-to-wire score while trying to go one better in Gulfstream’s Hurricane Bertie in March, she was third behind Eclatant in Keeneland’s Madison Stakes (G1) in April. Sent off at generous 7-1 odds for her next try while facing top company Derby Week, she rebounded to defeat the talented duo of Ways and Means, Usha and Splendora in the Derby City Distaff (G1) at Churchill Downs. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;Re-opposing Ways and Means in Saratoga’s Ballerina Stakes (G1) on Aug. 29, R Disaster threw in an uncharacteristic flat effort, fading to sixth—beaten 15 ½ lengths by the favorite. She rebounded in her next start, the 6 1/2-furlong Gallant Bloom (G2) at Belmont Park on Oct. 1, by going right to the front in posting a 1 1/4-length victory as the odds-on favorite in the field of five. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;Out of Making Havoc (by Gottcha Gold), R Disaster was bred by Michael O’Farrell Jr. and Ocala Stud, where the 5-year-old’s sire, Awesome Slew, stands at stud. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;R Disaster is owned by a partnership of Averill Racing LLC and Anthony Mattera.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":24,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Ocala Stud \u0026 J. Michael O'Farrell Jr.","uid":"blt6fc4ebf61c487f1e","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt6fc4ebf61c487f1e?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"R Disaster","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Averill Racing LLC (Richard Averill), Madaket Stables, LLC (Sol Kumin) \u0026 ATM Racing (Anthony Mattera)","trainer":"Saffie Joseph Jr.","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"R Disaster","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltebb82b649f78ddec/6ac3b5774bea872748c4f381/Contender_Photo_R_Disaster.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltebb82b649f78ddec/6ac3b5774bea872748c4f381/Contender_Photo_R_Disaster.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltf0689a11ba6900ce","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Practical Joke","damName":"Imply","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"March, 06 2022 00:00:00","age":4,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":"Princess Rooney S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"September, 12 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":225000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Clement L. Hirsch S. Presented by Oak Tree Racing Association","grade":"1","raceDate":"August, 01 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":400000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Santa Margarita S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"May, 30 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Santa Maria S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"April, 19 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"B. Wayne Hughes Beholder Mile S. presented by FanDuel","grade":"1","raceDate":"March, 07 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"La Brea S. presented by Don Julio","grade":"1","raceDate":"December, 28 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Bayakoa S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"November, 30 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"Lexus Raven Run S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"October, 18 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":400000,"positionAtFinish":9},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Longines Kentucky Oaks","grade":"1","raceDate":"May, 02 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":1500000,"positionAtFinish":13},{"trackName":"OAKLAWN PARK","raceName":"Fantasy S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"March, 29 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":750000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"FAIR GROUNDS","raceName":"Fasig-Tipton Silverbulletday S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"January, 18 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":150000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"FAIR GROUNDS","raceName":"Letellier Memorial S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"December, 21 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":6,"earnings":299750,"show":1,"win":1,"place":2,"showP":"17","winP":"17","placeP":"33"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":202260,"show":1,"win":1,"place":2,"showP":"20","winP":"20","placeP":"40"},"lifetime":{"starts":12,"earnings":565010,"show":2,"win":3,"place":4,"showP":"17","winP":"25","placeP":"33"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"20","winsP":"20","placesP":"40","starts":5,"earnings":202260,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":1,"places":2},{"showsP":"17","winsP":"17","placesP":"33","starts":6,"earnings":299750,"racingYear":2025,"shows":1,"wins":1,"places":2}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eSimply Joking launched her career the right way, winning two Fair Grounds stakes before finishing a close-up second behind Grade 1-placed Quietside in last year’s Fantasy Stakes (G2) at Oaklawn Park. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWell beaten in both the Kentucky Oaks (G1) and Raven Run Stakes (G2), the Pennsylvania-bred rounded out her sophomore campaign with a second to Hope Road in the 1-mile Bayakoa Stakes (G3) at Del Mar before finishing third in Santa Anita’s 7-furlong La Brea Stakes (G1). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAfter kicking off her 4-year-old campaign with a fourth in the Beholder Mile (G1) in March, Simply Joking ran away to a 6 ¾-length front-running score in the 1 1/16-mile Santa Maria (G3) at Santa Anita in April. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eReturning to Arcadia for the May 30 Santa Margarita Stakes (G2), the bay filly was second to Om N Joy before finishing third behind Eunomia and Om N Joy next time out in Del Mar’s Clement L. Hirsch Stakes (G1) on Aug. 1. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCutting back to 7 furlongs for the Sept. 12 Princess Rooney (G3), a “Win and You’re In” for the Breeders’ Cup Filly \u0026amp; Mare Sprint (G1), Simply Joking was second best, beaten 1 ½ lengths by winner Kerry’s Kiss. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSimply Joking is trained by Michael McCarthy, already a two-time winner at the World Championships.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":14,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Barlar, LLC","uid":"blt4f3c0f4f5db50441","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt4f3c0f4f5db50441?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Simply Joking","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Grantley Acres (Geoff Nixon), Ryan Conner, Berkels0813, LLC (Ed Schabel) \u0026 CMNWLTH, LLC (Chase Chamberlin)","trainer":"Michael W. McCarthy","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Simply Joking","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt1e7d2f5018a4c8e1/6ad23f02ea4732fc293109b4/Contender_Photo_Simply_Joking.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt1e7d2f5018a4c8e1/6ad23f02ea4732fc293109b4/Contender_Photo_Simply_Joking.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltf0689a11ba6900ce","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Audible","damName":"Miss Freeze","sex":"Mare","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"January, 27 2021 00:00:00","age":5,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Fasig-Tipton Locust Grove S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"September, 12 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":400000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"MONMOUTH PARK","raceName":"Molly Pitcher S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"July, 18 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":500000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Shawnee S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"May, 30 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Derby City Distaff S. presented by Ford","grade":"1","raceDate":"May, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":1000000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"B. Wayne Hughes Beholder Mile S. presented by FanDuel","grade":"1","raceDate":"March, 07 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"D. Wayne Lukas S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"February, 07 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"PNC Bank Breeders' Cup Filly \u0026 Mare Sprint","grade":"1","raceDate":"November, 01 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":1000000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Tranquility Lake S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 01 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 24 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":84000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Santa Margarita S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"May, 25 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Santa Maria S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"April, 19 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Santa Monica S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"February, 01 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"La Brea S. presented by Don Julio","grade":"1","raceDate":"December, 26 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"November, 17 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":55000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"October, 20 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":54000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"December, 29 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":65000,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":6,"earnings":722400,"show":0,"win":3,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"33"},"breedersCup":{"starts":1,"earnings":520000,"show":0,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"currentYear":{"starts":6,"earnings":982900,"show":0,"win":5,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"83","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":16,"earnings":1843700,"show":0,"win":10,"place":4,"showP":"0","winP":"63","placeP":"25"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"83","placesP":"0","starts":6,"earnings":982900,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":5,"places":0},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"33","starts":6,"earnings":722400,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":3,"places":2}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eSplendora, winner of the PNC Bank Filly \u0026amp; Mare Sprint (G1) last fall at Del Mar, has developed into a legitimate two-turn threat eyeing this year’s Longines Breeders’ Cup Distaff (G1) at Keeneland. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMaryland-bred Splendora was a powerful 4 ¾-length winner of the Filly \u0026amp; Mare Sprint for Hall of Famer Bob Baffert and has been near-perfect this year. Campaigned by By Talla Racing and a newer player in Boyd Racing, which bought in this winter, she won the D. Wayne Lukas Stakes (G2) at 7 furlongs and B. Wayne Hughes Beholder Mile (G1) before a blip when fourth in the Derby City Distaff (G1). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShe quickly rebounded with three wins at 1 1/6 miles – besting champion Immersive in the Shawnee Stakes (G2) at Churchill Downs, then romping by 5 ½ lengths in the Molly Pitcher Stakes (G2) at Monmouth Park before posting a wire-to-wire 5 1/4-length victory in the Sept. 12 Locust Grove (G2) at Churchill Downs. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIf Splendora wins the Distaff, she would become just the eighth horse to win two different races at the Breeders' Cup. She would join a group including Hall of Famers Zenyatta, who won the 2008 Distaff (then known as the Ladies Classic) and 2009 Classic; and Beholder, who won the 2012 Juvenile Fillies, then the Distaff in 2013 and 2016. \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":34,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"The Elkstone Group LLC","uid":"blt123292bc8d55e405","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt123292bc8d55e405?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Splendora","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Boyd Racing, LLC (Randy Boyd) \u0026 By Talla Racing, LLC, (David M. Talla)","trainer":"Bob Baffert","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Splendora","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt19dc82730431bd95/6a7373c4a20f984c96dee4ee/Contender_Photo_Splendora.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt19dc82730431bd95/6a7373c4a20f984c96dee4ee/Contender_Photo_Splendora.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltf0689a11ba6900ce","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":true,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Sharp Azteca","damName":"So Sweetitiz","sex":"Mare","color":"Gray or Roan","foalingDate":"February, 26 2020 00:00:00","age":6,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Rancho Bernardo S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"August, 16 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"LOS ALAMITOS RACE COURSE","raceName":"Great Lady M S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"July, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Rancho Bernardo H.","grade":"3","raceDate":"August, 24 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"LOS ALAMITOS RACE COURSE","raceName":"Great Lady M S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"July, 05 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Chillingworth S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 05 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Rancho Bernardo H.","grade":"3","raceDate":"August, 25 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"LOS ALAMITOS RACE COURSE","raceName":"Great Lady M S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"July, 06 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Beholder Mile S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"March, 09 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"February, 02 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":67000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Las Flores S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"January, 01 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 02 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":120000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":180000,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":180000,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":11,"earnings":847200,"show":1,"win":9,"place":0,"showP":"9","winP":"82","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":180000,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":180000,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eA debut winner for trainer Michael McCarthy at Churchill Downs in her sole start at\u0026nbsp;3,\u0026nbsp;Sweet Azteca won four of six starts at 4, including four consecutive victories in Southern California.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHer 4-year-old campaign kicked off with a wire-to-wire score over favored Adare Manor in the Beholder Mile Stakes (G1) at Santa Anita. Cut back in trip for the Great Lady M. Stakes (G2) at Los Alamitos, the gray once again proved too good for her competition, scoring by 5\u0026nbsp;lengths while\u0026nbsp;establishing\u0026nbsp;a stakes record of 1:14.33 for 6 ½ furlongs.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Kentucky-bred filly concluded the year with a gaudy 7-length score in the Rancho Bernardo Handicap (G3) at Del Mar that summer before fading to finish last of four—beaten 8 ¾ lengths by One Magic Philly as the 1-10 favorite -- in Santa Anita’s Chillingworth Stakes (G3) in the fall.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGiven plenty of time for her 5-year-old return after joining trainer Richard Baltas, the filly was installed the 7-2 second choice behind\u0026nbsp;Kopion\u0026nbsp;while trying to defend her title in the 2025 renewal of the Great Lady M., and she looked like her old self, wiring the field and defeating the 1-5 favorite by 1 ½ lengths at the wire. In victory, she bettered her\u0026nbsp;previous\u0026nbsp;stakes mark winning in 1:14.32. She followed up that victory with a repeat score in the Rancho Bernardo to close her 2025 campaign.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHer 6-year-old campaign began as a mirror image of her 5-year-old campaign with a geared-down 1 1/4-length victory in the Great Lady M. on July 4 followed by a 4 3/4-length victory in the Rancho Bernardo on Aug. 16 in which she swept past the pacesetting Thermal at the top of the stretch and won in geared-down fashion.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSweet Azteca is a daughter of Sharp Azteca, winner of the 2017 Cigar Mile Handicap (G1)\u0026nbsp;and a third generation homebred for Pamela Cee Ziebarth. Sweet Azteca is out of the Grand Slam mare So\u0026nbsp;Sweetitiz, herself\u0026nbsp;a two-time stakes winner for Ziebarth.\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":10,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Pamela Cee Ziebarth","uid":"blt19b8648719084127","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt19b8648719084127?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Sweet Azteca","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Pamela C. Ziebarth","trainer":"Richard Baltas","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Sweet Azteca","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltce1a1c6ce5aa009b/6a73753c0c5aa9bda2f872f5/Contender_Photo_Sweet_Azteca.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltce1a1c6ce5aa009b/6a73753c0c5aa9bda2f872f5/Contender_Photo_Sweet_Azteca.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltf0689a11ba6900ce","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":true,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Practical Joke","damName":"Strong Incentive","sex":"Mare","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"March, 23 2021 00:00:00","age":5,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Resorts World Casino Ballerina S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"August, 29 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":500000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Bed o' Roses S. Presented by Boldyn Networks","grade":"2","raceDate":"June, 05 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Derby City Distaff S. presented by Ford","grade":"1","raceDate":"May, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":1000000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Bed o' Roses S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"June, 06 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Derby City Distaff S. presented by Kendall-Jackson Winery","grade":"1","raceDate":"May, 03 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":1000000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"PNC Bank Breeders' Cup Filly \u0026 Mare Sprint","grade":"1","raceDate":"November, 02 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":1000000,"positionAtFinish":5},{"trackName":"BELMONT AT THE BIG A","raceName":"Gallant Bloom S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"September, 29 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":250000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Test S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"August, 03 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":500000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 06 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":110000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Longines Kentucky Oaks","grade":"1","raceDate":"May, 03 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":1500000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":"Gulfstream Park Oaks","grade":"2","raceDate":"March, 30 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":250000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Spinaway S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 03 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 06 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":136500,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":260500,"show":1,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"50","winP":"50","placeP":"0"},"breedersCup":{"starts":1,"earnings":30000,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"0","placeP":"0"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":640000,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"33"},"lifetime":{"starts":13,"earnings":1637500,"show":1,"win":7,"place":3,"showP":"8","winP":"54","placeP":"23"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"67","placesP":"33","starts":3,"earnings":640000,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":1},{"showsP":"50","winsP":"50","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":260500,"racingYear":2025,"shows":1,"wins":1,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eWays and Means, an eye-catching 12 ¾ length-debut winner in a 6-furlong test at Saratoga in 2023, finished a close-up second in that season’s Spinaway Stakes (G1). Shelved for the remainder of her juvenile campaign, the Chad Brown-trained filly was runner-up behind subsequent Alabama Stakes (G1) winner Power Squeeze in her 3-year-old debut in the Gulfstream Park Oaks (G2) before coming home fourth -- beaten 10 ½ lengths -- by ultimate divisional champion Thorpedo Anna in a sloppy renewal of the Kentucky Oaks (G1) at Churchill Downs. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShe reeled off three consecutive victories in New York halfway through the 2024 racing season, including a 2 ½-length score in a muddy edition of Saratoga’s Test Stakes (G1) followed by a win in the 6 ½-furlong Gallant Bloom Stakes (G2) during the Belmont at the Big A meet that fall. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eInstalled the 2-1 favorite for the 2024 PNC Bank Breeders’ Cup Filly \u0026amp; Mare Sprint (G1) at Del Mar in November, Ways and Means came home fifth behind ultimate Eclipse champion sprint mare Soul of an Angel. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith only two starts under her belt in 2025, she was third behind Kopion and Hope Road in a soggy edition of the 7-furlong Derby City Distaff Stakes (G1) at Churchill Downs in May. The setback was temporary, however, and she was installed the 1-2 choice to return to the winner’s circle in Saratoga’s Bed o’ Roses Stakes (G2) one month later. Coming from just off the pace in the 7-furlong test, the Kentucky-bred cruised home a 7 ¾-length winner over subsequent Longines Breeders’ Cup Distaff (G1) heroine Scylla. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMarking her 5-year-old debut in the Derby City Distaff, the bay found R Disaster 2 1/4 lengths too good that day but returned next time to nose out Grand Job in the Bed o’ Roses. Given 12 weeks off following the Bed o’ Roses, Ways and Means returned in spectacular fashion at Saratoga in the 7-furlong Ballerina (G1) when she took the lead at the head of the stretch and drew off for a 5 1/2-length victory. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCampaigned by her breeder Seth Klarman’s Klaravich Stables, Ways and Means is by three-time Grade 1 winner Practical Joke, who was co-owned by Klaravich and William Lawrence and trained by Brown. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAlso campaigned by Klarman and Lawrence and conditioned by Brown, Ways and Means’ stakes-winning dam Strong Incentive (Warrior’s Reward) produced three graded stakes winners, including Grade 3 scorer Highly Motivated and Grade 1 winner Surge Capacity.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":12,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Klaravich Stables","uid":"blt3eea62975dbf06e5","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt3eea62975dbf06e5?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Ways and Means","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Klaravich Stables, Inc. (Seth Klarman)","trainer":"Chad C. Brown","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Ways and Means","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt3665856c00024437/688b7d16b688147c8ffe26ad/Contender_Photo_Ways_and_Means_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt3665856c00024437/688b7d16b688147c8ffe26ad/Contender_Photo_Ways_and_Means_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltf0689a11ba6900ce","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":true,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""}]},{"uid":"bltc3fc513333460ff5","raceName":"Breeders' Cup Filly \u0026 Mare Turf","raceDetails":{"type":"World Championships","bcType":"Filly \u0026 Mare Turf","sponsor":[{"title":"Maker's Mark","redirectUrl":"https://www.breederscup.com/races/2026-filly-mare-turf","label":"Presented by","logos":{"color":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt870d9a995f7b53a7/6296284fc040564c458527ee/MarkersMark5.31.svg","alt":""},"white":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt0f6031cb5fc81051/6366aefc2d2a144cc904a243/makers-mark-logo-ko-race-banner.png"},"black":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt870d9a995f7b53a7/6296284fc040564c458527ee/MarkersMark5.31.svg","alt":""}},"sponsoredUrls":[],"sponsoredSection":""}],"sponsorLogo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt870d9a995f7b53a7/6296284fc040564c458527ee/MarkersMark5.31.svg","alt":""},"date":"2026-10-31T19:04:00.000Z","priorYearChampionPhoto":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt1c78ef822f26a1a3/69247cd211bd457b804c6fce/Filly_\u0026_Mare_Turf_-_Gezora.jpg"},"displayPostTime":true,"isCompleted":false,"isLive":false,"purse":"$2,000,000","distance":"1 3/16 Miles","grade":1,"ageV2":"3+","division":"Maker’s Mark Filly \u0026 Mare Turf","exacta":"","trifecta":"","superfecta":"","superHighFive":"","dailyDouble":"","pick3":"","pick4":"","pick5":"","pick6":"","region":""},"isTvScheduled":true,"broadcast":{"partners":[{"logo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltceb0312138059807/632b128204361d715f5522c1/USA_Network-Logo-SVGs_146x60-USA.svg"},"time":""},{"logo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt29c35e9a30ccbba3/68d1ca298c48984dc7622c30/22-BC-162_New-BCcom_Network-Logo-SVGs_146x60-v1-05-Peacock.svg"},"time":""}]},"trackDetails":[{"uid":"bltc1d1c6b40525bf04","details":{"name":"Keeneland","logo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt276fb8147db83742/629e62383d4e745ed3ae5859/keeneland.png"},"image":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltb0b7768e84d44449/614ce97164c8007a9bdec19c/Keeneland_Track_Image.jpeg"},"locationBcbc":"Keeneland","timeZone":-4}}],"raceDescription":"\u003ch1\u003eA\u0026nbsp;career\u0026nbsp;defining\u0026nbsp;moment\u0026nbsp;for\u0026nbsp;international\u0026nbsp;stars.\u003cbr /\u003e\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe world's best female grass horses compete in the Maker's Mark Breeders' Cup Filly \u0026amp; Mare Turf. This race is contested around two turns on the turf course for a $2 million purse. Keep an eye on the international contenders in this race as more than half of the winners of Filly \u0026amp; Mare Turf have come from overseas.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","surface":"","bettingCtaOverride":{"cta":[]},"horseType":"pre-entries","horses":[{"sireName":"Laoban","damName":"The Nightingale","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"February, 06 2022 00:00:00","age":4,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"First Lady S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":800000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"KENTUCKY DOWNS","raceName":"Resolute Racing Kentucky Downs Ladies Turf S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"September, 05 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":1500000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Shuvee S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"July, 24 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":250000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Ogden Phipps S. Presented by Ford","grade":"1","raceDate":"June, 05 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":500000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Fasig-Tipton La Troienne S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"May, 01 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":1000000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"B. Wayne Hughes Beholder Mile S. presented by FanDuel","grade":"1","raceDate":"March, 07 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"FAIR GROUNDS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"January, 09 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":56000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"DK Horse Acorn S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"June, 06 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":500000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Longines Kentucky Oaks","grade":"1","raceDate":"May, 02 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":1500000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"TURFWAY PARK","raceName":"Bourbonette Oaks","grade":" ","raceDate":"March, 22 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"FAIR GROUNDS","raceName":"Fasig-Tipton Rachel Alexandra S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"February, 15 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"FAIR GROUNDS","raceName":"Fasig-Tipton Silverbulletday S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"January, 18 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":150000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"AQUEDUCT","raceName":"Demoiselle S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"December, 07 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":250000,"positionAtFinish":7},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"November, 15 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":127000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"October, 18 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":110000,"positionAtFinish":8},{"trackName":"EVANGELINE DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 05 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":30000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":404560,"show":2,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"40","winP":"20","placeP":"20"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":7,"earnings":1260150,"show":2,"win":2,"place":2,"showP":"29","winP":"29","placeP":"29"},"lifetime":{"starts":16,"earnings":1710985,"show":4,"win":4,"place":4,"showP":"25","winP":"25","placeP":"25"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"29","winsP":"29","placesP":"29","starts":7,"earnings":1260150,"racingYear":2026,"shows":2,"wins":2,"places":2},{"showsP":"40","winsP":"20","placesP":"20","starts":5,"earnings":404560,"racingYear":2025,"shows":2,"wins":1,"places":1}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eIn her first try on the grass plus her first time on a course with an unconventional layout, Bless the Broken became a first-time graded stakes winner by defeating a quality field in the 1-mile Ladies Turf (G2) at Kentucky Downs Sept. 5. It was also the 4-year-old dark bay filly's first win for Qatar Racing owner Sheikh Fahad Al Thani since he and his partners bought her for $950,000 at the 2025 Keeneland Fall Mixed sale and sent her to trainer Brad Cox. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn five previous 2026 starts for her current connections, Bless the Broken recorded three Grade 1 placings that include a second in the Beholder Mile (G1) on Santa Anita's main track March 7, a third in the La Troienne (G1) at Churchill Downs May 1, and a second in the Ogden Phipps (G1) at Saratoga June 5. Leading into her turf debut at Kentucky Downs, she finished fourth in the Shuvee (G2) July 24, also on the Saratoga dirt. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn Oct. 3 she placed third behind potential Maker’s Mark Breeders’ Cup Filly \u0026amp; Mare Turf (G1) competitors Classic Q and Lush Lips (GB) in the First Lady (G1) on the Keeneland green. Overall, Bless the Broken made 14 career starts on the dirt before her successful switch in surface. She is by Laoban out of the Tapit mare The Nightengale and is owned by Qatar Racing, Mountmellick Farm and Hunter Valley Farm. She is slated for the Fasig-Tipton November sale of racing and broodmare prospects.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":10,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Cypress Creek Equine, LLC","uid":"blt7dec016a638c8b65","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt7dec016a638c8b65?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Bless the Broken","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Qatar Racing, LLC (Sheikh Fahad Al Thani), Mountmellick Farm (David Fennelly) \u0026 Hunter Valley Farm (Fergus Galvin)","trainer":"Brad Cox","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Bless the Broken","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blta8098b181108353e/6ace4207cb36193c10dbcd94/Contender_Photo_Bless_the_Broken.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blta8098b181108353e/6ace4207cb36193c10dbcd94/Contender_Photo_Bless_the_Broken.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltc3fc513333460ff5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Blue Point (IRE)","damName":"Mayhem (IRE)","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"March, 06 2022 00:00:00","age":4,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"BetMGM Sun Chariot S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":496494,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"LEOPARDSTOWN","raceName":"Coolmore America Justify Matron S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 12 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":463950,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEAUVILLE","raceName":"Prix Rothschild - F.E.E. - World Pool By PMU","grade":"1","raceDate":"August, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":345999,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"Tattersalls Sceptre Sessions Falmouth S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"July, 10 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":502829,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Duke Of Cambridge S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"June, 17 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":335663,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"GOODWOOD","raceName":"Fitzdares Conqueror Fillies S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":95031,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"BetMGM Sun Chariot S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"October, 04 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":370650,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SANDOWN PARK","raceName":"BetMGM Atalanta S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"August, 30 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":114789,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SANDOWN PARK","raceName":"Coral Distaff","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 05 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":75064,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"NEWBURY","raceName":"Darley Ebf Fillies Novice Stakes (Class 2) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 12 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":54189,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ROYAL WINDSOR","raceName":"British Stallion Studs Ebf Fillies Novice Stakes (Class 2) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 19 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":53104,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SOUTHWELL","raceName":"Weekly Free Bets With Betmgm Extra Maiden Fillies Stakes (Class 3) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 06 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":38724,"positionAtFinish":5}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":6,"earnings":202238,"show":0,"win":3,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"33"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":6,"earnings":1281933,"show":0,"win":6,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":12,"earnings":1484171,"show":0,"win":9,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"75","placeP":"17"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":6,"earnings":1281933,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":6,"places":0},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"33","starts":6,"earnings":202238,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":3,"places":2}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eDuring her 3-year-old campaign in 2025 she knocked on the graded stakes door while racing in Great Britain and this year Juddmonte’s Blue Bolt (IRE) came back even bigger, stronger and better to kick it down. Undefeated in her first five 2026 starts, the imposing daughter of Blue Point (IRE) made her seasonal reappearance at Goodwood May 2 in the Conquerer Fillies Stakes (Listed) and then justified her favoritism in the 1-mile Duke of Cambridge Stakes (G2) with a convincing Royal Ascot win June 17. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAfterward trainer Andrew Balding declared her “a star” and she proved him right next time out, taking another step forward with her brilliant turn of foot as she beat the favored Precise (IRE) to become a first-time G1 winner in the 1-mile Falmouth Stakes at Newmarket July 10. At the wire she was 2 lengths clear under regular jockey Colin Keane, Juddmonte’s No. 1 rider.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlue Bolt got the best of Precise again in the Prix Rothschild (G1) at Deauville on Aug. 2 by getting up in the final yards to prevail by a half-length. In the 1-mile Matron (G1) at Leopardstown on Sept. 12, Blue Bolt hit the front in the upper stretch and drew off for a 2 1/4-length victory.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBlue Bolt, who was unraced as a juvenile, is out of the Whipper mare Mayhem (IRE). She stands to become the fourth Maker’s Mark Filly \u0026amp; Mare Turf winner for Juddmonte, which was victorious with British-breds Banks Hill (2001), Intercontinental (2005), and Midday (2009).\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"C-Squared Investments","uid":"blt5e54407417aa79cd","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt5e54407417aa79cd?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Blue Bolt (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Juddmonte (Fahad Bin Khalid)","trainer":"Andrew Balding","country":{"uid":"blt440e3ce320965a9b","title":"United Kingdom / England","abbreviation":"GBR","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt02676e7705186e63/61aa4e462e86841fa22388f0/united-kingdom.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Blue Bolt","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt0e8713db2572dbd9/6a739f305e874b2ef81afbed/Contender_Photo_Blue_Bolt.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt0e8713db2572dbd9/6a739f305e874b2ef81afbed/Contender_Photo_Blue_Bolt.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltc3