"raceName":"Old Forester Mint Julep S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"May, 30 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":275000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Longines Churchill Distaff Turf Mile S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"May, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":1000000,"positionAtFinish":5},{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 10 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":130000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"TURFWAY PARK","raceName":"My Charmer S. Presented by Claiborne Farm","grade":" ","raceDate":"December, 21 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":250000,"positionAtFinish":7},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"November, 22 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":127000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"October, 10 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":120000,"positionAtFinish":6},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 23 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"LEOPARDSTOWN","raceName":"Al Shiraaa Racing Mutamakina S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"May, 12 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":56567,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"DUNDALK","raceName":"Get Best Odds Guaranteed At BetVictor","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 12 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":13944,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"DUNDALK","raceName":"Irish Stallion Farms EBF Median Auction","grade":" ","raceDate":"December, 06 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":23756,"positionAtFinish":6},{"trackName":"DUNDALK","raceName":"Irish Stallion Farms E.B.F. Fillies","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 29 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":15850,"positionAtFinish":6}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":43874,"show":0,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"33","placeP":"0"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":6,"earnings":192321,"show":1,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"17","winP":"17","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":14,"earnings":297937,"show":3,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"21","winP":"21","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"17","winsP":"17","placesP":"0","starts":6,"earnings":192321,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":1,"places":0},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"33","placesP":"0","starts":3,"earnings":43874,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":1,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eIn her first trip north of the border, 5-year-old Vina Arana (IRE) captured the first stakes victory of her career when she rallied from the back of the pack and rolled down the lane under Adam Beschizza to produce a decisive 4-length win in the Nassau (G2) at Woodbine July 19. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRacing nearly exclusively for trainer Jack Sisterson since coming over from Ireland in the late summer of 2024 after four winless races in her native land, the Nassau was her third overall victory after previously scoring in a maiden special weight and an allowance test. “We always thought she had a performance like this in her,” Sisterson said of the daughter of Make Believe (GB) and the Teofilo (IRE) mare Sunset Dazzle (IRE). \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrior to her win in the Nassau Vina Arana was graded stakes placed when she began her 2026 campaign. In her third start of the year she delivered a third-place effort in the Mint Julep (G3) at Churchill Downs on May 30. Following the Nassau, she stepped up into Grade 1 company, finishing fifth in the Ladies Turf Sprint at Kentucky Downs Aug. 29 and then fourth in the First Lady (G1) at Keeneland Oct. 3. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eVina Arana was privately purchased by Sterling Stables and MHM stables in August 2024. \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":1,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Funcheon Bloodstock LTD","uid":"blt545a6b8bcef7ef56","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt545a6b8bcef7ef56?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Vina Arana (IRE)","jockeyName":"","own