bsp;and\u0026nbsp;female\u0026nbsp;horses,\u0026nbsp;three\u0026nbsp;years\u0026nbsp;old\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;older.\u003c/p\u003e","surface":"","bettingCtaOverride":{"cta":[]},"horseType":"pre-entries","horses":[{"sireName":"Into Mischief","damName":"Bonita Mia","sex":"Colt","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"May, 11 2022 00:00:00","age":4,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"Seoul","raceName":"Korea Sprint","grade":"3","raceDate":"September, 06 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":1040634,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"NIIGATA","raceName":"Ibis Summer Dash","grade":"3","raceDate":"August, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":490416,"positionAtFinish":5},{"trackName":"HAKODATE","raceName":"Seikan S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 27 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":270788,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"NIIGATA","raceName":"Idaten S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 24 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":275110,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"MEYDAN RACECOURSE","raceName":"Dubai Golden Shaheen Sponsored By Nakheel","grade":"1","raceDate":"March, 28 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":2000000,"positionAtFinish":12},{"trackName":"KING ABDULAZIZ RACECOURSE","raceName":"Riyadh Dirt Sprint Presented By Saudi National Bank","grade":"2","raceDate":"February, 14 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":2000000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"NAKAYAMA","raceName":"January S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"January, 18 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":264260,"positionAtFinish":11},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Cygames Breeders' Cup Sprint","grade":"1","raceDate":"November, 01 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":2000000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"KYOTO","raceName":"Fujinomori S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"October, 05 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":283518,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"MEYDAN RACECOURSE","raceName":"Dubai Golden Shaheen Sponsored By Nakheel","grade":"1","raceDate":"April, 05 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":2000000,"positionAtFinish":6},{"trackName":"MEYDAN RACECOURSE","raceName":"Mahab Al Shimaal Sponsored By Emirates.com","grade":"3","raceDate":"March, 01 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":326760,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"CHUKYO","raceName":"Sports Hochi Hai Chukyo Nisai S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"December, 14 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":197876,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KYOTO","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"December, 08 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":99186,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KYOTO","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"November, 02 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":69475,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KYOTO","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"October, 19 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":65158,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"CHUKYO","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 21 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":65158,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"CHUKYO","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 07 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":85303,"positionAtFinish":3}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":4,"earnings":265759,"show":0,"win":0,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"0","placeP":"50"},"breedersCup":{"starts":1,"earnings":100000,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"0","placeP":"0"},"currentYear":{"starts":7,"earnings":428664,"show":1,"win":0,"place":2,"showP":"14","winP":"0","placeP":"29"},"lifetime":{"starts":17,"earnings":927210,"show":2,"win":3,"place":6,"showP":"12","winP":"18","placeP":"35"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"14","winsP":"0","placesP":"29","starts":7,"earnings":428664,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":0,"places":2},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"0","placesP":"50","starts":4,"earnings":265759,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":2}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eThe prophetically named American Stage is headed toward his second start on racing’s grandest stage following his fourth-place effort in last year’s Cygames Breeders’ Cup Sprint (G1) at Del Mar. He is trained by Yoshito Yahagi who also conditions Forever Young -- the 2025 Breeders’ Cup Classic (G1) winner and Eclipse Award champion older dirt male. The two sometimes train in tandem and are expected to join up for a strong gallop when they arrive at Keeneland. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBorn in Kentucky, American Stage was sold to Japanese interests at the 2023 Keeneland September Yearling Sale for $500,000. A year later he made his career debut with a third-place effort in Japan. After two runner-up finishes, he gained his initial victory and soon added two more highlighted by the Chukyo Nisai Stakes to close his 2-year-old season. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Into Mischief colt left Japan to open his 3-year-old campaign last season by finishing second in the Mahab Al Shimaal (Gr. 3) at Meydan Racecourse in Dubai. At the same track on April 5, 2025, American Stage was unplaced in the Dubai Golden Shaheen (G1). He went to the sidelines before resurfacing with a runner-up performance in Japan’s Fujinomori Stakes less than a month before the Sprint. Winless in seven starts this season in Asia and the Middle East, American Stage comes to the Sprint from a runner-up finish in the Korea Sprint (G3) on Sept. 6. \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Spendthrift Farm, LLC","uid":"blt1ce47cca782158a6","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt1ce47cca782158a6?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"American Stage","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Yoshizawa Holdings Co. Ltd (Katsumi Yoshizawa)","trainer":"Yoshito Yahagi","country":{"uid":"bltddddd2aba803f27e","title":"Japan","abbreviation":"JPN","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blta6f52e264bde8855/61aa4c7d55cf14733fc5bc35/japan.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"American Stage","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt0b1d52fd70ea67a3/6ac7f61fa7395ff2adaa4d15/Contender_Photo_American_Stage_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt0b1d52fd70ea67a3/6ac7f61fa7395ff2adaa4d15/Contender_Photo_American_Stage_.jpg"},"c