ngs":530100,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":1,"places":0},{"showsP":"20","winsP":"80","placesP":"0","starts":5,"earnings":547563,"racingYear":2025,"shows":1,"wins":4,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eKentucky-bred T O Elvis added his name to the growing list of Japanese-trained winners of America’s marque races when he captured the Churchill Downs Stakes (G1) on May 2. The victory was the first in a Grade 1 dirt sprint for a Japan-based performer.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe 7-furlong Churchill Downs score was T O Elvis’ fifth consecutive triumph and his first at the Grade 1 level. He then returned to Japan where he previously competed exclusively. His best win among his five\u0026nbsp;victories there\u0026nbsp;was the Capella Stakes (G3) in December. He has not raced since his stateside triumph.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eT O Elvis’ name is believed to be a nod to the late superstar Elvis Presley. (Japan Racing Association rules prohibit clarification of horse names.) The first half of the name reflects owner Tomoya Ozasa’s initials.\u0026nbsp;Per JRA rules, owners can register a name or sound that is used on all of their horses.\u0026nbsp;Ozasa’s\u0026nbsp;choice is T\u0026nbsp;O.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"This is one of the\u0026nbsp;most happiest\u0026nbsp;moments of my life,\" Ozasa told\u0026nbsp;BloodHorse\u0026nbsp;in the Churchill Downs winner's circle. \"This is actually the only Kentucky-bred I have at the moment, but I may need to increase that number.\"\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":10,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Jeff Prunzik \u0026 Melissa Prunzik","uid":"bltf71638cb8cfcc0f1","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltf71638cb8cfcc0f1?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"T O Elvis","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Tomoya Ozasa","trainer":"Daisuke Takayanagi","country":{"uid":"bltddddd2aba803f27e","title":"Japan","abbreviation":"JPN","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blta6f52e264bde8855/61aa4c7d55cf14733fc5bc35/japan.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"T O Elvis","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt2cb37fc230853746/6a736ad5c8b7ac3eb251fc44/Contender_Photo_T_O_Elvis.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt2cb37fc230853746/6a736ad5c8b7ac3eb251fc44/Contender_Photo_T_O_Elvis.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltf6749e738cff0ef2","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Noble Bird","damName":"Circular Rainbow","sex":"Gelding","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"May, 11 2022 00:00:00","age":4,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"Stoll Keenon Ogden Phoenix S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"October, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":400000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 07 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":125000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"TAMPA BAY DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"February, 14 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":55500,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"TAMPA BAY DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"January, 31 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":55500,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"TAMPA BAY DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"December, 24 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":55000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":1,"earnings":35300,"show":0,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":4,"earnings":172875,"show":0,"win":2,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"50"},"lifetime":{"starts":5,"earnings":208175,"show":0,"win":3,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"60","placeP":"40"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"50","starts":4,"earnings":172875,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":2},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":1,"earnings":35300,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":1,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eIn just five starts, bargain-priced Little Thunder has shown big promise. In his stakes debut Oct. 2, the 4-year-old gelding nearly stole the “Win and You’re In” Phoenix Stakes (G2) at Keeneland. Cruising down the middle of the track, Little Thunder drew even with the pacesetter before the victorious Nakatomi stormed through on the rail to win by a length in the final strides. \u0026nbsp; \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOverlooked at the 2023 Ocala Breeders’ Sales October Yearling Sale, Little Thunder was listed as unsold on a final bid of $12,000. Two years later on Christmas Eve at Tampa Bay Downs, Little Thunder won at first asking for his breeder Thomas Equels and co-owner Blazing Meadows Farm of trainer Tim Hamm. On Jan. 31 at the same track, he was second to eventual graded stakes winner Disruptor at the allowance level. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLittle Thunder was clearly the best on Valentine’s Day in capturing a Tampa Bay allowance race. He went to the sidelines until returning with a triumph in a Saratoga allowance test on Labor Day a month before the Phoenix. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLittle Thunder’s sire, Grade 1 winner Noble Bird, holds the Keeneland track record for 1 1/8 miles.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":4,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Thomas Equels","uid":"blt51f55be33797a36a","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt51f55be33797a36a?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Little Thunder","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Blazing Meadows Farm (Timmothy E. Hamm) \u0026 Thomas K. Equels","trainer":"Timothy E. Hamm","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Little Thunder","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt909b4ac65baa6b3c/6ace9b84ea4732ef0f30f5de/Contender_Photo_Little_Thunder.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt909b4ac65baa6b3c/6ace9b84ea4732ef0f30f5de/Contender_Photo_Little_Thunder.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltf6749e738cff0ef2","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":15,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"15","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Vekoma","damName":"Stifled Heiress","sex":"Gelding","color":"Chestnut","foalingDate":"May, 17 2022 00:00:00","age":4,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"Stoll Keenon Ogden Phoenix S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"October, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":400000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Bing Crosby S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"July, 25 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":400000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Aristides S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"May, 30 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":275000,"positionAtFinish":5},{"trackName":"OAKLAWN PARK","raceName":"Count Fleet Sprint H.","grade":"3","raceDate":"April, 11 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":500000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"TAMPA BAY DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"March, 06 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":56500,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Cygames Breeders' Cup Sprint","grade":"1","raceDate":"November, 01 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":2000000,"positionAtFinish":14},{"trackName":"PARX RACING","raceName":"Gallant Bob S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"September, 20 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":400000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CANTERBURY PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 23 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":24000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CANTERBURY PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 23 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":23500,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CANTERBURY PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 29 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":23000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CANTERBURY PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 01 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":23000,"positionAtFinish":5},{"trackName":"TAMPA BAY DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 26 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":53000,"positionAtFinish":5},{"trackName":"TAMPA BAY DOWNS","raceName":"Ocala Breeders' Sales Sophomore S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"March, 30 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":110000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"TAMPA BAY DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"February, 08 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":53000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"TAMPA BAY DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"January, 08 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":53000,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":10,"earnings":281815,"show":1,"win":4,"place":1,"showP":"10","winP":"40","placeP":"10"},"breedersCup":{"starts":1,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"0","placeP":"0"},"currentYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":380757,"show":1,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"20","winP":"40","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":15,"earnings":662572,"show":2,"win":6,"place":1,"showP":"13","winP":"40","placeP":"7"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"20","winsP":"40","placesP":"0","starts":5,"earnings":380757,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"10","winsP":"40","placesP":"10","starts":10,"earnings":281815,"racingYear":2025,"shows":1,"wins":4,"places":1}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eMad House returns to the Cygames Breeders’ Cup Sprint (G1) after finishing unplaced last year at Del Mar. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe prepped this year in the “Win and You’re In” Phoenix Stakes (G2) at Keeneland where he set the pace before being caught in the closing strides to finish third, a length behind winner Nakatomi. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e“We were thinking that if he did run well in this race, we’re going to leave him here for the Breeders’ Cup,” trainer David VanWinkle said a few days before the race. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA repeat at the same venue is a bit of a novelty for Mad House whose past eight starts have been at seven tracks in six states since last summer. He began taking his show on the road last year after winning three straight races at Canterbury Park where VanWinkle is a member of the Hall of Fame. The 4-year-gelding then won the 2025 Gallant Bob Stakes (G2) at Parx. This year he added a Tampa Bay Downs allowance race and Oaklawn Park’s Count Fleet Sprint Handicap (G3) to his win column. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFrom the first crop of Grade 1 winner Vekoma, Mad House was a $47,000 purchase by current owner Jim Thares at the 2024 Ocala Breeders’ Sales Co.’s April 2-year-olds in training sale.\u0026nbsp; \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":6,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Jean White, Wavertree Farm \u0026 SGV Thoroughbreds,LLC","uid":"blt342d5dc0f1b22a5c","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt342d5dc0f1b22a5c?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Mad House","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"James Thares","trainer":"David Van Winkle","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Mad House","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt1de05f82454af001/6ac6a6fca7395f22deaa45d3/Contender_Photo_Mad_House_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt1de05f82454af001/6ac6a6fca7395f22deaa45d3/Contender_Photo_Mad_House_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltf6749e738cff0ef2","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":16,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"16","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Vekoma","damName":"Pray for Leslie","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"February, 24 2022 00:00:00","age":4,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"Myrtlewood S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"October, 25 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"HORSESHOE INDIANAPOLIS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 04 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":32000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ELLIS PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 06 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":71000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 14 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":120000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"KENTUCKY DOWNS","raceName":"Mint Millions Invitational S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"September, 07 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":2000000,"positionAtFinish":7},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Eddie Read S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"July, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":250000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Shoemaker Mile S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"May, 25 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"FanDuel Breeders' Cup Mile Presented by PDJF","grade":"1","raceDate":"November, 01 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":2000000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Del Mar Mile S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"August, 30 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Eddie Read S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"July, 27 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":250000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Shoemaker Mile S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"May, 26 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Frank E. Kilroe Mile S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"March, 01 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":"Pegasus World Cup Turf Invitational S. presented by Qatar Racing","grade":"1","raceDate":"January, 25 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":1000000,"positionAtFinish":12},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Hollywood Derby","grade":"1","raceDate":"November, 30 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Caesars Sportsbook Del Mar Derby","grade":"2","raceDate":"September, 01 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Caesars Sportsbook Oceanside S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 20 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Audubon S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 01 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":275000,"positionAtFinish":6},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"American Turf S. presented by TwinSpires","grade":"2","raceDate":"May, 04 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":600000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"March, 29 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":67000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"February, 24 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":67000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"San Vicente S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"January, 06 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":6}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":374948,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"40","placeP":"20"},"breedersCup":{"starts":1,"earnings":10000,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"0","placeP":"0"},"currentYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":142281,"show":1,"win":0,"place":1,"showP":"20","winP":"0","placeP":"20"},"lifetime":{"starts":15,"earnings":618321,"show":1,"win":3,"place":5,"showP":"7","winP":"20","placeP":"33"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"20","winsP":"0","placesP":"20","starts":5,"earnings":142281,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":0,"places":1},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"40","placesP":"20","starts":5,"earnings":374948,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":1}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eA $130,000 Keeneland September yearling that developed into a $410,000 OBS Spring Sale juvenile purchase, Praying finished worse than second only once in five starts during her 2-year-old campaign. An impressive 7-length winner third time out in a 5 ½-furlong dirt maiden special weight that summer at Horseshoe Indianapolis, the dark bay finished runner-up in the 6-furlong Myrtlewood Stakes at Keeneland that fall.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAt 3, Praying made five starts in total, highlighted by wins in Saratoga’s Prioress Stakes (G3) and Thoroughbred Club of America Stakes (G2) at Keeneland. She rounded out her sophomore campaign with a seventh in the 7-furlong PNC Bank Breeders’ Cup Filly and Mare Sprint (G1) at Del Mar.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMarking her 2026 return with a fourth —10 ½ lengths behind victorious Eclatant — in Keeneland’s 7-furlong Madison Stakes (G1) on April 4. Praying was third in the 6 ½-furlong Vagrancy Stakes (G3) at Aqueduct in May before tiring to a well-beaten sixth behind top choice Ways and Means in the June 5 Bed o’ Roses Stakes (G2) at Saratoga.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCatching a yielding turf course in Saratoga’s Smart and Fancy Stakes (Listed) on Aug. 14, Praying was seventh behind favored Zeitlos.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGoing to the front in this year’s renewal of the TCA, a “Win and You’re In” qualifier for the Filly and Mare Sprint at Keeneland, the daughter of Vekoma went to the front and was outpunched by Evanescence, who earned a neck victory over the 14-1 chance.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePraying is trained by Robbie Medina, a former assistant to Hall of Fame trainer Shug McGaughey.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred by Jeff Kerber, the Kentucky-bred filly is campaigned by American-based construction magnate Maurice Regan’s Newtown Anner Stud Farm.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":5,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Jeff Kerber","uid":"bltc1379c747e25c065","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltc1379c747e25c065?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Praying","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Newtownanner Stud Farm (Samantha Regan)","trainer":"Robert Medina","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Praying","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt5e474c49d20c961d/6ac688370491eb4cf904943a/Contender_Photo_Praying.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt5e474c49d20c961d/6ac688370491eb4cf904943a/Contender_Photo_Praying.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltf6749e738cff0ef2","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":17,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"17","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Midshipman","damName":"Mama Joyce","sex":"Colt","color":"Chestnut","foalingDate":"May, 09 2023 00:00:00","age":3,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":67000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 27 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":60000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 31 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":47000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"February, 06 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":35000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"January, 23 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":36000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"December, 28 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":70000,"positionAtFinish":6}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":1,"earnings":500,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"0","placeP":"0"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":124440,"show":1,"win":4,"place":0,"showP":"20","winP":"80","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":6,"earnings":124940,"show":1,"win":4,"place":0,"showP":"17","winP":"67","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"20","winsP":"80","placesP":"0","starts":5,"earnings":124440,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":4,"places":0},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"0","placesP":"0","starts":1,"earnings":500,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eAn allowance winner who has yet to try stakes company, Liam Smith is fast. Really fast. His eye-catching speed figures in his most recent two races have attracted widespread attention. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThat speed has carried him to four victories while making him popular at the claims box. He gained his initial career victory in January at Santa Anita while making his second start and was claimed for $50,000. Three weeks later he sailed to an 11-length tally in allowance company at the same track. Liam Smith returned to action at Del Mar in July to be third in an allowance test and then romped to a 12-length tally in a sizzling 1:14.35 for 6 ½ furlongs. He was claimed out of that Aug. 27 race for $50,000 by current trainer Peter Miller and Altamira Racing Stable. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn his first start for his new connections, the 3-year-old gelding again flaunted his dazzling speed on Sept. 26 in a Santa Anita allowance race. Liam Smith led throughout to win by 5 ½ lengths in 1:13.90 for 6 ½ furlongs. \u0026nbsp; \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLiam Smith’s sire, Midshipman, won the 2008 Bessemer Trust Breeders’ Cup Juvenile (G1) and was named champion 2-year-old male. The next year he was third in the Breeders’ Cup Dirt Mile (G1). \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Donald R. Dizney, LLC","uid":"blt9236dae10b427979","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt9236dae10b427979?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Liam Smith","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Altamira Racing Stable (Peter Miller), Les Blake \u0026 Jim Hart","trainer":"Peter Miller","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Liam Smith","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltf95ddb156108fd7d/6ad676a57cefb1545cce58b6/Contender_Photo_Liam_Smith_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltf95ddb156108fd7d/6ad676a57cefb1545cce58b6/Contender_Photo_Liam_Smith_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltf6749e738cff0ef2","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":18,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"18","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""}]},{"uid":"bltc81c6f52eeba2605","raceName":"Breeders' Cup Turf Sprint","raceDetails":{"type":"World Championships","bcType":"Turf Sprint","sponsor":[{"title":"Prevagen","redirectUrl":"https://www.breederscup.com/races/2026-turf-sprint","label":"Presented by","logos":{"color":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt47efb23858524918/64bec5527b7f98fdcb9fe9e4/Prevagen-Logo_Color_For-Race-Pages-01-V2-01.svg"},"white":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltc66a1e17dcfcaa54/64bec552645d356a186a351d/Prevagen_Footer-01_v2-01.svg"},"black":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt47efb23858524918/64bec5527b7f98fdcb9fe9e4/Prevagen-Logo_Color_For-Race-Pages-01-V2-01.svg"}},"sponsoredUrls":[],"sponsoredSection":""}],"sponsorLogo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt47efb23858524918/64bec5527b7f98fdcb9fe9e4/Prevagen-Logo_Color_For-Race-Pages-01-V2-01.svg"},"date":"2026-10-31T17:48:00.000Z","priorYearChampionPhoto":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltb9606f1d98c914ed/69247cd2308e5029cd305756/Turf_Sprint_-_Shisospicy.jpg"},"displayPostTime":true,"isCompleted":false,"isLive":false,"purse":"$1,000,000","distance":"5.5 Furlongs","grade":1,"ageV2":"3+","division":"Prevagen Turf Sprint","exacta":"","trifecta":"","superfecta":"","superHighFive":"","dailyDouble":"","pick3":"","pick4":"","pick5":"","pick6":"","region":""},"isTvScheduled":true,"broadcast":{"partners":[{"logo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltceb0312138059807/632b128204361d715f5522c1/USA_Network-Logo-SVGs_146x60-USA.svg"},"time":""},{"logo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt29c35e9a30ccbba3/68d1ca298c48984dc7622c30/22-BC-162_New-BCcom_Network-Logo-SVGs_146x60-v1-05-Peacock.svg"},"time":""}]},"trackDetails":[{"uid":"bltc1d1c6b40525bf04","details":{"name":"Keeneland","logo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt276fb8147db83742/629e62383d4e745ed3ae5859/keeneland.png"},"image":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltb0b7768e84d44449/614ce97164c8007a9bdec19c/Keeneland_Track_Image.jpeg"},"locationBcbc":"Keeneland","timeZone":-4}}],"raceDescription":"\u003ch1\u003eExcitement\u0026nbsp;right\u0026nbsp;out\u0026nbsp;of\u0026nbsp;the\u0026nbsp;gate.\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe\u0026nbsp;Breeders'\u0026nbsp;Cup\u0026nbsp;Turf\u0026nbsp;Sprint,\u0026nbsp;for\u0026nbsp;male\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;female\u0026nbsp;horses\u0026nbsp;three-years\u0026nbsp;of\u0026nbsp;age\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;older, combines\u0026nbsp;both\u0026nbsp;speed\u0026nbsp;and\u0026nbsp;agility\u0026nbsp;for\u0026nbsp;international\u0026nbsp;competitors\u0026nbsp;at\u0026nbsp;5\u0026nbsp;furlongs\u0026nbsp;on\u0026nbsp;the\u0026nbsp;turf\u0026nbsp;course.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","surface":"","bettingCtaOverride":{"cta":[]},"horseType":"pre-entries","horses":[{"sireName":"Maclean's Music","damName":"Katie's Kiss","sex":"Colt","color":"Chestnut","foalingDate":"April, 05 2023 00:00:00","age":3,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"YORK","raceName":"Coolmore City Of Troy Nunthorpe S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"August, 21 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":817842,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Palace Of Holyroodhouse H.","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 19 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":158458,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 28 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":134000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"November, 02 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":61000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Speakeasy S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"October, 04 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"MONMOUTH PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 08 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":52500,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":88100,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"33"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":621859,"show":0,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":6,"earnings":709959,"show":0,"win":5,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"83","placeP":"17"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":3,"earnings":621859,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":3,"places":0},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"67","placesP":"33","starts":3,"earnings":88100,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":1}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eIt was prophetic that Bacio's first win on Aug. 8, 2025 came with international superstar jockey Frankie Dettori aboard. Since then, the Maclean's Music colt has become something of an international star himself, even traveling to the north of England to earn a \"Win and You're In\" spot in the Prevagen Breeders' Cup Turf Sprint (G1). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBacio dueled for the lead in his debut, let his natural speed take over and won by 1 3/4 lengths. Trainer Wesley Ward then shipped to Santa Anita and switched surfaces for the Speakeasy Stakes (Listed) on the turf. He led but was caught late to finish second. Front-running wins at Del Mar and Churchill Downs on the grass followed. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWard then pointed Bacio to Royal Ascot, where he finished first of 27 runners in the Palace of Holyroodhouse Handicap, again leading from the start. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTwo months later, Bacio's international tour took him to York, where he earned the Breeders' Cup spot with a victory in Nunthorpe Stakes (G1). Juan Hernandez, who has ridden Bacio in every race since that first one, peeked back in the final furlong, looking for a challenge that wasn't there. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOut of the Kantharos mare Katie's Kiss, the colt runs for a partnership led by My Racehorse.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Torie Gladwell, Cincinnati Equine, Borrowdale LLC \u0026 Knollwood farm, et al","uid":"blt95ff5be9c26107e7","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt95ff5be9c26107e7?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Bacio","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"MyRacehorse (Michael Behrens), Torie Gladwell, Deja Blu Stables (Michelle Crawford), Jacob Shockley, Valerie B. Dailey, Joshua Hanna \u0026 Josh Messenger","trainer":"Wesley A. Ward","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Bacio","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt60baf163d101df61/6ac1349e4bea8745b8c4ef8e/Contender_Photo_Bacio.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt60baf163d101df61/6ac1349e4bea8745b8c4ef8e/Contender_Photo_Bacio.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltc81c6f52eeba2605","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArti