s":2},{"showsP":"20","winsP":"40","placesP":"0","starts":5,"earnings":327406,"racingYear":2025,"shows":1,"wins":2,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eJoe Shiesty, a 5-year-old gelding by Air Force Blue, has rounded into a dependable turf sprinter with the bonus of recent form at Keeneland, site of the 2026 Breeders' Cup World Championships. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAfter a career debut at Churchill Downs, Joe Shiesty toiled on the Turfway Park all-weather strip during the winter of 2023-24 before returning to the Twin Spires track to win the William Walker Stakes (Listed) during Kentucky Derby (G1) week. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eJoe Shiesty clearly relished his first taste of Keeneland, winning a 5 1/2-furlong sprint by a half-length Oct. 6. After two seconds at Churchill Downs to wrap up 2024, he got a rest, then won the Mighty Beau Stakes (Listed) there in June 2025. Another misfire at Ellis led to another trip to Keeneland, where he finished third in the Woodford Stakes (G2), beaten just a neck and a head. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA springtime return to the Bluegrass found Joe Shiesty fifth in the Shakertown Stakes (G2) but only 1 1/2 lengths back and he confirmed his \"horse for the course\" Keeneland credentials with a win in the Woodford during the fall meeting. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred by Rodney Orr, Joe Shiesty is out of the More Than Ready mare Ready to Unleash.\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":10,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Rodney E Orr","uid":"blt8d4fcf35dde481df","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt8d4fcf35dde481df?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Joe Shiesty","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Foster Family Racing (Eric Foster), Lonnie Reynolds, Vicki Mills \u0026 Donald Coomes","trainer":"Eric Foster","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Joe Shiesty","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blta25c9c7b0ec9ed6b/6ac6ac9b30226445b2bb5655/Contender_Photo_Joe_Shiesty.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blta25c9c7b0ec9ed6b/6ac6ac9b30226445b2bb5655/Contender_Photo_Joe_Shiesty.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltc81c6f52eeba2605","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"More Than Ready","damName":"Trophy Wife","sex":"Gelding","color":"Chestnut","foalingDate":"April, 01 2021 00:00:00","age":5,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KENTUCKY DOWNS","raceName":"Light and Wonder Kentucky Downs Turf Sprint S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"September, 05 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":1750000,"positionAtFinish":7},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Troy S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"August, 09 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Jaipur S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"June, 06 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":500000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"AQUEDUCT","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 25 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":86000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"FAIR GROUNDS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"March, 22 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":55000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"BELMONT AT THE BIG A","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 19 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":90000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 24 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"January, 28 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":89000,"positionAtFinish":5}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":321400,"show":1,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"20","winP":"60","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":8,"earnings":389850,"show":1,"win":4,"place":1,"showP":"13","winP":"50","placeP":"13"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"20","winsP":"60","placesP":"0","starts":5,"earnings":321400,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":3,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eFirst the name: John the Beer Man is named for John Soler, a longtime friend of co-owners Michael Dubb and Michael Caruso. Soler is chairman of the board for Micro Magic, a beverage equipment firm. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThat said, the More Than Ready gelding seemed headed more toward Champagne than the suds after returning in March from a nearly two-year hiatus with a trainer switch from Chad Brown to Rob Atras. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe won that return going 5 1/2 furlongs on the Fair Grounds turf in March, then won again in a 6-furlong turf allowance affair at Aqueduct in April. He showed the way in both races and turned back challengers. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eJohn the Beer Man was out front again in his stakes debut, a tough edition of the Jaipur Stakes (G1) June 6 at Saratoga, but this time couldn't hold off divisional stars Reef Runner and Ag Bullet, finishing third, just three-quarters of a length back of the winner. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAnother pacesetting effort in the Troy Stakes (G2) at Saratoga ended in a rough finish with John the Beer Man first by a head. Despite claims of foul among the top three finishers, John the Beer Man was acquitted by the stewards, earning his first stakes win. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eJohn the Beer Man was favored in his next start, the Kentucky Downs Turf Sprint (G2) going 6 furlongs but never threatened in finishing seventh of 11 beaten 4 lengths.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":10,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Phipps Stable","uid":"bltb89a9886767b2b3d","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltb89a9886767b2b3d?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"John the Beer Man","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Michael Dubb and Michael J. Caruso","trainer":"Rob Atras","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"John the Beer Man","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt066b4f2606950937/6ac13e1b3022640287bb3f39/Contender_Photo_John_the_Beer_Man_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt066b4f2606950937/6ac13e1b3022640287bb3f39/Contender_Photo_John_the_Beer_Man_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltc81c6f52eeba2605","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Duramente (JPN)","damName":"Atab (IRE)","sex":"Horse","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"March, 07 2020 00:00:00","age":6,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"NAKAYAMA","raceName":"Sprinters S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 27 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":2059827,"positionAtFinish":14},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Queen Elizabeth II Jubilee S.","grade":"1",