 the sprinting ranks in late 2026 after changing hands at Tattersalls' Online Pop-Up sale in mid-2025. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Cotai Glory (GB) filly did not sell at the Goffs UK Breeze-Ups in April 2025 but returned to the shelf online after winning her debut at Redcar May 26. Off that effort, she sold for a huge multiple of her previous asking price. Tattersalls touted the sequence as proof of the value of the online system. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe filly, out of the Wootton Bassett (GB) mare Rosie Bassett (GB), went to Dubai to open 2026, showing promise without a breakthrough effort. Back in England, she started to make progress, finishing seventh, then third, in handicaps at Royal Ascot in June and Goodwood in July. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShe found the key Aug. 19 at York, defeating 18 rivals. Stepped up to a Group 3 event at Newbury a month later, she won again, with well-fancied Starlust (GB) fourth. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShe then struck at the top level Oct. 4 at Longchamp, winning the Prix de l'Abbaye de Longchamp (G1) by a neck from the favorite, Shiri (FR).\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Tally Ho Stud","uid":"blt9e64755844059630","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt9e64755844059630?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Miss Yechance (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Al Leith Racing","trainer":"Karl Burke","country":{"uid":"blta32e5b692b12a246","title":"Ireland","abbreviation":"IRE","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt613f9a736c40223a/61aa4c2b2f8b9e70946988d3/ireland.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Miss Yechance","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltfb94495005f72476/6ac25781cd0bd946e8d4eabc/Contender_Photo_Miss_Yechance.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltfb94495005f72476/6ac25781cd0bd946e8d4eabc/Contender_Photo_Miss_Yechance.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltc81c6f52eeba2605","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Tale of Ekati","damName":"Internal Bourbon","sex":"Gelding","color":"Chestnut","foalingDate":"February, 28 2020 00:00:00","age":6,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"TAMPA BAY DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"March, 12 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":28000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"TAMPA BAY DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"February, 17 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":28000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"TAMPA BAY DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"January, 28 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":28000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"TAMPA BAY DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"December, 21 2022 00:00:00","purseUsa":28000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"Tattersalls Online Royal Lodge S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"September, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":165562,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"TAMPA BAY DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"December, 03 2022 00:00:00","purseUsa":15000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"PIMLICO","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 24 2022 00:00:00","purseUsa":51440,"positionAtFinish":8},{"trackName":"CURRAGH","raceName":"Goffs Vincent OBrien National S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 13 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":463932,"positionAtFinish":7},{"trackName":"YORK","raceName":"Tattersalls Acomb S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"August, 19 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":236813,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"GOODWOOD","raceName":"Coral Vintage S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"July, 28 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":265771,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"Rossdales British Ebf Maiden Stakes (Class 3)","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 11 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":28143,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CURRAGH","raceName":"Keadeen Hotel Irish E.B.F.","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":28426,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":7,"earnings":19488,"show":1,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"14","winP":"0","placeP":"0"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":7,"earnings":1273670,"show":1,"win":4,"place":1,"showP":"14","winP":"57","placeP":"14"},"lifetime":{"starts":34,"earnings":1525023,"show":4,"win":11,"place":8,"showP":"12","winP":"32","placeP":"24"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"14","winsP":"57","placesP":"14","starts":7,"earnings":1273670,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":4,"places":1},{"showsP":"14","winsP":"0","placesP":"0","starts":7,"earnings":19488,"racingYear":2025,"shows":1,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003ePossiblemente seems to be aging like a fine wine. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Tale of Ekati gelding, now 6, spent his first three years contesting optional claiming and starter allowance events, mainly in Florida but with occasional forays up the East Coast. He was a success at that level, too, missing a top-three finish in only four of 20 starts. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe went into a year-long slump in 2025. After unsuccessful swings at graded stakes at Tampa Bay Downs and Woodbine, he was back in the optional claiming ranks but could muster only one third-place finish from five starts. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe revived with two wins at Turfway Park, finished fifth in the Twin Spires Turf Sprint (G2) at Churchill Downs on Derby Day and followed that with a victory in the Jacques Cartier (G3) at Woodbine on thr all-weather surface and a second in the Harvey Pack Stakes (Listed) going 5 1/2 furlongs on the Saratoga turf. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThat was more than enough for trainer Joe Sharp to put Possiblemente in the $1.75 million Kentucky Downs Turf Sprint (G1) Sept. 5. After tracking the speed in that, he shot to the front and edged away to win by 1 1/4 lengths, earning a \"Win and You're In\" spot in the Prevagen Breeders' Cup Turf Sprint (G1).\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":6,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Charles Fipke","uid":"bltf7f41f40e154f12c","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltf7f41f40e154f12c?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Possiblemente","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"T and E Racing (Taylor A. Logan)","trainer":"Joe Sharp","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Possiblemente","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt642c82786d73daac/6aa1a7057f53141ffec64af3/Contender_Photo_Possiblemente.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt642c82786d73daac/6aa1a7057f53141ffec64af3/Contender_Photo_Possiblemente.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltc81c6f52eeba2605","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Karakontie (JPN)","damName":"Redmeansgo","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"February, 23 2022 00:00:00","age":4,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"COLONIAL DOWNS","raceName":"Andy Guest S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 01 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":150000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Intercontinental S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"June, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":250000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 29 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":134000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"MONMOUTH PARK","raceName":"Blue Sparkler S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 12 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":102000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"LAUREL PARK","raceName":"Stormy Blues S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 15 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"LAUREL PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 25 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":47900,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 11 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":110000,"positionAtFinish":7},{"trackName":"TAMPA BAY DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"March, 08 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":53000,"positionAtFinish":3}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":112135,"show":1,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"20","winP":"40","placeP":"20"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":303892,"show":0,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":8,"earnings":416027,"show":1,"win":5,"place":1,"showP":"13","winP":"63","placeP":"13"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":3,"earnings":303892,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":3,"places":0},{"showsP":"20","winsP":"40","placesP":"20","starts":5,"earnings":112135,"racingYear":2025,"shows":1,"wins":2,"places":1}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eRoja didn't show much in her first two starts on dirt in early 2025, finishing third at Tampa Bay Downs and sixth at Keeneland. But when trainer Graham Motion put the Karakontie (JPN) filly on the turf at Laurel Park in May, she perked right up, taking command in the stretch en route to a 4 1/4-length victory. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShe looked well on her way to a repeat win the following month in the Blue Sparkler Stakes at Laurel but was nailed in the final strides, settling for second by a nose. She rebounded in July at Monmouth Park, winning the Blue Sparkler Stakes by 3 1/2 lengths. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAfter nine months on the sidelines, Motion brought Roja back in April at Churchill Downs, where she battled for the lead in a tough allowance race, shook free in the stretch run and held on to win by 1 length. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe competition got even tougher in her next start, the June 4 Intercontinental (G2) at Saratoga but she again led the way and scored by 1 1/4 lengths. She kept right on rolling Aug. 1 at Colonial Downs, winning the Andy Guest Stakes by a half-length. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRoja is owned by Eclipse Thoroughbred Partners and Madaket Stables LLC.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":6,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"C. Kidder","uid":"bltb4878ddf5e9f33de","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltb4878ddf5e9f33de?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Roja","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Eclipse Thoroughbred Partners (Aron Wellman) \u0026 Madaket Stables, LLC (Sol Kumin)","trainer":"H. Graham Motion","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Roja","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltcfd6e42928a2e294/6a7a4065ef5bef6ed84f932c/Contender_Photo_Roja.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltcfd6e42928a2e294/6a7a4065ef5bef6ed84f932c/Contender_Photo_Roja.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltc81c6f52eeba2605","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Mitole","damName":"Mischief Galore","sex":"Filly","color":"Gray or Roan","foalingDate":"March, 30 2022 00:00:00","age":4,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Unbridled Sidney S. presented by TwinSpires","grade":"2","raceDate":"May, 01 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":500000,"positionAtFinish":7},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Prevagen Breeders' Cup Turf Sprint","grade":"1","raceDate":"November, 01 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":1000000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KENTUCKY DOWNS","raceName":"AGS Music City S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"September, 06 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":2000000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Commonwealth Cup","grade":"1","raceDate":"June, 20 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":977458,"positionAtFinish":15},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Mamzelle S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"May, 10 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":225000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"FanDuel Limestone S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 11 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"February, 05 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":96000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"OAKLAWN PARK","raceName":"Mockingbird S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"January, 04 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":150000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Fern Creek S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"November, 30 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":225000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"October, 18 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":65000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":7,"earnings":2044645,"show":0,"win":5,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"71","placeP":"14"},"breedersCup":{"starts":1,"earnings":520000,"show":0,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"currentYear":{"starts":1,"earnings":5000,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"0","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":10,"earnings":2095270,"show":1,"win":6,"place":1,"showP":"10","winP":"60","placeP":"10"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"0","placesP":"0","starts":1,"earnings":5000,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"71","placesP":"14","starts":7,"earnings":2044645,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":5,"places":1}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eShisospicy\u0026nbsp;was riding the crest of the wave when she led all the way to a 2 1/2-length victory in the 2025\u0026nbsp;Prevagen\u0026nbsp;Breeders' Cup Turf Sprint (G1).\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe win was the\u0026nbsp;Mitole\u0026nbsp;filly's fifth from six consecutive starts\u0026nbsp;–\u0026nbsp;a string interrupted only by a 15th-place finish in the Commonwealth Cup (G1) at Royal Ascot. The wins included the\u0026nbsp;Mamzelle\u0026nbsp;Stakes\u0026nbsp;(G3) at Churchill Downs and the rich Music City Stakes (G2) at the all-turf, European-style Kentucky Downs, and led to an Eclipse Award as\u0026nbsp;outstanding\u0026nbsp;female sprinter.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Breeders' Cup was\u0026nbsp;Shisospicy's\u0026nbsp;seventh start of 2025. Trainer Jose D'Angelo\u0026nbsp;gave her\u0026nbsp;sixth months of R\u0026amp;R\u0026nbsp;before she returned\u0026nbsp;May 1 in the Unbridled Sidney Stakes (G2) at Churchill Downs, where\u0026nbsp;she faded through the stretch to finish last of seven as the odds-on favorite.\u0026nbsp;Shisospicy\u0026nbsp;is back on the work tab at Saratoga\u0026nbsp;Race Course\u0026nbsp;and is aiming for a title defense in the Breeders’ Cup Turf Sprint.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShisospicy\u0026nbsp;is out of the Into Mischief mare Mischief Galore, winner of three of seven starts for\u0026nbsp;breeders\u0026nbsp;Bill and Corinne Heiligbrodt.\u0026nbsp;Two of the three wins were turf sprints.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Bill Heiligbrodt \u0026 Corinne Heiligbrodt","uid":"blte19b29d9238e35b8","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blte19b29d9238e35b8?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Shisospicy","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Morplay Racing, LLC (Josh Mendez)","trainer":"Jose Francisco D'Angelo","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Shisospicy","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt4e03f012ade35fd7/68c08bcda726cbf041e18786/Contender_Photo_Shisospicy.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt4e03f012ade35fd7/68c08bcda726cbf041e18786/Contender_Photo_Shisospicy.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltc81c6f52eeba2605","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Prince of Lir (IRE)","damName":"Briarfield Lady (IRE)","sex":"Gelding","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"June, 02 2021 00:00:00","age":5,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Eddie D S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"September, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Green Flash H. Presented by Longines","grade":"