Turf Sprint","grade":"1","raceDate":"November, 02 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":1000000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"LONGCHAMP","raceName":"Prix de l'Abbaye de Longchamp Longines","grade":"1","raceDate":"October, 06 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":378855,"positionAtFinish":9},{"trackName":"YORK","raceName":"Coolmore Wootton Bassett Nunthorpe S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"August, 23 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":640328,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"GOODWOOD","raceName":"King George Qatar S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"August, 02 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":405968,"positionAtFinish":6},{"trackName":"YORK","raceName":"John Smiths City Walls S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 13 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":89646,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Commonwealth Cup","grade":"1","raceDate":"June, 21 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":918589,"positionAtFinish":8},{"trackName":"YORK","raceName":"William Hill Extra Place Races Daily Handicap Stakes (Class 2)","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 25 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":63687,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Commonwealth Cup Trial S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"May, 01 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":99935,"positionAtFinish":6},{"trackName":"MEYDAN RACECOURSE","raceName":"Dubai Trophy Presented By DP World","grade":" ","raceDate":"February, 09 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":95305,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"MEYDAN RACECOURSE","raceName":"Al Wasl Stakes Presented By Nakheel","grade":" ","raceDate":"January, 12 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":81690,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Breeders' Cup Juvenile Turf Sprint","grade":"1","raceDate":"November, 03 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":1000000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"Juddmonte Middle Park S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 30 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":355819,"positionAtFinish":5},{"trackName":"KEMPTON PARK","raceName":"Unibet Zero Mission Sirenia S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"September, 09 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":87258,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"YORK","raceName":"Sky Bet Nursery Handicap Stakes (Class 2)","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 23 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":127328,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"GOODWOOD","raceName":"Ire-incentive It Pays To Buy Irish Nursery Handicap Stakes (Class 2)","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 04 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":76253,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"NEWBURY","raceName":"Kka Studio Novice Stakes (Class 4) (Div I)","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 06 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":12704,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CHELMSFORD CITY","raceName":"Ebf Restricted Maiden Stakes (Class 5) (For Horses In Bands B, C And D) (Ebf Restricted Race Qualifier) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 22 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":8808,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"LINGFIELD","raceName":"British Stallion Studs E.B.F. S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 06 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":8207,"positionAtFinish":5}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":52814,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"0","placeP":"0"},"breedersCup":{"starts":2,"earnings":610000,"show":1,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"50","winP":"50","placeP":"0"},"currentYear":{"starts":6,"earnings":207226,"show":0,"win":0,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"0","placeP":"17"},"lifetime":{"starts":27,"earnings":1175177,"show":3,"win":6,"place":4,"showP":"11","winP":"22","placeP":"15"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"0","placesP":"17","starts":6,"earnings":207226,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":1},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"0","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":52814,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eThere's no question that Starlust (GB) seems to like American racing. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe 5-year-old son of Zoustar, trained in England by Ralph Beckett, has visited twice. In 2023 he brought a record of three wins from seven starts to the Breeders' Cup Juvenile Turf Sprint (G1) at Santa Anita and, with Frankie Dettori aboard, outran long odds to finish third, just 1 1/4 lengths behind the winner, Big Evs (IRE). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne year and 10 races later, after stops in Dubai and France, he was back to contest the Prevagen Breeders' Cup Turf Sprint (G1) at Del Mar. Again facing long odds, Starlust found running room between horses in deep stretch to win by a neck over Motorious (GB). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe stayed home and raced only twice in 2025 and the first four starts of his 5-year-old season also all came in England with his best finish coming in the Nunthorpe (G1) at York in which he was runner-up to Bacio on Aug. 21. His next start came Sept. 13 at the Curragh in the Flying Five (G1) in which he finished fourth of 17 in the 5-furlong race. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDespite his success in America, Starlust doesn't seem to benefit from travel. He's winless in two starts in Dubai, finished ninth in one try in France and got home next-to-last of 14 in the Hong Kong Sprint (G1).\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Branton Court Stud LLP","uid":"bltfa97437977ba2f1f","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltfa97437977ba2f1f?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Starlust (GB)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Fitriani Hay","trainer":"Ralph M. Beckett","country":{"uid":"blt440e3ce320965a9b","title":"United Kingdom / England","abbreviation":"GBR","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt02676e7705186e63/61aa4e462e86841fa22388f0/united-kingdom.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Starlust","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt95b2e376f7dd471d/6a95c7ee3481c2c2d58ae24f/Contender_Photo_Starlust.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt95b2e376f7dd471d/6a95c7ee3481c2c2d58ae24f/Contender_Photo_Starlust.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltc81c6f52eeba