:00:00","purseUsa":576838,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"GOODWOOD","raceName":"King George Qatar S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"August, 01 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":418644,"positionAtFinish":5},{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"Al Basti Equiworld, Dubai July Cup S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"July, 12 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":886481,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Commonwealth Cup","grade":"1","raceDate":"June, 20 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":977458,"positionAtFinish":7},{"trackName":"HAYDOCK PARK","raceName":"Betfred Sandy Lane S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"May, 24 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":169249,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Eventmasters.co.uk Commonwealth Cup Trial S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"April, 30 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":107265,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Breeders' Cup Juvenile Turf Sprint","grade":"1","raceDate":"November, 01 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":1000000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"DONCASTER","raceName":"Carlsberg Danish Pilsner Flying Childers S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"September, 13 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":166485,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"YORK","raceName":"Al Basti Equiworld Dubai Gimcrack S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"August, 23 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":320164,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"GOODWOOD","raceName":"Jaeger-Lecoultre Molecomb S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"July, 31 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":128066,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"BEVERLEY","raceName":"Topmark Solutions National Ev Bay-marking Specialist Ebf Maiden Stakes (Class 5) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 06 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":9611,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":7,"earnings":598881,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"29","placeP":"14"},"breedersCup":{"starts":1,"earnings":50000,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"0","placeP":"0"},"currentYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":105836,"show":1,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"20","winP":"20","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":17,"earnings":882734,"show":1,"win":4,"place":3,"showP":"6","winP":"24","placeP":"18"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"20","winsP":"20","placesP":"0","starts":5,"earnings":105836,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":1,"places":0},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"29","placesP":"14","starts":7,"earnings":598881,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":1}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eOn his day, Big Mojo (IRE) can produce a rather impressive effort. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe 4-year-old colt is a son of Mohaather (GB), who won the Summer Mile (G2) at Ascot and the Sussex Stakes (G1) at Goodwood back-to-back before retiring in 2020. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBig Mojo started his account with a win and two seconds from his first four starts in England -- good enough to convince trainer Mick Appleby to ship him to Del Mar for the 2024 Breeders' Cup Juvenile Turf Sprint (G1), where he reported fourth, beaten just 1 length. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe returned to Group 1 competition in the July Cup (G1) at Newmarket in July 2025 and was second, beaten just a neck. Two races later, Big Mojo ascended the heights with a win in the Sprint Cup (G1) at Haydock in September. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe memory of that was short-lived as the colt started 2026 with three disappointing efforts in big races, including a 10th-place showing in a return to the July Cup. He then got his mojo back in time to win the Phoenix Sprint Stakes (G3) at the Curragh in Ireland Aug. 9. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn his next start, a bid to repeat in the Sprint Cup at Haydock, he pressed the pace but faded late to finish third of eight beaten 9 lengths by Almeraq (GB).\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Ringfort Stud Ltd \u0026 The Ladies","uid":"blt6f26d10627b39d11","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt6f26d10627b39d11?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Big Mojo (IRE)","jockeyName"