5,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 23 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":120000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":4,"earnings":164966,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"0"},"breedersCup":{"starts":1,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"0","placeP":"0"},"currentYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":387460,"show":0,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"60","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":9,"earnings":552426,"show":0,"win":5,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"56","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"60","placesP":"0","starts":5,"earnings":387460,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":3,"places":0},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"0","starts":4,"earnings":164966,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eOutfielder is a prototypical Wesley Ward-trained precocious speedster. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Speightstown colt, owned by Amo Racing USA, LLC, Two Eight Racing and his trainer, opened his account with a 6 1/4-length victory in a 5-furlong turf sprint at Churchill Downs May 23, 2025. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWard's normal course at that point would be a quick turnaround to Royal Ascot. Outfielder instead got a break before heading for the Continent, where he finished fourth in the Prix Morny (G1) at Deauville -- a race in which Venetian Sun (IRE) and Gstaad (GB) finished first and second. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBack in North America, he won an allowance race at the Keeneland fall meeting, then headed west to the Breeders' Cup Juvenile Turf (G1), where he led for a half-mile, folded and finished last. Gstaad won. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe colt's 3-year-olds season started with wins in the Animal Kingdom Stakes on the Turfway Park all-weather and the William Walker Stakes (Listed) at Churchill Downs. He did get to Royal Ascot for his next start in the Commonwealth Cup. After racing prominently, he again faded and finished 10th. Venetian Sun won. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBack home, he finished fourth in the Mahoney Stakes (G3) at Saratoga and won an allowance at Keeneland.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"SF Bloodstock LLC","uid":"bltcd95169d042b3ad5","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltcd95169d042b3ad5?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Outfielder","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Amo Racing USA (Kiavaash Joorabchian), Two Eight Racing (Jayson Werth) \u0026 Wesley A. Ward","trainer":"Wesley A. Ward","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Outfielder","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltfbe929da4ba08090/68ed4f9a55fd2753bbd8c1f2/Contender_Photo_Outfielder.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltfbe929da4ba08090/68ed4f9a55fd2753bbd8c1f2/Contender_Photo_Outfielder.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltc81c6f52eeba2605","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":21,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"21","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2025,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Into Mischief","damName":"Bonita Mia","sex":"Colt","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"May, 11 2022 00:00:00","age":4,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"Seoul","raceName":"Korea Sprint","grade":"3","raceDate":"September, 06 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":1040634,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"NIIGATA","raceName":"Ibis Summer Dash","grade":"3","raceDate":"August, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":490416,"positionAtFinish":5},{"trackName":"HAKODATE","raceName":"Seikan S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 27 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":270788,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"NIIGATA","raceName":"Idaten S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 24 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":275110,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"MEYDAN RACECOURSE","raceName":"Dubai Golden Shaheen Sponsored By Nakheel","grade":"1","raceDate":"March, 28 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":2000000,"positionAtFinish":12},{"trackName":"KING ABDULAZIZ RACECOURSE","raceName":"Riyadh Dirt Sprint Presented By Saudi National Bank","grade":"2","raceDate":"February, 14 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":2000000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"NAKAYAMA","raceName":"January S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"January, 18 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":264260,"positionAtFinish":11},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Cygames Breeders' Cup Sprint","grade":"1","raceDate":"November, 01 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":2000000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"KYOTO","raceName":"Fujinomori S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"October, 05 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":283518,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"MEYDAN RACECOURSE","raceName":"Dubai Golden Shaheen Sponsored By Nakheel","grade":"1","raceDate":"April, 05 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":2000000,"positionAtFinish":6},{"trackName":"MEYDAN RACECOURSE","raceName":"Mahab Al Shimaal Sponsored By Emirates.com","grade":"3","raceDate":"March, 01 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":326760,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"CHUKYO","raceName":"Sports Hochi Hai Chukyo Nisai S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"December, 14 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":197876,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KYOTO","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"December, 08 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":99186,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KYOTO","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"November, 02 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":69475,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KYOTO","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"October, 19 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":65158,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"CHUKYO","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 21 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":65158,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"CHUKYO","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 07 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":85303,"positionAtFinish":3}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":4,"earnings":265759,"show":0,"win":0,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"0","placeP":"50"},"breedersCup":{"starts":1,"earnings":100000,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"0","placeP":"0"},"currentYear":{"starts":7,"earnings":428664,"show":1,"win":0,"place":2,"showP":"14","winP":"0","placeP":"29"},"lifetime":{"starts":17,"earnings":927210,"show":2,"win":3,"place":6,"showP":"12","winP":"18","placeP":"35"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"14","winsP":"0","placesP":"29","starts":7,"earnings":428664,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":0,"places":2},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"0","placesP":"50","starts":4,"earnings":265759,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":2}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eThe prophetically named American Stage is headed toward his second start on racing’s grandest stage following his fourth-place effort in last year’s Cygames Breeders’ Cup Sprint (G1) at Del Mar. He is trained by Yoshito Yahagi who also conditions Forever Young -- the 2025 Breeders’ Cup Classic (G1) winner and Eclipse Award champion older dirt male. The two sometimes train in tandem and are expected to join up for a strong gallop when they arrive at Keeneland. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBorn in Kentucky, American Stage was sold to Japanese interests at the 2023 Keeneland September Yearling Sale for $500,000. A year later he made his career debut with a third-place effort in Japan. After two runner-up finishes, he gained his initial victory and soon added two more highlighted by the Chukyo Nisai Stakes to close his 2-year-old season. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Into Mischief colt left Japan to open his 3-year-old campaign last season by finishing second in the Mahab Al Shimaal (Gr. 3) at Meydan Racecourse in Dubai. At the same track on April 5, 2025, American Stage was unplaced in the Dubai Golden Shaheen (G1). He went to the sidelines before resurfacing with a runner-up performance in Japan’s Fujinomori Stakes less than a month before the Sprint. Winless in seven starts this season in Asia and the Middle East, American Stage comes to the Sprint from a runner-up finish in the Korea Sprint (G3) on Sept. 6. \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Spendthrift Farm, LLC","uid":"blt1ce47cca782158a6","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt1ce47cca782158a6?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"American Stage","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Yoshizawa Holdings Co. Ltd (Katsumi Yoshizawa)","trainer":"Yoshito Yahagi","country":{"uid":"bltddddd2aba803f27e","title":"Japan","abbreviation":"JPN","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blta6f52e264bde8855/61aa4c7d55cf14733fc5bc35/japan.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"American Stage","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt0b1d52fd70ea67a3/6ac7f61fa7395ff2adaa4d15/Contender_Photo_American_Stage_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt0b1d52fd70ea67a3/6ac7f61fa7395ff2adaa4d15/Contender_Photo_American_Stage_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"bltc81c6f52eeba2605","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":22,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"22","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Omaha Beach","damName":"Sweet Awakening","sex":"Mare","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"March, 03 2021 00:00:00","age":5,