"purseUsa":350000,"positionAtFinish":9},{"trackName":"OAKLAWN PARK","raceName":"Bathhouse Row S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 19 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 17 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":111600,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"OAKLAWN PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"March, 14 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":130000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"OAKLAWN PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"February, 08 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":110000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":8,"earnings":139747,"show":0,"win":1,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"13","placeP":"25"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":7,"earnings":623892,"show":0,"win":4,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"57","placeP":"14"},"lifetime":{"starts":15,"earnings":763639,"show":0,"win":5,"place":3,"showP":"0","winP":"33","placeP":"20"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"57","placesP":"14","starts":7,"earnings":623892,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":4,"places":1},{"showsP":"0","winsP":"13","placesP":"25","starts":8,"earnings":139747,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":1,"places":2}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eCue the puns and praise Hymn for his victory in the Forego Stakes (G1) at Saratoga on Aug. 29. As a “Win and You’re In” race, Hymn has fees-paid entry into the Breeders’ Cup Dirt Mile (G1). However, trainer Ron Moquett could opt for the Cygames Breeders’ Cup Sprint (G1), especially if Hymn takes Keeneland’s 6-furlong Phoenix Stakes (G2) on Oct. 2, a Breeders’ Cup Challenge Race for the Sprint. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMoquett won the Sprint at Keeneland in 2020 with eventual champion Whitmore, who prepped for the race in the Phoenix four consecutive years. \u0026nbsp; \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHymn won at first asking in early 2025 at Oaklawn Park but had nine straight losses before winning again on April 10 at the same track. In quick succession he captured a Churchill Downs allowance race, took Laurel Park’s Frank J. De Francis Memorial Dash Stakes (Listed) by 5 ½ lengths, was runner-up in the Alfred G. Vanderbilt Stakes (G2) at Saratoga and then won the Forego. After the race when interviewed in the winner’s circle, Moquett credited the reversal of form to having Hymn gelded a few races before the Forego. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHymn was offered at the 2023 Keeneland September Yearling Sale but was listed as unsold on a final bid of $140,000.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":14,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Fleur de Lis Stables","uid":"blt08648a9ea93fa7bc","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt08648a9ea93fa7bc?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Hymn","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Fleur De Lis Stables (Naveed Chowhan), William S. Sparks\u0026 Bret Jones","trainer":"Ron Moquett","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Hymn","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltdb9db9356e5be1ad/6a972a48de239504fee840b5/Contender_Photo_Hymn.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltdb9db9356e5be1ad/6a972a48de239504fee840b5/Contender_Photo_Hymn.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt830ffcd3734ad389","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Collected","dam