(Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 27 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":15464,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 29 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":136500,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":6,"earnings":102263,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"33","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":6,"earnings":102263,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"33","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"33","placesP":"0","starts":6,"earnings":102263,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eSale Shark (IRE) got off on a winning note, defeating Jaijai (GB) by 2 ¾ lengths in a 5-furlong maiden test at Hamilton on May 27 before running a credible fifth in a field of 25 — beaten only 3 ¼ lengths by King Of Cloughan (IRE) -- when stepping up to face black-type company in the 6-furlong Windsor Castle Stakes at Royal Ascot on June 17. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eReturning to listed company next time out, the Irish-bred colt was fifth behind subsequent Gimcrack Stakes (G2) winner Arapaho Gold (IRE) in Newbury’s Rose Bowl Stakes on July 17. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTaking the next step up in Goodwood’s Molecomb Stakes (G3), a Win and You’re In qualifier for the Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf Sprint (G1) at Keeneland, Sale Shark was 4 lengths back in fourth to race favorite Pershaada (IRE) in the 5-furlong test on July 29. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eReceiving a class reprieve in the listed Roses Stakes at York on Aug. 22, he came away a 1 ¼-length winner over favored Adonius (IRE). He stepped back up to Group company at Doncaster on Sept. 11 in the 5-furlong Flying Childers (G2)and finished sixth of 11 but beaten by only 1 ½ lengths. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred by Ballylinch Stud, Sale Shark is by Bayside Boy (IRE), who stands at the Co. Kilkenny stud in Ireland.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Ballylinch Stud","uid":"bltc065d8647478263d","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltc065d8647478263d?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Sale Shark (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Simon Orange, Michael Owen","trainer":"Hugo Palmer","country":{"uid":"blt440e3ce320965a9b","title":"United Kingdom / England","abbreviation":"GBR","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt02676e7705186e63/61aa4e462e86841fa22388f0/united-kingdom.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Sale Shark","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltdc454bc567da3eab/6ac3b7f51cd746936d17c627/Contender_Photo_Sale_Shark.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltdc454bc567da3eab/6ac3b7f51cd746936d17c627/Contender_Photo_Sale_Shark.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt6bf61f758c07022b","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":17,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"17","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Catholic Boy","damName":"Zia","sex":"Gelding","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"April, 05 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"Castle \u0026 Key Bourbon S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"October, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":400000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"COLONIAL DOWNS","raceName":"Kitten's Joy S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 07 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":125000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"HORSESHOE INDIANAPOLIS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 14 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":32000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":112950,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":112950,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"67","placesP":"0","starts":3,"earnings":112950,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003ePopcorn earned consideration for the Brown Advisory Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf (G1) off wins in his first two starts and finished a troubled fourth in a graded stakes most recently.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA Robert LaPenta homebred, Popcorn debuted July 14 at Horseshoe Indianapolis and was fifth early before registering a half-length win in the 7 ½-furlong turf race.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTrainer Jonathan Thomas then targeted the Sept. 7 Kitten’s Joy Stakes at Colonial Downs and Popcorn rallied into contention from sixth and drew off to a 2-length win as the 4-5 favorite.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNext was the Bourbon Stakes (G2) at Keeneland, which offered a free, “Win and You’re In” entry to the Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf through the Breeders’ Cup Challenge Series.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe encountered some traffic issues while trying to rally from ninth and suffered his first defeat while finishing fourth, 3 3/4 lengths behind Agate.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePopcorn is a son of Catholic Boy, who was a Grade 1 winner on dirt and turf for LaPenta and Thomas. He is out of Zia, a daughter of Munnings.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Robert V. LaPenta","uid":"blt5bac5e708732bfcb","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt5bac5e708732bfcb?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Popcorn","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Robert V. La Penta \u0026 Madaket Stables, LLC (Sol Kumin)","trainer":"Jonathan Thomas","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Popcorn","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt0db277dd1cc8fbc7/6ad7cd8b0179ea34622e6896/Contender_Photo_Popcorn.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt0db277dd1cc8fbc7/6ad7cd8b0179ea34622e6896/Contender_Photo_Popcorn.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt6bf61f758c07022b","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":18,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"18","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Mandaloun","damName":"Overseen","sex":"Colt","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"April, 27 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Del Mar Juvenile Turf S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"September, 05 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"HORSESHOE INDIANAPOLIS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":32000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":79200,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":79200,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":79200,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eIn just two starts, Observed has both a perfect record and a graded stakes win to his credit. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA son of Kentucky Derby (G1) winner Mandaloun, Observed showed a promising late kick on turf in his Aug. 4 debut at Horseshoe Indianapolis when he rallied from fifth and posted a three-quarters-of-a-length victory in a 7 ½-furlong maiden race. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThat victory led to a decision to ship to Del Mar, where he again used his late speed to capture the Sept. 5 Del Mar Juvenile Turf Stakes (G3). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSteadied at the start, he was seventh after 6 furlongs in the mile turf stakes and was fifth at the eighth pole. He then surged in the final furlong to prevail by a little less than a length at 6-1 odds. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eObserved was clocked in 1:36.40 on firm turf for the mile. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTrained by Jonathan Thomas, he is owned by Bridlewood Farm, Eclipse Thoroughbred Partners and Robert LaPenta, who also jointly owned classic winners Journalism and Tapwrit. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eObserved was bred by Hartwell Farm in Kentucky out of the First Defence mare Overseen. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe sold for $240,000 at the Keeneland September Yearling Sale.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":4,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Hartwell Farm Inc.","uid":"blt7584fa0e2be1c4ca","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt7584fa0e2be1c4ca?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Observed","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Bridlewood Farm (John C. Malone), Eclipse Thoroughbred Partners (Aron Wellman) \u0026 Robert V. La Penta","trainer":"Jonathan Thomas","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Observed","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt7fe37098b9a3b795/6ac3aa9fe791e04089363884/Contender_Photo_Observed.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt7fe37098b9a3b795/6ac3aa9fe791e04089363884/Contender_Photo_Observed.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt6bf61f758c07022b","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":19,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"19","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Authentic","damName":"Bold Confection","sex":"Colt","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"February, 05 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"Castle \u0026 Key Bourbon S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"October, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":400000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Iroquois S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"September, 12 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"COLONIAL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 10 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":70000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":94275,"show":1,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"33","winP":"33","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":94275,"show":1,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"33","winP":"33","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"33","winsP":"33","placesP":"0","starts":3,"earnings":94275,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":1,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eReal Goodbar has been tested on dirt in a graded stakes but has found the grass is indeed greener for him.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe started his career July 10 at Colonial Downs in a mile turf race and grabbed the lead entering the stretch and drew away to a 3 1/2-length win. He was timed in 1:37.02 for the mile on firm turf.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn Sept. 12, trainer Kenny McPeek opted to run the son of Kentucky Derby (G1) and Breeders’ Cup Classic (G1) winner Authentic on dirt in the Iroquois Stakes (G3), a mile test at Churchill Downs that is part of the Road to the Kentucky Derby series. He finished fourth of seven.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMcPeek then put Real Goodbar back on turf for the Oct. 3 Bourbon Stakes (G2) at Keeneland, site of the Brown Advisory Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf (G1) on Oct. 30.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe rallied wide for third, 2 ½ lengths behind, to stay in contention for the World Championships.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eReal Goodbar is owned by Bayview Stables, Mark Edwards and Mike Trout. He was bred in Kentucky by Louisiana Leasing and Rollins out of the Candy Ride (ARG) mare Bold Confection.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe was purchased for $85,000 at the Keeneland September Yearling Sale.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":2,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Louisiana Leasing, LLC \u0026 Rollins","uid":"bltcad883dabb2599f5","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltcad883dabb2599f5?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Real Goodbar","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Bay View Stables (Jim Demetri), Mark Edwards, Mike Trout \u0026 MAS Racing (Angie Schreiber)","trainer":"Kenneth G. McPeek","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Real Goodbar","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt155607089a7ab7ea/6ace436c1e0a137e357ece05/Contender_Photo_Real_Good_Bar_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt155607089a7ab7ea/6ace436c1e0a137e357ece05/Contender_Photo_Real_Good_Bar_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt6bf61f758c07022b","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":20,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"20","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Justify","damName":"Atayeb","sex":"Ridgling","color":"Chestnut","foalingDate":"May, 19 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Zuma Beach S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":80000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":68000,"show":0,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"50"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":68000,"show":0,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"50"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"50","starts":2,"earnings":68000,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":1,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eMaxify heads to Keeneland after a game second in the West Coast’s top prep for the Brown Advisory Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf (G1).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOwned and bred by Jay Bligh, Maxify was an auspicious debut winner at Del Mar, rallying from seventh in a mile Sept. 4 maiden special weight turf race and prevailing by three-quarters of a length at 13-1.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTrainer Michael McCarthy brought Maxify back to the races Oct. 4 for his second and most recent start in the Zuma Beach Stakes (G3) at Santa Anita.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe was third early on in the field of four and forged to the front in mid-stretch but could not fend off a late bid from McCarthy stablemate Repo Man and lost by a head.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMaxify is out of the Rahy mare Atayeb. He was offered Keeneland September Yearling Sale but did not reach his reserve price of $285,000 and remained with Bligh. \r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Jay W. Bligh","uid":"bltcc2ad3771aa82538","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltcc2ad3771aa82538?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Maxify","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Jay W. Bligh","trainer":"Michael W. McCarthy","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Maxify","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt426152cbb0d85722/6ad676a58f4f8c80f76c0245/Contender_Photo_Maxify.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt426152cbb0d85722/6ad676a58f4f8c80f76c0245/Contender_Photo_Maxify.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt6bf61f758c07022b","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":21,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"21","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Medaglia d'Oro","damName":"Season Ticket","sex":"Colt","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"May, 06 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":"Cup \u0026 Saucer S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"October, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 06 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":125500,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":140601,"show":0,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"50"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":140601,"show":0,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"50"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"50","starts":2,"earnings":140601,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":1,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eCanada, who quite appropriately was bred in Canada, is coming off a stakes win on his first try on turf.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe started his career for owner D.J. Stable and trainer Mark Casse on Sept. 6, when he finished second on Woodbine’s synthetic, all-weather surface by 4 ½ lengths against open company.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn the son of Medaglia d’Oro’s second and most recent start, he was introduced to turf in the Cup and Saucer Stakes for Canadian-breds at Woodbine. Third in the early stages, he took over in the final furlong and posted a 1 3/4-length victory at a mile and a sixteenth.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCanada was bred in Ontario by Godolphin and John Ropes out of the Leomon Drop Kid mare Season Ticket.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe was purchased by D. J. Stable for $400,000 at the OBS June 2-Year-Olds and Horses of Racing Age Sale. He originally was purchased for $25,000 by 30-30 Ranch at the Keeneland September Yearling Sale.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Godolphin \u0026 John Ropes","uid":"blt4f655494a7e711ae","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt4f655494a7e711ae?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Canada","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"D.J. Stable LLC (Leonard C. Green)","trainer":"Mark E. Casse","country":{"uid":"bltd313850291635aef","title":"Canada","abbreviation":"CAN","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt4c78a5ec75e090d2/61aa4b152e86841fa22388d7/Flag_of_Canada.jpg","alt":""}},"horseName":"Canada","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt6bf61f758c07022b","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":22,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"22","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Karakontie (JPN)","damName":"Happy Joy Joy","sex":"Gelding","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"March, 10 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":"Hollywood Beach S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 23 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":70000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 13 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":70000,"positionAtFinish":4}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":69650,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":69650,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"67","placesP":"0","starts":3,"earnings":69650,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eBought for just $7,000 at the Keeneland September Yearling Sale, Riyadh Way will try to author a rags-to-riches story when he stretches out in the Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf (G1) at Keeneland.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA Karakontie (JPN) gelding, Riyadh Way started his career June 13 in a 5-furlong maiden race on dirt at Gulfstream Park and finished fourth.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShifting to turf for his second start on Aug. 23 at Gulfstream made a huge difference as he led throughout and won a 5-furlong maiden race at the Hallandale Beach track by 4 ¼ lengths in :56.34.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eKept at a 5-fiurlong distance by trainer Tareq Moubarak, the juvenile returned Sept. 26 in the black-type Hollywood Beach Stakes at Gulfstream. Despite breaking slowly and encountering traffic issues, Riyadh Way rallied from seventh and won by 1 ¾ lengths to enter the Breeders’ Cup picture.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOwned by Alwaleed Thamer Alosaimi International Stables, he was bred by Raymond Montgomery in Kentucky out of the Kitten’s Joy mare Happy Joy Joy.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Raymond Montgomery (Chip)","uid":"bltacb12ded9a00f016","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltacb12ded9a00f016?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Riyadh Way","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Alwaleed Thamer Alosaimi International Stables (Mabarak Alotaibi) \u0026 Saleh Saud Al Otaibi","trainer":"Tareq Moubarak","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Riyadh Way","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt6bf61f758c07022b","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":23,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"23","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Audible","damName":"Play Our Song","sex":"Colt","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"April, 03 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 27 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":127000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KENTUCKY DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 05 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":170000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":175068,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":175068,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":175068,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eMajik Mooney will be making his stakes debut in the Brown Advisory Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf (G1) after wins in lucrative allowance and maiden races.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA son of Audible, Majik Mooney made his debut Sept. 5 in a $170,000 maiden race at Kentucky Downs. Sent off at 11-1 odds, he rallied from sixth to record a half-length victory for trainer Joe Sharp.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLater that month, in a Sept. 27 $127,000 allowance race at Churchill Downs, he moved up from fifth to prevail by a neck in a mile turf race.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMajok Mooney is owned by Moving Forward Racing.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe was bred by Barry and Joni Butzow out of the Maclean’s Music mare Play Our Song. \r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Barry \u0026 Joni Butzow","uid":"bltfe3e904fa676e347","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltfe3e904fa676e347?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Majik Mooney","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Moving Forward Racing, LLC (Joni Butzow)","trainer":"Joe Sharp","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Majik Mooney","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt5aae28c72ea84262/6ad7ccc3931bb2ad5f263611/Contender_Photo_Majik_Mooney.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt5aae28c72ea84262/6ad7ccc3931bb2ad5f263611/Contender_Photo_Majik_Mooney.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt6bf61f758c07022b","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":24,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"24","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Justify","damName":"Sky Dreamer","sex":"Colt","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"March, 18 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"BELMONT PARK","raceName":"Champagne S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":500000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"MONMOUTH PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 07 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":41000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":54600,"show":0,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":54600,"show":0,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":54600,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":1,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eWith just two career starts to his credit, Earth Song will be making his turf debut in the Brown Advisory Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf (G1). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn those two races on dirt, he won at first asking and then finished fourth in a Grade 1 stakes.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA son of 2018 Triple Crown champion Justify, Earth Song made his initial start Sept. 7 at Monmouth Park and romped by 11 ¾ lengths against two rivals in a maiden race.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe then took a huge jump in class and faced some of the East’s best 2-year-olds in the Champagne Stakes (G1) at Belmont Park. He wound up fourth at 24-1 odds, 9 ½ lengths behind the victorious U.S.S. Valor in the one-turn mile dirt stakes. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOwned by Amo Racing USA and trained by Jorge Delgado, Earth Song was bred by John Oxley out of the Sky Mesa mare Sky Dreamer.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHis connections bought him for $250,000 at the OBS March Sale of 2-Year-Olds in Training.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEarth Song was originally purchased last year for $150,000 at the Keeneland September Yearling Sale. \r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"John C. Oxley","uid":"blt8fae6ea9938a23c2","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt8fae6ea9938a23c2?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Earth Song","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Amo Racing USA (Kiavash Joorabchian)","trainer":"Jorge Delgado","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Earth Song","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt0f2ceec04531a3e4/6ace84573ac0950137981e15/Contender_Photo_Earth_Song_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt0f2ceec04531a3e4/6ace84573ac0950137981e15/Contender_Photo_Earth_Song_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt6bf61f758c07022b","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":25,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"25","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""}]},{"uid":"blt50a456b22d370e38","raceName":"Breeders' Cup Juvenile","raceDetails":{"type":"World Championships","bcType":"Juvenile","sponsor":[{"title":"FanDuel","redirectUrl":"https://www.breederscup.com/races/2026-mile","label":"Presented by","logos":{"color":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte7048a30218318fd/630cac5cb5284f56ca59b8dc/FanDuelTV-Svgs_RaceSponsor_Color-Left-Aligned-01.svg"},"white":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltea3471cca5281e7c/630cac5c10a0d31b7d9e5a37/FanDuel_Brand-Svgs_Footer.svg"},"black":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte7048a30218318fd/630cac5cb5284f56ca59b8dc/FanDuelTV-Svgs_RaceSponsor_Color-Left-Aligned-01.svg"}},"sponsoredUrls":[],"sponsoredSection":""}],"sponsorLogo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte7048a30218318fd/630cac5cb5284f56ca59b8dc/FanDuelTV-Svgs_RaceSponsor_Color-Left-Aligned-01.svg"},"date":"2026-10-30T20:55:00.000Z","priorYearChampionPhoto":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltca6ad5e712ac9dca/69247ccbccf9ff26d8041498/Juvenile_-_Ted_Noffey.jpg"},"displayPostTime":true,"isCompleted":false,"isLive":false,"purse":"$2,000,000","distance":"1 1/16 miles","grade":1,"ageV2":"2","division":"FanDuel Juvenile","exacta":"","trifecta":"","superfecta":"","superHighFive":"","dailyDouble":"","pick3":"","pick4":"","pick5":"","pick6":"","region":""},"isTvScheduled":true,"broadcast":{"partners":[{"logo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltceb0312138059807/632b128204361d715f5522c1/USA_Network-Logo-SVGs_146x60-USA.svg"},"time":""},{"logo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt29c35e9a30ccbba3/68d1ca298c48984dc7622c30/22-BC-162_New-BCcom_Network-Logo-SVGs_146x60-v1-05-Peacock.svg"},"time":""}]},"trackDetails":[{"uid":"bltc1d1c6b40525bf04","details":{"name":"Keeneland","logo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt276fb8147db83742/629e62383d4e745ed3ae5859/keeneland.png"},"image":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltb0b7768e84d44449/614ce97164c8007a9bdec19c/Keeneland_Track_Image.jpeg"},"locationBcbc":"Keeneland","timeZone":-4}}],"raceDescription":"\u003ch1\u003eThe next generation of superstars.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp\u003eAt $2 million, the FanDuel Breeders’ Cup Juvenile presented by Thoroughbred Aftercare Alliance is the richest two-year-old race in North America. Keep a watchful eye on this 1 1/16-mile race, as it is often a preview of the stars of the following year’s Triple Crown trail. The Juvenile is the highlight of the Future Stars Friday program of two-year-old races held on the first day of the World Championships.\u003c/p\u003e","surface":"","bettingCtaOverride":{"cta":[]},"horseType":"pre-entries","horses":[{"sireName":"Constitution","damName":"Bloody Point","sex":"Colt","color":"Chestnut","foalingDate":"February, 23 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"Claiborne Breeders' Futurity","grade":"1","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":650000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 22 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":461213,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":461213,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":461213,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eAmerican History punched his ticket for the Oct. 30 FanDuel Breeders’ Cup Juvenile (G1) at Keeneland with a length victory over Coach Pope in the Oct. 3 Breeders’ Futurity (G1) at Keeneland. Making only his second career start, the son of Constitution recovered from a slow break to race well off a quick early pace before advancing steadily and reeling in the leaders, Q B Rocket and Coach Pope. The Todd Pletcher trainee raced 1 1/16 miles in 1:44.88.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e“I was hoping the two horses in front were going fast enough that my horse could catch up,” Hall of Fame jockey John Velazquez said. “My horse has one stride — kind of keeps coming, coming and coming — and that’s the way he did it.”\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePletcher will now look to win the Breeders’ Cup Juvenile for the sixth time. Two of the trainer’s earlier winners, Forte (2022) and Ted Noffey (2025), took the Breeders’ Futurity ahead of the Breeders’ Cup Juvenile.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eVelazquez has been aboard three of Pletcher’s Juvenile winners – Ted Noffey, Fierceness (2023), and Uncle Mo (2010).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAmerican History, an $825,000 yearling purchase, debuted Aug. 22 at Saratoga, winning by 7 3/4 lengths for owners WinStar Farm, First Go Racing and CHC.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Alpha Delta Stables, LLC","uid":"blt207ba42311385efe","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt207ba42311385efe?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"American History","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"WinStar Farm, LLC (Kenny Troutt), First Go Racing (Preston Troutt) \u0026 CHC Inc. (Kit Ng)","trainer":"Todd A. Pletcher","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"American History","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt22b1e40486961628/6ac17ab8d056020af52807ef/Contender_Photo_American_History_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt22b1e40486961628/6ac17ab8d056020af52807ef/Contender_Photo_American_History_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50a456b22d370e38","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":true,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Tapit","damName":"Gamble's Ghost","sex":"Colt","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"February, 20 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"Claiborne Breeders' Futurity","grade":"1","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":650000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 12 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":120000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 08 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115000,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":220463,"show":0,"win":1,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"33","placeP":"67"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":220463,"show":0,"win":1,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"33","placeP":"67"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"33","placesP":"67","starts":3,"earnings":220463,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":1,"places":2},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eCoach Pope, named after University of Kentucky men’s basketball coach Mark Pope, comes off a runner-up finish in the Oct. 3 Breeders’ Futurity (G1) at Keeneland, in which he was beaten a length by American History. Chasing Q B Rocket through fast fractions in the 1 1/16-mile race after stumbling slightly at the break, he edged past that rival but grew tired late, lugging in and leaving him vulnerable to America History’s late charge.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e“I told Mark Pope before the race, if anyone beats us, it'll be (American History),” trainer Kenny McPeek said.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e“He shows he fits, and he’s an exciting colt to be around,” he added. “We’re going to enjoy every moment of it.”\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe said the Tapit colt, who races for Gainesway Stable, Shamrock Stables and Mike Mackin, would return in the Oct. 30 FanDuel Breeders’ Cup Juvenile over the same track and distance if the colt exits the race in good condition.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBefore his start in the Breeders’ Futurity, Coach Pope won a mile maiden race at Churchill Downs by 12 1/2 lengths after a runner-up finish in his debut in a 6 1/2-furlong race at Saratoga.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA $350,000 yearling purchase, Coach Pope is out of multiple Grade 3 winner Gamble’s Ghost, a daughter of Ghostzapper.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":6,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Tall Oaks Farm \u0026 Tapit Syndicate","uid":"bltf50541ca5c6218d8","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltf50541ca5c6218d8?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Coach Pope","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Gainesway Stable (Antony Beck), Shamrock Stables (Dianne Hutcherson) \u0026 Michael J. Mackin","trainer":"Kenneth G. McPeek","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Coach Pope","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltec9cab1a79a33e2c/6abe82f10f460d7068d5b63a/Contender_Photo_Coach_Pope_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltec9cab1a79a33e2c/6abe82f10f460d7068d5b63a/Contender_Photo_Coach_Pope_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50a456b22d370e38","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Not This Time","damName":"Tempers Rising","sex":"Colt","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"May, 06 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"October, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":110000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 07 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115000,"positionAtFinish":4}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":69985,"show":0,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":69985,"show":0,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":69985,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":1,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eMoving forward from a fourth-place finish in his debut when going 6 furlongs at Saratoga, Damavand graduated from the maiden ranks with a neck victory in a 1 1/16-mile maiden race Oct. 4 at Keeneland.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAfter some early jostling, the Not This Time colt wore down a gritty Belzoni. The winner was clocked in a final time of 1:44.57, capped by a final sixteenth of a mile in :06.10. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThough he has yet to be tested in the stakes race, his maiden performance gives him experience over dirt course and the distance of the FanDuel Breeders' Cup Juvenile (G1) on Oct. 30 at Keeneland.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred in Kentucky by Mark Stanley out of his graded-placed Bayern mare Tempers Rising, Damavand is a half-brother to three-time stakes winner Owen Almighty. Damavand sold for $1 million last year out of the Taylor Made Sales Agency consignment to the Keeneland September Yearling Sale, six months after Owen Almighty won the Tampa Bay Derby (G3).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHis trainer, Hall of Famer Todd Pletcher, is a five-time winner of the Juvenile. Three of his victories have come over the past four years, including in 2025 with Ted Noffey.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDamavand races for Kia Joorabchian's Amo Racing USA.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Mark Stanley","uid":"blt3c804d92fa17352b","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt3c804d92fa17352b?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Damavand","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Amo Racing USA (Kiavash Joorabchian)","trainer":"Todd A. Pletcher","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Damavand","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltd8fb91f52c98cb1d/6adcb811f0e9f273fce19aca/Contender_Photo_Damavand.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltd8fb91f52c98cb1d/6adcb811f0e9f273fce19aca/Contender_Photo_Damavand.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50a456b22d370e38","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Justify","damName":"Sky Dreamer","sex":"Colt","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"March, 18 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"BELMONT PARK","raceName":"Champagne S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":500000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"MONMOUTH PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 07 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":41000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":54600,"show":0,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":54600,"show":0,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":54600,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":1,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eWith just two career starts to his credit, Earth Song will be making his turf debut in the Brown Advisory Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf (G1). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn those two races on dirt, he won at first asking and then finished fourth in a Grade 1 stakes.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA son of 2018 Triple Crown champion Justify, Earth Song made his initial start Sept. 7 at Monmouth Park and romped by 11 ¾ lengths against two rivals in a maiden race.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe then took a huge jump in class and faced some of the East’s best 2-year-olds in the Champagne Stakes (G1) at Belmont Park. He wound up fourth at 24-1 odds, 9 ½ lengths behind the victorious U.S.S. Valor in the one-turn mile dirt stakes. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOwned by Amo Racing USA and trained by Jorge Delgado, Earth Song was bred by John Oxley out of the Sky Mesa mare Sky Dreamer.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHis connections bought him for $250,000 at the OBS March Sale of 2-Year-Olds in Training.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEarth Song was originally purchased last year for $150,000 at the Keeneland September Yearling Sale. \r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"John C. Oxley","uid":"blt8fae6ea9938a23c2","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt8fae6ea9938a23c2?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Earth Song","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Amo Racing USA (Kiavash Joorabchian)","trainer":"Jorge Delgado","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Earth Song","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt0f2ceec04531a3e4/6ace84573ac0950137981e15/Contender_Photo_Earth_Song_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt0f2ceec04531a3e4/6ace84573ac0950137981e15/Contender_Photo_Earth_Song_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50a456b22d370e38","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Nyquist","damName":"Free Cover","sex":"Colt","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"January, 19 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"BELMONT PARK","raceName":"Champagne S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":500000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 08 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":163250,"show":0,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"50"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":163250,"show":0,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"50"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"50","starts":2,"earnings":163250,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":1,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eGaudreau has traded decisions with the talented U. S. S. Valor in two starts, beating him on debut at Saratoga in August before finishing a distant runner-up to him in the Oct. 3 Champagne Stakes (G1) at Belmont Park in a subsequent start.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThough no match for U. S. S. Valor through the lane in the latter race, checking in 6 1/2 lengths behind that rival, Gaudreau finished 2 lengths clear of third-place Club Reign after setting a contested pace. The Champagne was run over a one-turn mile, a sixteenth of a mile shorter than the two-turn FanDuel Breeders’ Cup Juvenile (G1), which will be contested Oct. 30 at Keeneland.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e“I’ve got to go back to the drawing board as a trainer and figure out what happened there and why is this gap between them now? Because clearly, he was no match for him today,” trainer Chad Brown said after the Champagne.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGaudreau, bred in Louisiana, is a bay son of Nyquist out of the Congrats mare Free Cover. Bradley Thoroughbreds bought him for $220,000 from Fasig-Tipton’s Kentucky October Yearlings Sale in 2025.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBradley Thoroughbreds \u0026nbsp;owns him with Tanglewood Thoroughbreds, Thirty Year Racing, Rodeo Creek Racing, Laura Leigh Stable and Swift Thoroughbreds.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":6,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Coteau Grove Farms, LLC","uid":"bltfd8af3b2c505cbdd","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltfd8af3b2c505cbdd?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Gaudreau","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Tanglewood Thoroughbreds LLC (Jonathan Knutz \u0026 Lauren Abbott), Thirty Year Racing (Matt \u0026 Kristen Esler), Bradley Thoroughbreds (Peter R. Bradley, III), Rodeo Creek Racing, LLC (John Capek), Laura Leigh Stable (Butch Lunsford), Swift Thoroughbreds Inc. (Marck Mache)","trainer":"Chad C. Brown","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Gaudreau","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt1786f2dd446bb995/6ac7f284b2d147f9287750c5/Contender_Photo-Gaudreau.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt1786f2dd446bb995/6ac7f284b2d147f9287750c5/Contender_Photo-Gaudreau.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50a456b22d370e38","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Early Voting","damName":"Truth in the Lies","sex":"Ridgling","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"April, 01 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Iroquois S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"September, 12 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Best Pal S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"August, 08 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":150000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Bashford Manor S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 28 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":225000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 15 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":65000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":4,"earnings":151050,"show":0,"win":1,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"25","placeP":"50"},"lifetime":{"starts":4,"earnings":151050,"show":0,"win":1,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"25","placeP":"50"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"25","placesP":"50","starts":4,"earnings":151050,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":1,"places":2},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eTruth be told, He Is No Lie made an immediate statement in Southern California, romping on debut May 15 at Santa Anita Park for owners Purple Rein Racing and Mark Davis. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSent east to Kentucky, the 2-year-old son of Early Voting nearly won the Bashford Manor Stakes (Listed) at Churchill Downs in late June, leading for much of the race before being caught in the closing strides and just missing when second. That sparked a try in the Aug. 8 Best Pal Stakes (G3) at Del Mar, but he stumbled at the start, costing him positioning, and he settled for fourth. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Doug O'Neill trainee fared better in a follow-up start, giving favored Salahudin a battle in the Sept. 12 Iroquois Stakes (G3) at Churchill Downs when a close second over a mile. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\"I thought he ran a really good race today,\" jockey Joel Rosario said after the Iroquois. \"Down the stretch I thought I could get the job done but (Salahudin) kept coming at us and got us late.\" \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith the Iroquois part of the Breeders' Cup Dirt Dozen series, he earned $15,000 in entry fee credits toward a start in the 1 1/16-mile FanDuel Breeders' Cup Juvenile (G1) Oct. 30 at Keeneland.\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":2,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Pope McLean, Marc McLean \u0026 Pope McLean Jr.","uid":"blt3eaf4bb2ef3a3e23","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt3eaf4bb2ef3a3e23?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"He Is No Lie","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Purple Rein Racing (Janie Buss) \u0026 Mark D. Davis","trainer":"Doug F. O'Neill","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"He Is No Lie","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltb1fb1d99f1f21ec5/6ac92d1204e85208ce7cf5bb/Contender_Photo_He_is_no_Lie_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltb1fb1d99f1f21ec5/6ac92d1204e85208ce7cf5bb/Contender_Photo_He_is_no_Lie_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50a456b22d370e38","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Into Mischief","damName":"K P Dreamin","sex":"Colt","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"February, 23 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"American Pharoah S. Presented by DK Horse","grade":"1","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Del Mar Futurity","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 06 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Best Pal S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"August, 08 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":150000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"LOS ALAMITOS RACE COURSE","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 21 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":50000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":4,"earnings":480000,"show":0,"win":4,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":4,"earnings":480000,"show":0,"win":4,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":4,"earnings":480000,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":4,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eHall of Fame trainer Bob Baffert has won the FanDuel Breeders’ Cup Juvenile (G1) a record six times, and he has the Juvenile in his sights once again this year when Keeneland stages the 1 1/16-mile race on Oct. 30.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHughes, a son of Into Mischief, appears to be one of the leading 2-year-olds in the country. A first-out winner over 5 furlongs at Los Alamitos, where he romped by 6 lengths June 21. Hughes next trounced stakes rivals at Del Mar Aug. 8. Stretching out to 6 furlongs in the Best Pal Stakes (G3), he went to the lead and extended his advantage at every call on his way to a 7 3/4-length score, clocked in a sparkling 1:09.61 for the distance. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Best Pal serves as the local prep for the Sept. 6 Del Mar Futurity (G1), a 7-furlong race that proved to be no problem for Hughes as he gave Baffert his 20th victory in the race and sixth in a row. Sent off as the 1-5 favorite in the field of five, Hughes took charge on the far turn, repelled a challenge from Phone Booth at the top of the stretch and drew off to win by 4 3/4 lengths in 1:22.57.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNext for Hughes was his two-turn debut in the 1 1/16-mile American Pharoah (G1) at Santa Anita on Oct. 3 and he aced that test as well. Sent off as the 3-10 favorite in the field of six, Hughes took command at the quarter pole and drew off for a 6-length victory while being geared down through the final sixteenth.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred in Kentucky by Breffni Farm out of the Union Rags mare K P Dreamin, Hughes was a $675,000 purchase last year from the Keeneland September Yearling Sale. He races for a large partnership headed by Front Row Club, Starlight Racing and Madaket Stables.\r\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":24,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Breffni Farm","uid":"bltbe89bd6022cefc5f","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltbe89bd6022cefc5f?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Hughes","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Front Row Club, LLC (Tom Ryan), Starlight Racing (Jack Wolf), Madaket Stables, LLC (Sol Kumin), Stonestreet Stables, LLC (Barbara Banke), Bashor Racing, LLC (Diane Bashor), Albaugh Family Stables, LLC (Dennis Albaugh), Robert E. Masterson, Golconda Stable (Elliott Friman), Waves Edge Capital, LLC (W. Gregg Slager) \u0026 Catherine Donovan","trainer":"Bob Baffert","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Hughes","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte304957d053fd45b/6ac18fab280cccbdc0665205/Contender_Photo_-_Hughes.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte304957d053fd45b/6ac18fab280cccbdc0665205/Contender_Photo_-_Hughes.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50a456b22d370e38","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Uncle Mo","damName":"Weekend Strike","sex":"Colt","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"January, 27 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Iroquois S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"September, 12 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ELLIS PARK","raceName":"Ellis Park Juvenile S. presented by Claiborne Farm","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 09 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":250000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ELLIS PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 17 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":392172,"show":0,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":392172,"show":0,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":3,"earnings":392172,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":3,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eHall of Fame trainer Bob Baffert has won six runnings of the FanDuel Breeders’ Cup Juvenile (G1) and has multiple prospects for this year’s race on Oct. 30 at Keeneland. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOne of those is Zedan Racing Stables’ Salahudin, who burst on the scene at Ellis Park this summer before taking his talents to Churchill Downs. A maiden winner at Ellis Park over 6 1/2 furlongs in July, he repeated in the 7-furlong Ellis Park Juvenile there the following month. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA tougher challenge awaited in the Sept. 12 Iroquois Stakes (G3) at Churchill Downs, and he again passed the test, this time going a mile. Overcoming a sluggish start, the towering Uncle Mo colt rallied to wear down He Is No Lie for a half-length victory. He covered the distance in 1:36.54. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e“He’s a big horse and takes a little time to get going into his best stride. But once he did, he kept finding more to get to the front,” winning rider Jose Ortiz said. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith the Iroquois part of the Breeders’ Cup Dirt Dozen, he earned $30,000 in entry fee credits toward a start in the 1 1/16-mile Juvenile. Via a separate series, he also earned qualifying points toward next year’s Kentucky Derby (G1).\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":4,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Newstead Corp","uid":"blt19ef9ffa1a746ba0","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt19ef9ffa1a746ba0?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Salahudin","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Zedan Racing Stables, Inc. (Amr F. Zedan)","trainer":"Bob Baffert","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Salahudin","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt51be7eb50959b455/6ac1855766fa96a7e3e8aafe/Contender_Photo_Salahudin.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt51be7eb50959b455/6ac1855766fa96a7e3e8aafe/Contender_Photo_Salahudin.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50a456b22d370e38","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""}]},{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","raceName":"Breeders' Cup Juvenile Fillies Turf","raceDetails":{"type":"World Championships","bcType":"Juvenile Fillies Turf","sponsor":[{"title":"John Deere","redirectUrl":"https://www.breederscup.com/races/2026-juvenile-fillies-turf","label":"Presented by","logos":{"color":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt6a794f53c5d0c2ab/66cc8cc4c8dced81f8115fd9/JohnDeere-Logo_Color_For-Race-Pages-v2-01.svg"},"white":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt4cc92f8712611338/66c355bc31665383c04a0e94/JohnDeere_Footer-01.svg"},"black":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt7f931a32da1352ae/66c79e84972768f28fb5df08/JohnDeere-Logo_Color_For-Race-Pages-01.svg"}},"sponsoredUrls":[],"sponsoredSection":""}],"sponsorLogo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt6a794f53c5d0c2ab/66cc8cc4c8dced81f8115fd9/JohnDeere-Logo_Color_For-Race-Pages-v2-01.svg"},"date":"2026-10-30T20:15:00.000Z","priorYearChampionPhoto":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt2293222f55c84c23/69247cd203d66bbb454f39be/JuvenileFillies_Turf_-_Balantina.jpg"},"displayPostTime":true,"isCompleted":false,"isLive":false,"purse":"$1,000,000","distance":"1 Mile","grade":1,"ageV2":"2","division":"Juvenile Fillies Turf","exacta":"","trifecta":"","superfecta":"","superHighFive":"","dailyDouble":"","pick3":"","pick4":"","pick5":"","pick6":"","region":""},"isTvScheduled":true,"broadcast":{"partners":[{"logo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltceb0312138059807/632b128204361d715f5522c1/USA_Network-Logo-SVGs_146x60-USA.svg"},"time":""},{"logo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt29c35e9a30ccbba3/68d1ca298c48984dc7622c30/22-BC-162_New-BCcom_Network-Logo-SVGs_146x60-v1-05-Peacock.svg"},"time":""}]},"trackDetails":[{"uid":"bltc1d1c6b40525bf04","details":{"name":"Keeneland","logo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt276fb8147db83742/629e62383d4e745ed3ae5859/keeneland.png"},"image":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltb0b7768e84d44449/614ce97164c8007a9bdec19c/Keeneland_Track_Image.jpeg"},"locationBcbc":"Keeneland","timeZone":-4}}],"raceDescription":"\u003ch1\u003eAn international showcase of the next generation of stars.\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe John Deere Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Fillies Turf brings together the best two-year-old female turf horses from North America and overseas for a 1-mile test on the grass course. This race, which carries a $1 million purse, often charts a course for these competitors to enjoy successful racing careers on either side of the Atlantic.\u003c/p\u003e","surface":"","bettingCtaOverride":{"cta":[]},"horseType":"pre-entries","horses":[{"sireName":"Harry Angel (IRE)","damName":"Totsiyah (IRE)","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"February, 03 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"Tattersalls Sceptre Sessions Cheveley Park S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":364236,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"CORK","raceName":"Irish Stallion Farms E.B.F. Firville S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 14 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":57648,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"Duchess Of Cambridge S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"July, 10 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":167610,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"FAIRYHOUSE","raceName":"Irish E.B.F. Median Sires Series","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 01 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":28554,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":4,"earnings":108001,"show":2,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"50","winP":"50","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":4,"earnings":108001,"show":2,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"50","winP":"50","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"50","winsP":"50","placesP":"0","starts":4,"earnings":108001,"racingYear":2026,"shows":2,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eAlwaysanangel (IRE) made her racetrack debut a winning one. The 2-year-old filly’s first start came on July 1 at Fairyhouse in Ireland going 6 furlongs. Alwaysanangel pulled away to win by 3 lengths.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOff that victory, Alwaysanangel jumped up to stakes company in the July 10 Duchess Of Cambridge Stakes (G2) at Newmarket in England. She finished third but was only beaten three-quarters of a length by Senorita Bonita (IRE) and was a short head behind Libertango (IRE).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor her third start, Alwaysanangel lined up in the Aug. 14 Firville Stakes at Cork and got back to her winning ways. She took the 7-furlong race by 1 ¾ lengths over Madam Secretary (IRE). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAlwaysanangel then returned to Newmarket for the Sept. 26 Cheveley Park Stakes (G1) and finished third. She was 2 ½ lengths behind the winning Sun Goddess (IRE) and a length behind second-place finisher Libertango (IRE).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eJoseph O’Brien trains Alwaysanangel for Janine Byrne. She was purchased for $106,122 in April at the Tattersalls Guineas Breeze Up sale.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRoderic Kavanagh bred Alwaysanangel. She is by Harry Angel (IRE) and out of the Dalakhani (IRE) mare Totsiyah (IRE). \r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Mr R. Kavanagh","uid":"blt319a439b1d27cde4","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt319a439b1d27cde4?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Alwaysanangel (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Janine Byrne","trainer":"Joseph Patrick O'Brien","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Alwaysanangel","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"No Nay Never","damName":"Joyeuse (GB)","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"February, 02 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"LONGCHAMP","raceName":"Qatar Prix Jean-Luc Lagardere","grade":"1","raceDate":"October, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":450198,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"LONGCHAMP","raceName":"Qatar Prix d'Aumale","grade":"2","raceDate":"September, 06 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":138223,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"COMPIEGNE","raceName":"Prix des Belles Demoiselles","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 20 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":31427,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":303365,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"33"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":303365,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"33"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"67","placesP":"33","starts":3,"earnings":303365,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eAmusingly (GB) rewarded the faith her connections had in her when she defeated colts in the Oct. 4 Prix Jean-Luc Lagardere (G1) at Parislongchamp. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTrainer Francis-Henri Graffard lobbied to supplement the 2-year-old filly into the Lagardere, and he was proven correct when she beat Group 1 winner Folsom Blues (IRE) by 1 ¼ lengths. Amusingly was the only filly in the 7-furlong contest, which is a Breeders' Cup Challenge Series: Win and You're In race for the Brown Advisory Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf (G1).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAmusingly came into the race having been narrowly beaten in the Sept. 6 Prix d'Aumale (G2) at Parislongchamp. She finished second by a neck to Rogue Passion (IRE) in the mile contest. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn her career debut, Amusingly beat nine others in a maiden race at Compiegne on June 20. She won by 3 lengths over Ametis Chope (FR). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGraffard trains Amusingly for Juddmonte, and she races as a homebred. Amusingly is by No Nay Never and out of the stakes-winning Oasis Dream (GB) mare Joyeuse (GB). A daughter of Kind (IRE), Joyeuse is a half-sister to the legendary Frankel (GB) as well as G1 winner Noble Mission (GB) and G3 winner Bullet Train (GB).\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Juddmonte Farms Ltd.","uid":"blt832b543b16a9803b","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt832b543b16a9803b?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Amusingly (GB)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Juddmonte (Fahad Bin Khalid)","trainer":"Francis-Henri Graffard","country":{"uid":"blt440e3ce320965a9b","title":"United Kingdom / England","abbreviation":"GBR","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt02676e7705186e63/61aa4e462e86841fa22388f0/united-kingdom.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Amusingly","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltdcacada007e33ad0/6ac2532a66fa964bf6e8ab1f/Contender_Photo_Amusingly.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltdcacada007e33ad0/6ac2532a66fa964bf6e8ab1f/Contender_Photo_Amusingly.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Olympiad","damName":"California Spirit","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"March, 17 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KENTUCKY DOWNS","raceName":"Pepsi Kentucky Downs Juvenile Fillies S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 07 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":750000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"GOWRAN PARK","raceName":"Irish E.B.F. Median Sires Series","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 12 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":28857,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"LEOPARDSTOWN","raceName":"Irish E.B.F. Median Sires Series","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 23 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":28531,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"LISTOWEL","raceName":"Irish Stallion Farms E.B.F.","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 31 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":25651,"positionAtFinish":6}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":4,"earnings":466170,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"25"},"lifetime":{"starts":4,"earnings":466170,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"25"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"25","starts":4,"earnings":466170,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eCitrus Springs needed a few races under her belt to break her maiden, but now she is a stakes winner. The 2-year-old filly made her racetrack debut on May 31 at Listowel in Ireland and finished sixth. She then ran on July 23 at Leopardstown and finished second. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFollowing that improved effort, Citrus Springs broke her maiden at third asking at Gowran Park on Aug. 12. She won by 5 lengths and defeated 15 others in the 7-furlong race.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor her next start, Citrus Springs, who was bred in Kentucky, returned to the United States for the Sept. 7 Kentucky Downs Juvenile Fillies Stakes (Listed). She contested firm ground and the mile distance for the first time, and she delivered another victory by fending off Up Before the Dawn to win by a head. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eJoseph O’Brien trained Citrus Springs to victory for Reeves Thoroughbred Racing. She since has been transferred to Miguel Clement.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDean Reeves purchased Citrus Springs following her runner-up in July at Leopardstown. Along with partners, Reeves won the 2025 John Deere Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Fillies with Balantina (IRE). In 2013, Reeves Thoroughbred Racing won the Breeders’ Cup Classic (G1) with Mucho Macho Man.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eInternational Equities Holding bred Citrus Springs, who is by Olympiad and out of the Tale of the Cat mare California Spirit.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":2026,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"International Equities Holding, Inc.","uid":"blt114fff29d9cebbd0","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt114fff29d9cebbd0?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Citrus Springs","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Reeves Thoroughbred Racing (Dean Reeves)","trainer":"Miguel Clement","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Citrus Springs","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltf60e7d76f37ddc80/6ace461f04e852c5157d00b2/Contender_Photo_Citrus_Springs_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltf60e7d76f37ddc80/6ace461f04e852c5157d00b2/Contender_Photo_Citrus_Springs_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Baaeed (GB)","damName":"Sassy Little Lila","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"March, 02 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"CURRAGH","raceName":"Darley Fillies S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"September, 27 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":79735,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"GOWRAN PARK","raceName":"Irish Stallion Farms E.B.F.","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 01 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":25558,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":62018,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":62018,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":62018,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eCurracloe has been perfect at the start of her career. The 2-year-old filly made her racing debut in Ireland at Gowran Park in a maiden special weight on Sept. 1. The 7-furlong contest drew a field of 16, and Curracloe pulled away from Snowing (IRE) to win by 3 ¼ lengths.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOff that promising debut, Curracloe stepped up to stakes company in the Sept. 27 Fillies Stakes (G3) at the Curragh. This time she faced seven others, and although the 7-furlong race was held on heavy ground, the result was the same. Sent off as the co-betting favorite, Curracloe defeated Alpine Wedding (IRE) by 2 ¾ lengths. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eChampion jockey-turned-trainer Johnny Murtagh trains Curracloe for Qatar Racing Limited, which acquired the filly as a yearling for $335,664 at Tattersalls. Curracloe is a famed coastal area in Ireland that served as the filming location for the D-Day landing scenes in “Saving Private Ryan.”\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAlthough she was bred in Kentucky by Frederica Stable, Curracloe is by European champion Baaeed (GB), and she gave him his first Group winner when she took the Fillies Stakes. She is out of the Artie Schiller mare Sassy Little Lila. \r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Frederica Stable","uid":"blt5a73705ae5a14519","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt5a73705ae5a14519?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Curracloe","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Qatar Racing LLC (Sheikh Fahad Al Thani)","trainer":"Johnny Murtagh","country":{"uid":"blta32e5b692b12a246","title":"Ireland","abbreviation":"IRE","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt613f9a736c40223a/61aa4c2b2f8b9e70946988d3/ireland.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Curracloe","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt96f3604ad46aa8ff/6ad6b0da6f7ed19ddebf6840/Contender_Photo_Curracloe.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt96f3604ad46aa8ff/6ad6b0da6f7ed19ddebf6840/Contender_Photo_Curracloe.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Oscar Performance","damName":"Zza Zza Zoom","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"February, 24 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":"Johnnie Walker Natalma S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 12 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":500000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Surfer Girl S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Del Mar Juvenile Fillies Turf S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 06 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":"bet365 Soaring Free S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 15 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":150000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 31 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":80000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 19 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115100,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":168764,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"33"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":168764,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"33"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"67","placesP":"33","starts":3,"earnings":168764,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eDe la Renta proved she was racetrack ready from the jump. The 2-year-old filly made her racing debut on July 19 in a maiden special weight going 6 furlongs over Woodbine’s all-weather track. She was sent off as the betting favorite in a field of 11 and did not disappoint, as she pulled away to win by 3 ¼ lengths. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFollowing that effort, De la Renta moved up to stakes company going 6 ½ furlongs on turf in the Aug. 15 Soaring Free Stakes (Listed) at Woodbine. De la Renta proved a determined winner as she got up to beat Speaker’s Speech by a head. They were 5 ¼ lengths in front of the third-place finisher. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDe la Renta made her next start in the Sept. 12 Natalma Stakes (G1) at Woodbine. She put in her rally, but she could not catch the winner. De la Renta finished second by 1 ¼ lengths behind Voyager in the mile turf contest. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eKevin Attard trains De la Renta for X-Men Racing VI and Sol Kumin’s Madaket Stables. She was bred by Nancy S. Dillman. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDe la Renta is by Oscar Performance and out of the Uncle Mo mare Zza Zza Zoom.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":6,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Nancy S. Dillman","uid":"blt10fbf3885193efa5","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt10fbf3885193efa5?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"De la Renta","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"X-Men Racing, VI (Donato Lanni) and Madaket Stables, LLC (Sol Kumin)","trainer":"Kevin Attard","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"De La Renta","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt47ce746b5d0cedf1/6ac3b00acd0bd92a63d4ee6a/Contender_Photo_De_La_Renta.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt47ce746b5d0cedf1/6ac3b00acd0bd92a63d4ee6a/Contender_Photo_De_La_Renta.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Speaker's Corner","damName":"Special You","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"February, 14 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Oak Leaf S. presented by Oak Tree Racing Association","grade":"2","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 05 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":80000,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":136000,"show":0,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"50"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":136000,"show":0,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"50"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"50","starts":2,"earnings":136000,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":1,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eDomain Expansion ran well on the turf in her debut, but she exploded on the dirt in her second start, drawing off to a 7-length score in the $200,00 Oak Leaf Stakes (G2) at Santa Anita on Oct. 3.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe victory in the 1 1/16-mile “Win and You’re In” Breeders’ Cup Challenge Series race earned the Leonard Powell-trained bay filly a spot in the $2 million Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Fillies at Keeneland on Oct. 30.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRidden in both her starts by relative newcomer Adrian Escobedo, Domain Expansion debuted in a 1-mile maiden special weight race on the turf at Del Mar on Sept. 5, finishing with a rush to be second, beaten 1 ¼ lengths. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSwitched to dirt in the Oak Leaf, the daughter of Speaker’s Corner out of the Medaglia d’Oro filly Special You stalked the early pace before drawing off at the top of the stretch to beat the highly regarded Bob Baffert-trained Holmby and four others.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred by Machmer Hall, Carrie Brogden and Craig Brogden, Domain Expansion sold at the Keeneland September yearling sale for $130,000 and now races for California Racing Partners, Ciaglia Racing LLC, Allen R. Keith and Kevin O’Donnell.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Machmer Hall, Carrie Brogden \u0026 Craig Brogden","uid":"bltd97897ac2aa02a55","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltd97897ac2aa02a55?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Domain Expansion","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"California Racing Partners (Matthew W. Dohman), Ciaglia Racing, LLC (Joe Ciaglia), Kevin O'Donnell \u0026 Allen R. Keith","trainer":"Leonard Powell","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Domain Expansion","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt5a10bb1f8244eb95/6ac1785ed89724029d09c8a1/Contender_Photo_-_Domain_Expansion.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt5a10bb1f8244eb95/6ac1785ed89724029d09c8a1/Contender_Photo_-_Domain_Expansion.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"American Pharoah","damName":"Smuggle","sex":"Filly","color":"Chestnut","foalingDate":"February, 22 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"BELMONT PARK","raceName":"Miss Grillo S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":250000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":200750,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":200750,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":200750,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eDomestic Agenda guaranteed herself a spot in the starting gate of the John Deere Breeders' Cup Juvenile Fillies Turf (G1) with her victory in the Oct. 3 Miss Grillo Stakes (G2) at Belmont Park. The race is part of the Breeders' Cup Challenge Series: Win and You're In program.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSent off as the betting favorite in the Miss Grillo, Domestic Agenda put in a last-to-first performance. She closed strongly in the 1 1/16-mile turf contest and pulled way to a 4 1/2-length victory over Bounce Back. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDomestic Agenda was making only her second lifetime start in the Miss Grillo. She made her racing debut on Sept. 4 in a maiden special weight at Saratoga and was the betting favorite. She was a winner that day too, taking the 1 1/16-mile race by a half-length over Charlotte’s Beach.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eChad Brown trains Domestic Agenda for Seth Klarman’s Klaravich Stables. The stable acquired the filly for $290,000 at the 2025 Keeneland September Yearling sale. In 2018, Brown and Klarman teamed up to win the Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Fillies Turf with Newspaperofrecord (IRE).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMorgan's Ford Farm bred Domestic Agenda in Virginia. She is by American Pharoah and out of the Gun Runner mare Smuggle.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":6,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Morgan's Ford Farm","uid":"blta3855817ad769de4","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blta3855817ad769de4?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Domestic Agenda","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Klaravich Stables, Inc. (Seth Klarman)","trainer":"Chad C. Brown","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Domestic Agenda","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt6506d07e1687a2a0/6ac15f43758e4e1fabe137a5/Contender_Photo_Domestic_Agenda.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt6506d07e1687a2a0/6ac15f43758e4e1fabe137a5/Contender_Photo_Domestic_Agenda.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Saxon Warrior (JPN)","damName":"Sea Empress (IRE)","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"March, 01 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"LONGCHAMP","raceName":"Qatar Prix Marcel Boussac - Criterium des Pouliches","grade":"1","raceDate":"October, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":450198,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CURRAGH","raceName":"Moyglare Stud S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 13 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":463932,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"CURRAGH","raceName":"Alpha Centauri Debutante S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"August, 22 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":151798,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CURRAGH","raceName":"Airlie Stud S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"June, 27 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":148009,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"CURRAGH","raceName":"Revamp Conservation And Restoration Irish E.B.F.","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 24 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":29006,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":467791,"show":0,"win":2,"place":3,"showP":"0","winP":"40","placeP":"60"},"lifetime":{"starts":5,"earnings":467791,"show":0,"win":2,"place":3,"showP":"0","winP":"40","placeP":"60"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"40","placesP":"60","starts":5,"earnings":467791,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":3},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eGreen Empress (IRE) has spent much of her 2-year-old season finishing second behind Sun Goddess (IRE). She made her racing debut on May 24 at the Curragh, where she finished second by 5 lengths behind Sun Goddess in a 6-furlong maiden race.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOff that effort, Green Empress moved up to stakes company to compete in the June 27 Airlie Stud Stakes (G2). The 6-furlong turf contest also drew the likes of Sun Goddess, and the duo ran one-two again, this time with Sun Goddess getting the nod by three-quarters of a length. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor her third start, Green Empress lined up in the Aug. 22 Debutante Stakes (G2), which is held over 7 furlongs at the Curragh. She simultaneously broke her maiden and became a stakes winner when she defeated Dancing Destiny (IRE) by a neck.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFollowing that victory, Green Empress competed in the Sept. 13 Moyglare Stud Stakes (G1) at the Curragh. The 7-furlong race drew the attention of Sun Goddess as well, and she defeated Green Empress by 6 ½ lengths over yielding turf.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWith no Sun Goddess to contend with in the 1-mile Prix Marcel Boussac-Criterium des Pouliches (G1) at Parislongchamp on Oct. 4, Green Empress got up in the final strides to win by a head as the favorite in the field of 12.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eJoseph O’Brien trains Green Empress for the Thoroughbred Racing Corporation. Bred by Sunderland Holding Inc, Green Empress is by Saxon Warrior (JPN) and out of the Sea The Stars (IRE) mare Sea Empress (IRE).\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Sunderland Holding Inc.","uid":"blt7bf4929932dab526","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt7bf4929932dab526?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Green Empress (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"The Thoroughbred Racing Corporation, Ltd. (Prince Faisal Ahmad Salman)","trainer":"Joseph Patrick O'Brien","country":{"uid":"blta32e5b692b12a246","title":"Ireland","abbreviation":"IRE","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt613f9a736c40223a/61aa4c2b2f8b9e70946988d3/ireland.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Green Empress","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blta4fdb8544abb2ef2/6ac2532a819bd0b3ae32d597/Contender_Photo_Green_Empress_(IRE).png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blta4fdb8544abb2ef2/6ac2532a819bd0b3ae32d597/Contender_Photo_Green_Empress_(IRE).png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Golden Pal","damName":"Wendy Wow","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"April, 22 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"Jessamine S. Presented by Keeneland Sales","grade":"2","raceDate":"October, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":400000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"KENTUCKY DOWNS","raceName":"Untapable S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 30 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":750000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ELLIS PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 07 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":576318,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"33"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":576318,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"33"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"67","placesP":"33","starts":3,"earnings":576318,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eStakes winner Seneca Park began her racing career a perfect two-for-two. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe juvenile filly made her racing debut on Aug. 7 at Ellis Park in a maiden special weight. Sent off as the betting favorite in a field of 11, Seneca Park showed her ability as she pulled away to win by 4 lengths in the 5 ½-furlong turf contest.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOff that triumphant beginning, Seneca Park stepped up to stakes company in the Aug. 30 Untapable Stakes (Listed) at Kentucky Downs going 6 ½ furlongs. The race is named after champion Untapable, who won the 2014 Breeders’ Cup Distaff (G1). Seneca Park was sent off as the betting favorite again, and once again, she was facing 10 others. This time, she made a late surge in deep stretch to win by a neck over Luminous Beauty. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSeneca Park stepped up to graded stakes company at Keeneland in the 1 1/16-mile Jessamine (G2) on Oct. 2. Sent off as the second choice in the field of 11, she set the pace and led to the sixteenth pole where she was collared by Serenas Ghost and settled for second beaten 1 1/4 lengths.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDallas Stewart trains Seneca Park for Arizona-based Holy Cow Stable, which is the racing operation of cardiologist Himanshu Shukla. He acquired Seneca Park for $70,000 at the OBS March 2-year-olds in training sale. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSeneca Park was bred by Southern Comfort Farm. She is by Golden Pal and out of the Invasor (ARG) mare Wendy Wow.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Southern Comfort Farm LLC","uid":"bltf2a84e6de3282600","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltf2a84e6de3282600?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Seneca Park","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Holy Cow Stable, LLC (Himanshu H. Shukla)","trainer":"Dallas Stewart","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Seneca Park","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt8ecfbe62cf858be4/6a972c33805755f948704811/Contender_Photo_Seneca_Park.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt8ecfbe62cf858be4/6a972c33805755f948704811/Contender_Photo_Seneca_Park.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Girvin","damName":"Sirenusa","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"April, 30 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"Jessamine S. Presented by Keeneland Sales","grade":"2","raceDate":"October, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":400000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"HORSESHOE INDIANAPOLIS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 11 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":32000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":248600,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":248600,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":248600,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eSerenas Ghost is a perfect two-for-two in her career. The 2-year-old filly became a graded stakes winner in just her second start, and in doing so, she guaranteed herself a place in the John Deere Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Fillies Turf (G1). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn Oct. 2, Serenas Ghost was victorious in the Jessamine Stakes (G2) at Keeneland. The race is part of the Breeders' Cup Challenge Series: Win and You're In initiative. Dismissed at odds of 22-1, Serenas Ghost took on 10 others in the 1 1/16-mile race, and she defeated Seneca Park by 1 ¼ lengths. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSerenas Ghost made her racing debut on Sept. 11 at Horseshoe Indianapolis in a maiden special weight going a mile on the turf. She broke sharply, stalked the pace, and ultimately defeated Sugar Hallow by a length as a 12-1 proposition .\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eJoe Sharp trains Serenas Ghost for Barry and Joni Butzow’s Moving Forward Racing. The homebred filly is by Girvin and out of the stakes-winning Tiznow mare Sirenusa. Sharp is well familiar with her pedigree, having trained both Girvin and Sirenusa. The Butzows bought Sirenusa for $105,000 at the 2016 Keeneland yearling sale.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":6,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Barry Butzow \u0026 Joni Butzow","uid":"blt6fd5041996a9a890","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt6fd5041996a9a890?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Serenas Ghost","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Moving Forward Racing, LLC (Joni Butzow)","trainer":"Joe Sharp","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Serenas Ghost","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltd0ffd8a75c7c3e01/6ac01ef30491eb78ac047efc/Contender_Photo_Serenas_Ghost_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltd0ffd8a75c7c3e01/6ac01ef30491eb78ac047efc/Contender_Photo_Serenas_Ghost_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Sioux Nation","damName":"Etoile Bleu (IRE)","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"March, 31 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"Tattersalls Sceptre Sessions Cheveley Park S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":364236,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CURRAGH","raceName":"Moyglare Stud S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 13 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":463932,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"YORK","raceName":"Harrys Half Million By Goffs (Class 2) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 20 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":811140,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CURRAGH","raceName":"Keeneland Phoenix S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"August, 09 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":462355,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CURRAGH","raceName":"Airlie Stud S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"June, 27 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":148009,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Albany S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"June, 19 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":165060,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"CURRAGH","raceName":"Revamp Conservation And Restoration Irish E.B.F.","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 24 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":29006,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"NAAS","raceName":"Matchbooklovesracing Irish E.B.F.","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 09 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":25929,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":8,"earnings":1294415,"show":0,"win":6,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"75","placeP":"25"},"lifetime":{"starts":8,"earnings":1294415,"show":0,"win":6,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"75","placeP":"25"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"75","placesP":"25","starts":8,"earnings":1294415,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":6,"places":2},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eAlready a winner at the highest level, Sun Goddess (IRE) has had an active juvenile season. She made her racing debut on May 9 at Naas and finished second by a head in the 5-furlong race. She then ran again on May 24, this time at the Curragh going 6 furlongs, and broke her maiden by 5 lengths. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFollowing that effort, Sun Goddess jumped up to stakes company. She competed at Royal Ascot in the June 19 Albany Stakes (G3), in which she finished second in a field of 25. She was a length behind Libertango (IRE) in the 6-furlong race. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSun Goddess then returned to Ireland for the June 27 Airlie Stud Stakes (G2) at the Curragh. She won the 6-furlong race by three-quarters of a length over Green Empress (IRE). \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn Aug. 9, Sun Goddess stepped up in company again and beat the boys as the favorite when she took the 6-furlong Phoenix Stakes (G1) at the Curragh by 1 ¼ lengths over Folsom Blues (IRE). She continued her winning ways at York on Aug. 20 when she exploded from the back of the pack to win the 6-furlong Harry’s Half Millon by 6 lengths. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn Sept. 13 at the Curragh in the 7-furlong Moyglare Stud Stakes (G1), Sun Goddess overwhelmed five foes as the heavy favorite in a 6 1/2-length victory. She ran her win streak to five on Sept. 26 at Newmarket in the 6-furlong Cheveley Park Stakes (G1) by prevailing by a length over Libertango (IRE). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAidan O’Brien trains Sun Goddess for Coolmore. The 2-year-old filly was bred by Owenstown Bloodstock. Sun Goddess is by Sioux Nation and out of the Starspangledbanner (AUS) mare Etoile Bleu (IRE), meaning she hails from the same family as fellow 2026 Group 1 winner Thesecretadversary.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":10,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Owenstown Bloodstock Ltd","uid":"blt132c07da05e43874","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt132c07da05e43874?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Sun Goddess (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Derrick Smith, Mrs. John Magnier, Michael Tabor \u0026 Westerberg (Lucia Walder)","trainer":"Aidan P. O'Brien","country":{"uid":"blta32e5b692b12a246","title":"Ireland","abbreviation":"IRE","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt613f9a736c40223a/61aa4c2b2f8b9e70946988d3/ireland.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Sun Goddess","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt3a3bb7330c8a33bb/6ac3ae36d056026ba4280af9/Contender_Photo_Sun_Goddess.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt3a3bb7330c8a33bb/6ac3ae36d056026ba4280af9/Contender_Photo_Sun_Goddess.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Greatest Honour","damName":"Goodn'ready","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"April, 20 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":"Johnnie Walker Natalma S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 12 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":500000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Surfer Girl S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Del Mar Juvenile Fillies Turf S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 06 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":"bet365 Soaring Free S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 15 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":150000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 31 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":80000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 19 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115100,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":168000,"show":0,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":168000,"show":0,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":3,"earnings":168000,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":3,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eVanta started her career by winning. The 2-year-old filly made her racetrack debut in a maiden special weight at Del Mar on July 31. After racing off the pace in the nine-horse field, Vanta rallied to win the 5- furlong turf race by 1 ¼ lengths over Golden Bee.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOff that promising start, Vanta moved up to stakes company to compete in the Sept. 6 Del Mar Juvenile Fillies Turf Stakes (Listed). This time, she was sent off as the betting favorite and she did not disappoint. Although she came away slow at the start, and once again raced in the back of a nine-horse field, Vanta rewarded her backers by pulling away to win the mile turf contest by 2 ½ lengths over Blockade. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eVanta remained perfect when she delivered a three-quarters of a length victory as the 3-10:favorite in the 1-mile Surfer Girl (G3) at Santa Anita on Oct. 4.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eJeff Mullins trains Vanta for Michele Arthur’s Dutch Girl Holdings and Irving Ventures. She was purchased for $370,000 at the March OBS 2-year-olds in training sale. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eVanta was bred in New York by Sequel Thoroughbreds, Lakland Farm and Truly Thoroughbreds. She is by Greatest Honour and out of the More Than Ready mare Goodn’ready.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Sequel Thoroughbreds LLC, Lakland Farm \u0026 Truly Thoroughbreds Inc.","uid":"blt70e6d6f151440ce2","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt70e6d6f151440ce2?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Vanta","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Dutch Girl Holdings LLC (Michele Arthur) and Irving Ventures LLC (Ruben Islas)","trainer":"Jeff Mullins","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Vanta","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltd5543cb379ac7948/6aa1a3e2144a1551f9de67bc/Contender_Photo_Vanta.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltd5543cb379ac7948/6aa1a3e2144a1551f9de67bc/Contender_Photo_Vanta.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Justify","damName":"Chart","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"March, 23 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":"Johnnie Walker Natalma S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 12 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":500000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 01 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Schuylerville S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 10 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":120000,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":4,"earnings":343512,"show":0,"win":2,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"50"},"lifetime":{"starts":4,"earnings":343512,"show":0,"win":2,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"50"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"50","starts":4,"earnings":343512,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":2},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eVoyager made her racing debut June 10 at Churchill Downs and was sent off as the betting favorite in a maiden special weight. The 2-year-old filly went 5 ½ furlongs on the dirt and finished second by 1 ¾ lengths behind Banana Frost. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor her second start, Voyager headed to Saratoga for the listed Schuylerville Stakes on July 3 going 6 furlongs on the dirt. In her first stakes effort, Voyager finished second. She was beaten 5 ¼ lengths by Harper’s Corner. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA month later, Voyager made the switch to turf, and it was a winning move. She won a maiden special weight at Saratoga on Aug. 1 going 1 1/16 miles. Sent off as the favorite, she won by a nose over Correlation Trade (GB). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eVoyager punched her ticket to the Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Fillies Turf (G1) by capturing the ”Win and You’re In” Natalma Stakes (G1) at Woodbine on Sept. 12. Racing midpack early on, Voyager swung wide at the top of the stretch and hit the front at the three-sixteens pole and held off a host of pursuers to win by 1 1/4 lengths. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMark Casse trains Voyager for D. J. Stable LLC, which was founded by Lois and Len Green. They bought the filly for $300,000 at the 2025 Keeneland January mixed sale. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred by Stoneriggs Farm, Voyager is by Justify and out of the graded-stakes winning Lea mare Chart. \u0026nbsp;D. J. Stable raced Chart before she was sold to Stoneriggs Farm at the 2021 Keeneland November mixed sale for $210,000.\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":10,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Stoneriggs Farm","uid":"bltb78ff5c83b64992c","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltb78ff5c83b64992c?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Voyager","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"D.J. Stable LLC (Leonard C. Green)","trainer":"Mark E. Casse","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Voyager","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltec05fc73cff6fd35/6ac15afc0491ebc520047fec/Contender_Photo_Voyager.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltec05fc73cff6fd35/6ac15afc0491ebc520047fec/Contender_Photo_Voyager.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Flightline","damName":"Starship Jubilee","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"March, 30 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":"bet365 Algonquin S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":250000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Bolton Landing S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 25 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115100,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":176716,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"33"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":176716,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"33"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"67","placesP":"33","starts":3,"earnings":176716,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eHardly a secret when debuting in a 5-furlong turf test Woodbine in July, Go for Launch duly reported home a front-running winner over Royal Foxtrot under Pietro Moran.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eStepping into deeper waters for her next start in the 5 ½-furlong Bolton Landing Stakes (Listed) at Saratoga, she was largely overlooked at odds of 10-1 but she came from just off the pace to win again, this time by 2 ¼ lengths over Allura with Extravaganzoo back in third.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBacked down to 1-2 favoritism in the Algonquin Stakes (G3) when returning to her home base of Woodbine, she was beaten a half-length by the victorious Mrs D.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe filly is campaigned by her breeder, Bonnie Baskin and Adam Corndorf’s Blue Heaven Farm. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred in the purple, the filly is by U.S Horse of the Year and Breeders’ Cup Classic (G1) hero Flightline and she was produced by Starship Jubilee (by Indy Wind), a Canadian Horse of the Year and three-time turf champion female in Canada.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLike Starship Jubilee, Go for Launch is trained by Sovereign Award-winning trainer, Kevin Attard, who collected his first and only win at the World Championships with Moira, winner of the 2024 renewal of the Maker’s Mark Breeders’ Cup Filly \u0026amp; Mare Turf (G1). \r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Blue Heaven Farm","uid":"blt16b92c0d47f41d2c","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt16b92c0d47f41d2c?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Go for Launch","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Blue Heaven Farm (Adam Corndorf and Bonnie Baskin)","trainer":"Kevin Attard","country":{"uid":"bltd313850291635aef","title":"Canada","abbreviation":"CAN","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt4c78a5ec75e090d2/61aa4b152e86841fa22388d7/Flag_of_Canada.jpg","alt":""}},"horseName":"Go for Launch","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte7e3091c35a0260a/6ada37202299f5e18ab96939/Contender_Photo_Go_For_Launch.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte7e3091c35a0260a/6ada37202299f5e18ab96939/Contender_Photo_Go_For_Launch.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":15,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"15","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Cracksman (GB)","damName":"Pure Art (GB)","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"February, 02 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"past