03cp\u003eScommessa Sicura (IRE) has been a consistent runner during her juvenile campaign. A winner in her fourth start, the bay filly also has finished second in five of her seven career starts. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn May 13, Scommessa Sicura debuted at Yarmouth in England and finished second. She also finished second at Newbury on June 1 and Newmarket on June 19. At Newmarket, she lost by a neck to the undefeated Musical Times (IRE). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eScommessa Sicura broke her maiden in her fourth start, which came at Newmarket on July 9. She won the 7-furlong contest by a length over Tall Trees (GB).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOff that winning effort, Scommessa Sicura moved up to stakes company in the Aug. 12 Stonehenge Stakes (Listed) at Salisbury. She finished second by a neck to Quest For Stars (FR).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eScommessa Sicura ran next in the Sept.10 May Hill Stakes (G2) at Doncaster, and she finished second behind her rival Musical Times. On Oct. 9, Musical Times won the Fillies' Mile (G1) at Newmarket, while Scommessa Sicura finished fifth.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAndrew Balding trains Scommessa Sicura for Reece James and Opulence Thoroughbreds, which acquired her for $139,860 as a yearling. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred by Tullpark Ltd., Scommessa Sicura is by Cracksman (GB) and out of the Dutch Art (GB) mare Pure Art (GB).\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":1,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Tullpark Ltd","uid":"blt1b52bf58f40e8002","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt1b52bf58f40e8002?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Scommessa Sicura (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Reece James and Opulence Thoroughbreds (George Gill)","trainer":"Andrew Balding","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Scommessa Sicura","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":16,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"16","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Space Blues (IRE)","damName":"Jeanne Girl (IRE)","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"February, 01 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"CURRAGH","raceName":"Goffs Million","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":1279871,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"CURRAGH","raceName":"Moyglare Stud S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 13 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":463932,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"CURRAGH","raceName":"Jebel Ali Racecourse And Stables Anglesey S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"June, 27 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":79697,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CORK","raceName":"Irish Stallion Farms E.B.F.","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 14 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":25453,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"NAVAN","raceName":"Irish Stallion Farms E.B.F.","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 16 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":25575,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"NAAS","raceName":"Irish Stallion Farms E.B.F. Fillies","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 27 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":25736,"positionAtFinish":5}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":6,"earnings":195649,"show":1,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"17","winP":"33","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":6,"earnings":195649,"show":1,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"17","winP":"33","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"17","winsP":"33","placesP":"0","starts":6,"earnings":195649,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eBallinea Star (IRE) needed a few races under her belt to break her maiden but has gone on to show her class.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe 2-year-old filly made her debut on April 27 going 6 furlongs at Naas where she finished fifth of six. On May 16, she took part in a 5-furlong contest at Navan and finished fourth of seven. In her third start, Ballinea Star became a winner when she defeated 13 others in a 6-furlong maiden race at Cork on June 14.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOff that win, she stepped up in company and took on colts in the Anglesey Stakes (G3) at the Curragh on June 27. Ballinea Star contested the lead throughout the 6 ½-furlong race, and she ultimately prevailed by a half-length over her stablemate Immortal Guard (IRE).\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBallinea Star is the first Group winner for trainer Robson de Aguiar, who was the assistant trainer for Adrian Murray before taking out his own license last November. De Aguiar trains Ballinea Star for his wife, Giselle.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOld Carhue Stud bred the bay filly who is by Space Blues (IRE) and out of the Rip Van Winkle (IRE) mare Jeanne Girl (IRE).\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Old Carhue Stud","uid":"blte7c36be8e668aaa9","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blte7c36be8e668aaa9?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Ballinea Star (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Giselle De Aguiar","trainer":"Robson De Aguiar","country":{"uid":"blta32e5b692b12a246","title":"Ireland","abbreviation":"IRE","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt613f9a736c40223a/61aa4c2b2f8b9e70946988d3/ireland.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Balliena Star","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt5629889d75e88bfd/6ad62a2204e85204e27d2eb3/Contender_Photo_Ballinea_Star_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt5629889d75e88bfd/6ad62a2204e85204e27d2eb3/Contender_Photo_Ballinea_Star_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":17,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"17","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Night of Thunder (IRE)","damName":"No Speak Alexander (IRE)","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"January, 10 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"AYR","raceName":"Ladbrokes New Customers Get 50/1 Old Firm Offer Firth Of Clyde Challenge Cup","grade":"3","raceDate":"September, 19 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100455,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"RIPON","raceName":"British Stallion Studs E.B.F. Ripon Champion Two Yrs Old Trophy S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 31 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":74436,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Albany S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"June, 19 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":165060,"positionAtFinish":23},{"trackName":"GREAT YARMOUTH","raceName":"Download The At The Races App Maiden Fillies Stakes (Class 4) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 13 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":13541,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":4,"earnings":105980,"show":0,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"75","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":4,"earnings":105980,"show":0,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"75","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"75","placesP":"0","starts":4,"earnings":105980,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":3,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eSilent Beauty (IRE) began her career on May 13 at Yarmouth in a 6-furlong contest. The 2-year-old filly defeated seven rivals that day and pulled away to win by 4 lengths. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;For her next race, Silent Beauty stepped up in class to run in the June 19 Albany Stakes (G3) at Royal Ascot. She was prominent early in the 6-furlong race but faded significantly and was soundly beaten. Libertango (IRE) won the race, while Silent Beauty finished 23rd of 25. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSilent Beauty rebounded in her next attempt at stakes company. She lined up in the Aug. 31 Ripon Champion Two Yrs Old Trophy Stakes (Listed), and she returned to her winning ways. She took the 6-furlong contest by 3 lengths.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn her next start, Silent Beauty won again, this time taking the Sept. 19 Firth of Clyde Challenge Cup (G3). She asserted herself in the stretch and won the 6-furlong race by 1 ¾ lengths. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eKevin Philippart de Foy trains Silent Beauty for Kia Joorabchian's Amo Racing Limited, which purchased the filly for $1,172,736 as a yearling. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSilent Beauty was bred by S.D.C.L. \u0026amp; Alexander Bloodstock. She is by Night of Thunder (IRE) and out of the Shalaa (IRE) mare No Speak Alexander (IRE).\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"S.D.C.L. \u0026 Alexander Bloodstock Ltd.","uid":"blt5313755139532b0a","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt5313755139532b0a?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Silent Beauty (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Amo Racing USA (Kiavash Joorabchian)","trainer":"Kevin Philippart De Foy","country":{"uid":"blt440e3ce320965a9b","title":"United Kingdom / England","abbreviation":"GBR","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt02676e7705186e63/61aa4e462e86841fa22388f0/united-kingdom.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Silent Beauty","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":18,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"18","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Night of Thunder (IRE)","damName":"Catalina Bay (IRE)","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"May, 02 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"SALISBURY","raceName":"IRE Incentive It Pays To Buy Irish Dick Poole Fillies S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"September, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":101146,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"Newsells Park Stud Sweet Solera S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"August, 08 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":101197,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Princess Margaret Japan Cup S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"July, 25 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":106599,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"NEWBURY","raceName":"Gracelands Ebf Fillies Novice Stakes (Class 4) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":15931,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":4,"earnings":46957,"show":1,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"25","winP":"25","placeP":"25"},"lifetime":{"starts":4,"earnings":46957,"show":1,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"25","winP":"25","placeP":"25"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"25","winsP":"25","placesP":"25","starts":4,"earnings":46957,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":1,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eNuit d’Eclair (IRE) had a sweet start to her racing career. The 2-year-old filly made her racing debut on July 2 at Newbury in England, and she faced 12 others going 6 furlongs. Nuit d’Eclair raced prominently throughout before taking the lead and winning by a length.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOff the promising debut Nuit d’Eclair headed to Ascot for the July 25 Princess Margaret Japan Cup Stakes (G3). She finished a close fourth, beaten a length by the winning Moonrise (IRE) in the 6-furlong contest. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor her third start, Nuit d’Eclair competed in the Aug. 8 Sweet Solera Stakes (G3), which was held over 7 furlongs. She finished second and was beaten a half-length by Sugar Yes Please (GB).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn Sept. 3, Nuit d’Eclair lined up in the Dick Poole Fillies' Stakes (G3) at Salisbury going 6 furlongs. She finished third in the field of 11, beaten a length by the winning Acclamation Star (GB). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eKevin Philippart de Foy trains Nuit d’Eclair for Kia Joorabchian’s Amo Racing Limited. The racing organization purchased the bay filly for $392,508 as a yearling.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBallyhane bred Nuit d’Eclair in Ireland. She is by Night of Thunder (IRE) and out of the Pastoral Pursuits (GB) mare Catalina Bay (IRE).\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Ballyhane","uid":"bltc03357fa4932d0c8","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltc03357fa4932d0c8?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Nuit d'Eclair (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Amo Racing USA (Kiavash Joorabchian)","trainer":"Kevin Philippart De Foy","country":{"uid":"blt440e3ce320965a9b","title":"United Kingdom / England","abbreviation":"GBR","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt02676e7705186e63/61aa4e462e86841fa22388f0/united-kingdom.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Nuit d'Eclair","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":19,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"19","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Mendelssohn","damName":"Sweeping Cherry","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"April, 19 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"LAUREL PARK","raceName":"Selima S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":125000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DELAWARE PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":45000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":102000,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":102000,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":102000,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eThere has been nothing secret about Hidden Overture’s talent. The 2-year-old filly has begun her career a perfect two-for-two.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOn Sept. 3, Hidden Overture made her racing debut in a maiden special weight at Delaware Park going a mile on the dirt. The race was originally scheduled for 7 ½ furlongs on the turf, but the change did not impact Hidden Overture. Sent off as the betting favorite, she was forwardly placed throughout and then drew off to win by 13 ¾ lengths.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFollowing that debut win, Hidden Overture moved up to stakes company, taking on eight others in the Sept. 26 Selima Stakes at Laurel Park. She once again shook clear of the field in the stretch and then held off the late drive by Homeawayfromhome to win the 1 1/16-mile turf contest by three-quarters of a length. Hidden Overture drifted in the stretch, prompting an objection for interreference, but it was denied by the stewards.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBrittany Russell trains Hidden Overture for Hidden Brook Farm and Michael Golden’s Golden Lion Racing. Hidden Brook acquired the filly for $180,000 at the June OBS 2-year-olds in training sale. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHidden Overture was bred by Tanya Lobsiger. She is by Mendelssohn and out of the Tonalist mare Sweeping Cherry.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Tanya Lobsiger","uid":"blt7dcf222da8ab8445","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt7dcf222da8ab8445?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Hidden Overture","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Hidden Brook Farm (James Hall) and Golden Lion Racing (Mike Golden)","trainer":"Brittany T. Russell","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Hidden Overture","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltfbb08940b3662559/6adcb63d09de0e39be7ac64a/Contender_Photo_Hidden_Overture.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltfbb08940b3662559/6adcb63d09de0e39be7ac64a/Contender_Photo_Hidden_Overture.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":20,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"20","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Flameaway","damName":"Sly Beauty","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"February, 22 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"BELMONT PARK","raceName":"Futurity S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"KENTUCKY DOWNS","raceName":"Untapable S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 30 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":750000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Adirondack S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"August, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":225000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Schuylerville S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":5},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 15 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":120000,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":6,"earnings":309750,"show":1,"win":1,"place":3,"showP":"17","winP":"17","placeP":"50"},"lifetime":{"starts":6,"earnings":309750,"show":1,"win":1,"place":3,"showP":"17","winP":"17","placeP":"50"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"17","winsP":"17","placesP":"50","starts":6,"earnings":309750,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":1,"places":3},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eLuminous Beauty has had a productive juvenile campaign. The 2-year-old filly finished second in her debut May 15 in a 5-furlong maiden special weight on dirt at Churchill Downs. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThen, on June 4, she won a maiden special weight by 6 ¼ lengths at Saratoga going 5 ½-furlings on dirt. Off that impressive score, Luminous Beauty competed in the July 3 Schuylerville Stakes (Listed) and finished fifth. Luminous Beauty then lined up in the Aug. 2 Adirondack Stakes (G3) and finished second behind Stress Relief.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLuminous Beauty made the switch to turf when she ran in the Aug. 30 Untapable Stakes (Listed) at Kentucky Downs. She did well in the 6 ½-furlong race and took the lead before being beaten by Seneca Park by a neck. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor her next start, Luminous Beauty returned to New York to run in the Oct. 3 Futurity Stakes (G3) at Belmont Park against colts. She finished third behind Good to Be King and Regent’s Park.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eJena Antonucci trains Luminous Beauty for Fred Rosen, Steve Dervenis, Cliff Racing and her own horseOlo, which she co-founded with Katie Miranda. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred by Debby Oxley, Luminous Beauty is by Flameaway and out of the Into Mischief mare Sly Beauty. She was purchased by Horseology as a yearling for $40,000.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":2,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Debby M. Oxley","uid":"blt1ca7e918c07bc902","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt1ca7e918c07bc902?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Luminous Beauty","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"horseOlogy (Katie Miranda), Fredrick Rosen, Steve Dervenis and Cliff Racing LLC (David Schlosser)","trainer":"Jena M. Antonucci","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Luminous Beauty","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltbd10ec8ccd27c4ac/6aabfa4bd1556f43e1728429/Contender_Photo_Luminous_Beauty.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltbd10ec8ccd27c4ac/6aabfa4bd1556f43e1728429/Contender_Photo_Luminous_Beauty.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":21,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"21","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Epicenter","damName":"Hassler (IRE)","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"April, 29 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"Jessamine S. Presented by Keeneland Sales","grade":"2","raceDate":"October, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":400000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"KENTUCKY DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 30 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":78500,"show":0,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":78500,"show":0,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":78500,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":1,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eQuibbler showed her ability at first asking. The 2-year-old filly made her racing debut on Aug. 30 in a maiden special weight at Kentucky Downs going a mile on the turf. She faced 11 others and was dismissed at odds of 22-1, but that did not keep her from finding the winner’s circle. Quibbler pulled away to win by 3 ¼ lengths.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFollowing that victory on debut, Quibbler jumped up to stakes company. Although she also was entered in the Oct. 3 Miss Grillo Stakes (G2) at Belmont Park, she made her second start in the Oct. 2 Jessamine Stakes (G2) at Keeneland. This time she faced 10 others going 1 1/16 miles on the turf. After racing near the back of the field, Quibbler put in her bid and finished fourth. She was 3 ¼ lengths behind the winner, Serenas Ghost.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRiley Mott trains Quibbler for Glencrest Farm, 30A Thoroughbreds and Seth Eskind. She was a $20,000 Keeneland September yearling purchase.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eJim and Donna Daniell bred Quibbler. She is by Epicenter and out of the War Front mare Hassler (IRE). Hassler is an unraced daughter of multiple Grade 1 winner and Breeders’ Cup participant Turbulent Descent.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Jim Daniell \u0026 Donna Daniell","uid":"blt8ec21e031165921c","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt8ec21e031165921c?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Quibbler","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Glencrest Farm, LLC (Deuce Greathouse) , 30A Thoroughbreds (Ryan Templeton) \u0026 Seth Eskind","trainer":"Riley Mott","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Quibbler","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt612cbc7489ceb532/6ace4e616d1916233015a3dd/Contender_Photo_Quibbler.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt612cbc7489ceb532/6ace4e616d1916233015a3dd/Contender_Photo_Quibbler.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":22,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"22","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Cotai Glory (GB)","damName":"Comical (IRE)","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"February, 01 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"DUNDALK","raceName":"Irish Stallion Farms E.B.F. Star Appeal S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"October, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":56215,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"DEAUVILLE","raceName":"Sumbe Prix du Calvados","grade":"2","raceDate":"August, 23 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":138978,"positionAtFinish":6},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Princess Margaret Japan Cup S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"July, 25 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":106599,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Albany S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"June, 19 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":165060,"positionAtFinish":6},{"trackName":"THIRSK","raceName":"Marion Gibson Brown Memorial - Irish Ebf Restricted Maiden Fillies Stakes (Class 4) (For Horses In Bands C And D) (","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 16 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":13325,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":37125,"show":1,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"20","winP":"20","placeP":"20"},"lifetime":{"starts":5,"earnings":37125,"show":1,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"20","winP":"20","placeP":"20"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"20","winsP":"20","placesP":"20","starts":5,"earnings":37125,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":1,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eDee’s Funny Girl (IRE) showed her ability in her first start. The 2-year-old bay filly won at first asking May 16 at Thirsk going 5 furlongs. She defeated Penny Arcade (IRE) by 1 ½ lengths. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFollowing her winning debut, Dee’s Funny Girl was offered at the Goffs London Sale just prior to Royal Ascot. Owners Peter and Dee Airey sold her to Steve Weston and Medallion Racing for $201,100. Barry Fowler and Evan Trommer are now also partners in the filly. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn her second start, Dee’s Funny Girl competed at Royal Ascot, finishing sixth in a field of 25 in the June 19 Albany Stakes (G3). She was 5 ¾ lengths behind the victorious Libertango (IRE) in the 6-furlong race. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOriginally trained by Michael Keady, Dee’s Funny Girl then moved to the barn of Donnacha O’Brien. She made her next start in the July 25 Princess Margaret Japan Cup Stakes (G3) at Ascot. The 6-furlong contest, a Breeders’ Cup Challenge Series a \"Win and You're In\" race, drew a field of 11, and Dee’s Funny Girl finished second, beaten only a neck by Moonrise (IRE). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShe ventured to Deauville in her next start for the 7-furlong Prix du Calvados (G2) and never was a factor finishing last of six as the favorite over soft ground. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTally-Ho Stud bred Dee’s Funny Girl. She is by Cotai Glory (GB) and out of the No Nay Never mare Comical (IRE).\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Tally Ho Stud","uid":"blt124cc3adbed1a85a","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt124cc3adbed1a85a?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Dee's Funny Girl (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Medallion Racing (Phillip Shelton), Evan Trommer , Parkland Thoroughbreds (Steve Weston), Barry Fowler","trainer":"Donnacha O'Brien","country":{"uid":"blta32e5b692b12a246","title":"Ireland","abbreviation":"IRE","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt613f9a736c40223a/61aa4c2b2f8b9e70946988d3/ireland.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Dee's Funny Girl","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltba2e9391eccdae47/6ac92abca6d87a896ab52cc8/Contender_Photo_Dee_s_Funny_Girl.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltba2e9391eccdae47/6ac92abca6d87a896ab52cc8/Contender_Photo_Dee_s_Funny_Girl.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt50b23caa598127b5","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":23,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"23","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""}]},{"uid":"blt147bf9aab46584d3","raceName":"Breeders' Cup Juvenile Fillies","raceDetails":{"type":"World Championships","bcType":"Juvenile Fillies","sponsor":[],"sponsorLogo":null,"date":"2026-10-30T19:35:00.000Z","priorYearChampionPhoto":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltc48fd361a0f3d345/69247cd2179d4391c432d803/Juvenile_Fillies_-_Super_Corredora.jpg"},"displayPostTime":true,"isCompleted":false,"isLive":false,"purse":"$2,000,000","distance":"1 1/16 Miles","grade":1,"ageV2":"2","division":"Juvenile Fillies","exacta":"","trifecta":"","superfecta":"","superHighFive":"","dailyDouble":"","pick3":"","pick4":"","pick5":"","pick6":"","region":""},"isTvScheduled":true,"broadcast":{"partners":[{"logo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltceb0312138059807/632b128204361d715f5522c1/USA_Network-Logo-SVGs_146x60-USA.svg"},"time":""},{"logo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt29c35e9a30ccbba3/68d1ca298c48984dc7622c30/22-BC-162_New-BCcom_Network-Logo-SVGs_146x60-v1-05-Peacock.svg"},"time":""}]},"trackDetails":[{"uid":"bltc1d1c6b40525bf04","details":{"name":"Keeneland","logo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt276fb8147db83742/629e62383d4e745ed3ae5859/keeneland.png"},"image":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltb0b7768e84d44449/614ce97164c8007a9bdec19c/Keeneland_Track_Image.jpeg"},"locationBcbc":"Keeneland","timeZone":-4}}],"raceDescription":"\u003ch1\u003eA proving ground for tomorrow's distaff legends.\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Fillies, restricted to two-year-old females, is run at 1 1/16 miles, a little more than the circumference of the racetrack. It’s a heart pounding test of strength and endurance for the world’s best two-year old fillies. And in nearly all cases over the years, the winner of the Juvenile Fillies has been named the Champion of all two-year-old females.\u003c/p\u003e","surface":"","bettingCtaOverride":{"cta":[]},"horseType":"pre-entries","horses":[{"sireName":"Uncle Mo","damName":"Donatella","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"April, 12 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"BELMONT PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"October, 07 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 29 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 25 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115000,"positionAtFinish":5}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":31500,"show":0,"win":0,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"0","placeP":"33"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":31500,"show":0,"win":0,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"0","placeP":"33"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"0","placesP":"33","starts":3,"earnings":31500,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eBadditude has yet to win a race, but she has improved in each of her three starts and has high-profile connections in her corner. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTrained by Hall of Famer Todd Pletcher, the daughter of Uncle Mo out of the Bernardini mare Donatella had a wide trip in her debut in a 6-furlong maiden special weight race at Saratoga on July 25, checking in fifth of nine under Irad Ortiz Jr. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShe improved slightly in her second start a month later with Tyler Gaffilione in the irons, getting nipped for an on-the-board placing after taking the lead in the upper stretch of a similar Saratoga maiden event on Aug. 29. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHer last race, a 1-mile maiden heat at Belmont Park, was her best to date, as she and new rider Flavien Prat set the pace and then battled through the stretch to miss by a neck to Mioruilt.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;Bred by WinStar Farm LLC, Badditude was purchased for $425,000 by Repole Stables at last year’s Keeneland September yearling sale.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"WinStar Farm, LLC","uid":"blt8952d405e1a5856e","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt8952d405e1a5856e?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Badittude","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Repole Stable (Mike Repole)","trainer":"Todd A. Pletcher","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Badittude","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt147bf9aab46584d3","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Speaker's Corner","damName":"Special You","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"February, 14 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Oak Leaf S. presented by Oak Tree Racing Association","grade":"2","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 05 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":80000,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":136000,"show":0,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"50"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":136000,"show":0,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"50"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"50","starts":2,"earnings":136000,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":1,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eDomain Expansion ran well on the turf in her debut, but she exploded on the dirt in her second start, drawing off to a 7-length score in the $200,00 Oak Leaf Stakes (G2) at Santa Anita on Oct. 3.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe victory in the 1 1/16-mile “Win and You’re In” Breeders’ Cup Challenge Series race earned the Leonard Powell-trained bay filly a spot in the $2 million Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Fillies at Keeneland on Oct. 30.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRidden in both her starts by relative newcomer Adrian Escobedo, Domain Expansion debuted in a 1-mile maiden special weight race on the turf at Del Mar on Sept. 5, finishing with a rush to be second, beaten 1 ¼ lengths. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSwitched to dirt in the Oak Leaf, the daughter of Speaker’s Corner out of the Medaglia d’Oro filly Special You stalked the early pace before drawing off at the top of the stretch to beat the highly regarded Bob Baffert-trained Holmby and four others.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred by Machmer Hall, Carrie Brogden and Craig Brogden, Domain Expansion sold at the Keeneland September yearling sale for $130,000 and now races for California Racing Partners, Ciaglia Racing LLC, Allen R. Keith and Kevin O’Donnell.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Machmer Hall, Carrie Brogden \u0026 Craig Brogden","uid":"bltd97897ac2aa02a55","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltd97897ac2aa02a55?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Domain Expansion","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"California Racing Partners (Matthew W. Dohman), Ciaglia Racing, LLC (Joe Ciaglia), Kevin O'Donnell \u0026 Allen R. Keith","trainer":"Leonard Powell","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Domain Expansion","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt5a10bb1f8244eb95/6ac1785ed89724029d09c8a1/Contender_Photo_-_Domain_Expansion.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt5a10bb1f8244eb95/6ac1785ed89724029d09c8a1/Contender_Photo_-_Domain_Expansion.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt147bf9aab46584d3","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":true,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Nyquist","damName":"Convinced","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"February, 27 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"Darley Alcibiades S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"October, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":650000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"MONMOUTH PARK","raceName":"Sorority S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 29 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":106000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"COLONIAL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 25 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":70000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":404250,"show":0,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":404250,"show":0,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":3,"earnings":404250,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":3,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eUndefeated Emphatic’s victory in the $650,000 Alcibiades Stakes (G1) on Oct. 2 was just that, as she fended off 4-5 favorite Summer Starlet in the 1 1/16-mile contest over the Keeneland dirt track.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eJockey Tyler Gaffalione took advantage of Emphatic’s rail draw to dictate a moderate pace through the early stages and had enough in the stretch to finish 1 1/4 lengths ahead of her closest pursuer, who finished 17 ½ lengths clear of the third-place finisher. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe victory in the “Win and You’re In” Breeders’ Cup Challenge Series race earned the Pennsylvania-bred bay filly a spot in the starting gate for the $2 million Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Fillies (G1) on Oct. 30 at Keeneland.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBrendan Walsh trains the daughter of Nyquist out of the unraced Tiznow mare Convinced for owners Gainesway Stable and Andrew Rosen.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmphatic has been ridden by different riders in each of her three victories, with Mychel Sanchez in irons for her 6 ¾-length debut score over 6 furlongs at Colonial Downs and Edwin Gonzalez aboard for a 5 ¼-length score in the $106,000 Sorority Stakes at a mile at Monmouth Park.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eEmphatic was bred by Jon A. Marshall and purchased for $260,000 at the 2025 Keeneland September yearling sale.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":10,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Jon A. Marshall","uid":"blt3adf58bf40a89df6","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt3adf58bf40a89df6?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Emphatic","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Gainesway Stable (Antony Beck) \u0026 Andrew Rosen","trainer":"Brendan P. Walsh","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Emphatic","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt899a1661fdb29eb1/6ac023f41cd746a08217c1d9/Contender_Photo_Emphatic_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt899a1661fdb29eb1/6ac023f41cd746a08217c1d9/Contender_Photo_Emphatic_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt147bf9aab46584d3","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Gun Runner","damName":"Covfefe","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"February, 04 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 27 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":120000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 29 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115000,"positionAtFinish":3}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":82888,"show":1,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"50","winP":"50","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":82888,"show":1,"win":1,"place":0,"showP":"50","winP":"50","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"50","winsP":"50","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":82888,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":1,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eFoxiest has only a maiden special weight victory to her credit from two starts, but her bloodlines and human connections suggest she is not a filly to take lightly in the $2 million Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Fillies (G1) on Oct. 30 at Keeneland.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTrained by Brad Cox, who has conditioned 11 Breeders’ Cup winners, the LNJ Foxwoods homebred is a daughter of Covfefe, dual Eclipse Award winner of 2019 (champion female sprinter and champion 3-year-old filly) and winner of the Breeders' Cup Filly \u0026amp; Mare Sprint (G1) at Santa Anita that same year.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHer sire is Gun Runner, one of the top stallions in North America and Horse of the Year and winner of the Breeders’ Cup Classic (G1) in 2017. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFoxiest broke a bit slowly under Manny Franco in her debut in a 6-furlong maiden special weight race at Saratoga on Aug. 29 before rallying wide into the stretch and finishing third, 2 ½ lengths behind the winner. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShe made amends nearly a month later at Churchill Downs, when she stalked the early pace inside under new rider Luis Saez and then bulled her way between two rivals in the upper stretch before cruising to a 3 ¾-length win in the 7 ½-furlong contest. \r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"LNJ Foxwoods","uid":"blt8d08cbe629e56e82","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt8d08cbe629e56e82?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Foxiest","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"LNJ Foxwoods (Jaime Roth)","trainer":"Brad Cox","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Foxiest","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt147bf9aab46584d3","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Lexitonian","damName":"Stormy Allure","sex":"Filly","color":"Chestnut","foalingDate":"February, 20 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"October, 07 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":63000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Bolton Landing S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 17 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":90000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":99584,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":99584,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"67","placesP":"0","starts":3,"earnings":99584,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eLexi’s Charm has not yet faced top company in the 2-year-old fillies division, but she is undefeated in two starts on dirt and ran creditably in a turf stakes race in her only other outing.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Kentucky-bred filly trained by Mark Casse – a six-time Breeders’ Cup winner from 78 starters -- broke her maiden at first asking, rallying wide under Irad Ortiz Jr. to capture a 5 ½-furlong maiden special weight race at Saratoga on July 17.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSwitched to turf for the listed 5 ½-furlong $200,000 Bolton’s Landing Stakes (Listed) at Saratoga, Lexi’s Charm broke slowly under new pilot Jose Ortiz and gradually improved her position to finish fourth, 4 ½ lengths behind winner Go for Launch, who is a candidate for the $1 million Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf Sprint (G1).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eReturning to dirt, Lexi’s Charm took six rivals gate to wire with Jose Ortiz again in the irons to win a $50,000 starter allowance race at 6 furlongs at Keeneland on Oct. 7.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLexi’s Charm, a daughter of Lexitonian out of the Stormy Atlantic mare Stormy Allure, was bred in Kentucky by Nicholas M. Lotz and purchased for $15,000 at the 2025 Keeneland September yearling sale by owners Bill and Liz Poston Racing Inc. and Brad Smith.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Nicholas M. Lotz","uid":"bltc37653a31239f855","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltc37653a31239f855?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Lexi's Charm","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Bill and Liz Poston Racing, Inc. (Bill and Liz Poston) \u0026 Brad Smith","trainer":"Mark E. Casse","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Lexi's Charm","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt004518659e4a71ca/6adcb368f0e9f28e82e19ac2/Contender_Photo_Lexi_s_Charm.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt004518659e4a71ca/6adcb368f0e9f28e82e19ac2/Contender_Photo_Lexi_s_Charm.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt147bf9aab46584d3","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Life Is Good","damName":"Smart Shopping","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"February, 22 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"DELAWARE PARK","raceName":"White Clay Creek S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":150000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Spinaway S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 05 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":7},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 01 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":97750,"show":0,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"33","placeP":"33"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":97750,"show":0,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"33","placeP":"33"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"33","placesP":"33","starts":3,"earnings":97750,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":1,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eLife Changing has just one victory to her name, but it was a memorable one. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Todd Pletcher-trained bay filly came out running in her debut, a 6-furlong maiden special weight race at Saratoga on Aug. 1. Gunned to the lead by jockey Luis Saez, the Repole Stable color-bearer held several pursuers at bay through first half-mile before opening up in the stretch and coasting to a 7-length victory as the 2-1 favorite. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShe made her stakes debut on Sept. 5 in the 7-furlong Spinaway (G1) at Saratoga but was eased after dropping back midway on the far turn. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLife Changing arrived with high expectations. Repole Stables purchased the bay filly, bred in Kentucky by Jamm LTD, for $1.025 million at auction as a yearling. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHer pedigree explains why: She is a half-sister to 2024 Preakness Stakes (G1) winner Seize the Grey and her dam, Smart Shopping, is descended from a prolific female family. Life Changing’s sire, Life is Good -- a winner of 9 of 12 starts, including four Grade 1s -- also ranks as one of the top freshman sires in North America. \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Jamm, Ltd.","uid":"blta07cbf0c350b3753","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blta07cbf0c350b3753?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Life Changing","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Repole Stable (Mike Repole)","trainer":"Todd A. Pletcher","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Life Changing","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt913f77f682c734d0/6a7b79a81f7b5a5d2678ffde/Contender_Photo_Life_Changing.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt913f77f682c734d0/6a7b79a81f7b5a5d2678ffde/Contender_Photo_Life_Changing.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt147bf9aab46584d3","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Upstart","damName":"Drop Dead Red","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"March, 05 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Pocahontas S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"September, 12 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ELLIS PARK","raceName":"Ellis Park Debutante S. presented by Hausmann Outdoor Solutions","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 09 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":250000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 20 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":92000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":383981,"show":0,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":383981,"show":0,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":3,"earnings":383981,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":3,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eManuka Honey has been as sweet as her namesake so far, with three wins in her first three starts.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Brian Lynch-trained daughter of Upstart out of the Hold Me Back mare Drop Dead Red was a 7 ¼-length winner as the 8-5 favorite in her debut, a 5-furlong maiden special weight race at Churchill Downs on June 20.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe dark bay Kentucky-bred, who has been ridden by Luis Saez and favored in all three starts, returned to laugh at the competition, with a 7-length win in the $250,000 Ellis Park Debutante at 7 furlongs on Aug. 9.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShe had to work for her third triumph, coming from farther back to grind out a 2-length victory in the Pocohontas Stakes (G3) at a mile at Churchill Downs on Sept. 12.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eManuka Honey, named after a high-end New Zealand honey said to impart medical benefits, did not attain her $19,000 reserve at last year’s Fasig-Tipton fall yearling sale and is now owned by an ownership group consisting of breeder Terry Hamilton and Lisa Lee, Jason Sciortino, William Lynch and Brian Howe.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":4,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Terry Hamilton","uid":"bltbafea42fbfb581cc","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltbafea42fbfb581cc?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Manuka Honey","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Lisa Lee, Jason Sciortino, William Lynch, Brian Howe and Terry Hamilton","trainer":"Brian A. Lynch","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Manuka Honey","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte2a4cf3cb1496da0/6aabf8f111ab883fa75b966b/Contender_Photo_Manuka_Honey.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte2a4cf3cb1496da0/6aabf8f111ab883fa75b966b/Contender_Photo_Manuka_Honey.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt147bf9aab46584d3","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Early Voting","damName":"Lipstikliesnlovers","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"January, 27 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Del Mar Debutante S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 05 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 09 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":240000,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":240000,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":240000,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eTrainer Bob Baffert’s barn is again overflowing with talented 2-year-olds and the precocious filly Miss Monica looks to be one of his budding stars after notching the easiest of victories in her Aug. 9 debut at Del Mar. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRidden by Juan Hernandez, the daughter of Early Voting sprinted to the front in a 6 ½-furlong maiden special weight contest, shrugged off a mild challenge from runner-up Well Versed entering the stretch, then cruised under a light hand ride to a 5 ¾-length win. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBesides being visually impressive, Miss Monica’s speed figures for the race were higher than those given to stablemate Holmby for winning the Sorrento Stakes (G3) later on the card. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWheeled right back in the 7-furlong Del Mar Debutante (G1) on Sept. 5, Miss Monica was bet down to 2-5 favoritism and caused her backers no worries as she romped to a 6 1/4-length victory while being geared down in the final yards. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred in Kentucky by Doug Branham, Felicia Branham and Pippa's Hurricane LLC, Miss Monica was purchased for $850,000 by longtime Baffert clients Mike Pegram, Karl Watson and Paul Weitman at the Ocala, Florida, 2-year-olds in training sale in April. \u0026nbsp; \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHot freshman sire Early Voting’s pedigree suggests Miss Monica will handle longer distances. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShe is the second foal of the unraced mare Lipstikliesnlovers, whose unnamed sibling did not race.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":10,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Doug Branham \u0026 Felicia Branham \u0026 Pippa's Hurricane LLC","uid":"blt14095db945839a41","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt14095db945839a41?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Miss Monica","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Michael E. Pegram, Karl Watson \u0026 Paul Weitman","trainer":"Bob Baffert","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Miss Monica","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt52c07420cce89764/6ac1868b4f25ca64a49699cb/Contender_Photo_Miss_Monica_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt52c07420cce89764/6ac1868b4f25ca64a49699cb/Contender_Photo_Miss_Monica_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt147bf9aab46584d3","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Girvin","damName":"Hardcore Candy","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"April, 03 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"BELMONT PARK","raceName":"Frizette S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":500000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"MONMOUTH PARK","raceName":"Sorority S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 29 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":106000,"positionAtFinish":3}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":70000,"show":2,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"100","winP":"0","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":70000,"show":2,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"100","winP":"0","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"100","winsP":"0","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":70000,"racingYear":2026,"shows":2,"wins":0,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eRevenge of the Sis has yet to win a race, but she is Grade 1-placed after finishing third in the Frizette Stakes (G1) at Belmont Park in just her second start.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe daughter of Girvin, trained by George Weaver, earned entry-fee credits for the $2 million Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Fillies (G1) through her on-the -board placing Oct. 3 in the 1-mile Frizette, a Breeders' Cup Dirt Dozen event.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn the Frizette, Revenge of the Sis dropped back from the rail under jockey Edgard Zayas and was last of seven before commencing a solid rally on the turn and finishing well to be third behind expected Juvenile Fillies rivals Dotsy and Rum Twist.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShe also closed late in her debut in the 1-mile Sorority Stakes, a black-type affair at Monmouth Park on Aug. 29. After breaking slowly and steadying under jockey Jose Gomez, Revenge of the Sis raced at the rear of the nine-horse pack for a half-mile before launching a rally along the rail that landed her a third-place finish. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRevenge of the Sis is a daughter of the Yonaguska mare Hardcore Candy. She was bred in Kentucky by John Ropes and is now co-owned by CJ Thoroughbreds and Ropes after selling for $500,000 at the Keeneland September yearling sale.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":4,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"John Ropes","uid":"blt23363fbc7388f2d9","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt23363fbc7388f2d9?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Revenge of the Sis","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"CJ Thoroughbreds (Corey Johnson) \u0026 John Ropes","trainer":"George Weaver","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Revenge of the Sis","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt1a936e7f9c64c4fa/6ada5006fad7346ea1d098a1/Contender_Photo_Revenge_of_the_Sis.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt1a936e7f9c64c4fa/6ada5006fad7346ea1d098a1/Contender_Photo_Revenge_of_the_Sis.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt147bf9aab46584d3","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Mandaloun","damName":"Rumandice","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"April, 10 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"BELMONT PARK","raceName":"Frizette S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":500000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 05 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 08 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 11 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115000,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":4,"earnings":193150,"show":0,"win":1,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"25","placeP":"50"},"lifetime":{"starts":4,"earnings":193150,"show":0,"win":1,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"25","placeP":"50"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"25","placesP":"50","starts":4,"earnings":193150,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":1,"places":2},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eRum Twist took a couple races to get her act together, but a runner-up effort in the $500,000 Frizette Stakes (G1) at Belmont Park showed she fits in the top flight of 2-year-old distaff runners.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Mark Hennig-trained filly earned entry-fee credits for the $2 million Breeders‘ Cup Juvenile Fillies (G1) through her placing in the 1-mile Frizette, a Breeders' Cup Dirt Dozen event.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe daughter of Mandaloun out of the Congrats mare Rumandice took three starts to break her maiden, finishing second and fourth in two maiden special weight races at Saratoga under jockey John Velazquez in her first two starts.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eJockey Paco Lopez replaced Velazquez in a 7-furlong maiden special weight race at Saratoga on Sept. 5 and engineered an impressive 5 ¾-length victory from off the pace.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThat proved to be no fluke in the Frizette, when Lopez moved Rum Twist into contention on the turn and chased home winner Dotsy through the stretch. Both Dotsy and third-place Frizette finisher Revenge of the Sis are expected to contest the 1 1/16-mile Juvenile Fillies at Keeneland on Oct. 30.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred in Kentucky by Machmer Hall, Rum Twist sold for $260,000 in the Ocala Breeders’ March 2-year-olds in training sale to Lee Lewis, who owns the filly with his wife, Lexi.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":6,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Machmer Hall","uid":"blt0d54e4b5911b60f9","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt0d54e4b5911b60f9?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Rum Twist","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"R. Lee Lewis and Lexi J. Lewis","trainer":"Mark A. Hennig","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Rum Twist","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt0cc60d3fa22b2f13/6ace477e7a4b454d61dca168/Contender_Photo_Rum_Twist_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt0cc60d3fa22b2f13/6ace477e7a4b454d61dca168/Contender_Photo_Rum_Twist_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt147bf9aab46584d3","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Life Is Good","damName":"Asiya","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"March, 12 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Pocahontas S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"September, 12 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Adirondack S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"August, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":225000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"ELLIS PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 06 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":144868,"show":1,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"33","winP":"33","placeP":"33"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":144868,"show":1,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"33","winP":"33","placeP":"33"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"33","winsP":"33","placesP":"33","starts":3,"earnings":144868,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":1,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eWith a winning race on debut this summer at Ellis Park and two solid efforts in subsequent graded stakes, Scarlett Begonia has the credentials to be a factor in the $2 million Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Fillies (G1) at Keeneland.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTrained by Brad Cox, Scarlett Begonia made short work of 10 rivals in the 5 ½-furlong maiden special weight race at Ellis Park on July 6, rallying from midpack under Luan Machado to draw clear by 3 ¾ lengths at the wire.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLeaping into stakes company, the filly finished a good third in the 6 ½-furlong Adirondack Stakes (G3) at Saratoga with Irad Ortiz Jr. in the irons. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShe took another step forward in her third start, finishing second to expected Juvenile Fillies rival Manuka Honey in the 1-mile Pocohontas Stakes (G3) at Churchill Downs. Flavien Prat had the mount that day.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred in Kentucky by Gray Lyster and Gatewood Bell, Scarlett Begonia is a daughter of Life is Good out of the Daaher mare Asiya. Bell and Lyster retained co-ownership in the filly through their racing operations, Hat Creek Racing and Ashview Farm, respectively, and added partner \u0026nbsp;Upland Flats Racing after bids did not meet the reserve when she was twice offered for auction. \r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":3,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Gray Lyster \u0026 Gatewood Bell","uid":"bltf561370cf9947810","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltf561370cf9947810?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Scarlett Begonia","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Hat Creek Racing (Gatewood Bell), Ashview Farm (Wayne Lyster) \u0026 Upland Flats Racing (Patrick Lewis)","trainer":"Brad Cox","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Scarlett Begonia","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt7ee79b3edcb13ced/6adcb3fc09de0e8fca7ac646/Contender_Photo_Scarlett_Begonia.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt7ee79b3edcb13ced/6adcb3fc09de0e8fca7ac646/Contender_Photo_Scarlett_Begonia.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt147bf9aab46584d3","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Justify","damName":"Chart","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"March, 23 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":"Johnnie Walker Natalma S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 12 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":500000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 01 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Schuylerville S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 10 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":120000,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":4,"earnings":343512,"show":0,"win":2,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"50"},"lifetime":{"starts":4,"earnings":343512,"show":0,"win":2,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"50"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"50","starts":4,"earnings":343512,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":2},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eVoyager made her racing debut June 10 at Churchill Downs and was sent off as the betting favorite in a maiden special weight. The 2-year-old filly went 5 ½ furlongs on the dirt and finished second by 1 ¾ lengths behind Banana Frost. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor her second start, Voyager headed to Saratoga for the listed Schuylerville Stakes on July 3 going 6 furlongs on the dirt. In her first stakes effort, Voyager finished second. She was beaten 5 ¼ lengths by Harper’s Corner. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA month later, Voyager made the switch to turf, and it was a winning move. She won a maiden special weight at Saratoga on Aug. 1 going 1 1/16 miles. Sent off as the favorite, she won by a nose over Correlation Trade (GB). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eVoyager punched her ticket to the Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Fillies Turf (G1) by capturing the ”Win and You’re In” Natalma Stakes (G1) at Woodbine on Sept. 12. Racing midpack early on, Voyager swung wide at the top of the stretch and hit the front at the three-sixteens pole and held off a host of pursuers to win by 1 1/4 lengths. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMark Casse trains Voyager for D. J. Stable LLC, which was founded by Lois and Len Green. They bought the filly for $300,000 at the 2025 Keeneland January mixed sale. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred by Stoneriggs Farm, Voyager is by Justify and out of the graded-stakes winning Lea mare Chart. \u0026nbsp;D. J. Stable raced Chart before she was sold to Stoneriggs Farm at the 2021 Keeneland November mixed sale for $210,000.\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":10,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Stoneriggs Farm","uid":"bltb78ff5c83b64992c","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltb78ff5c83b64992c?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Voyager","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"D.J. Stable LLC (Leonard C. Green)","trainer":"Mark E. Casse","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Voyager","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltec05fc73cff6fd35/6ac15afc0491ebc520047fec/Contender_Photo_Voyager.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltec05fc73cff6fd35/6ac15afc0491ebc520047fec/Contender_Photo_Voyager.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt147bf9aab46584d3","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""}]},{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","raceName":"Breeders' Cup Juvenile Turf Sprint","raceDetails":{"type":"World Championships","bcType":"Juvenile Turf Sprint","sponsor":[{"title":"QA Sponsor","redirectUrl":"/qatestenviron","label":"Presented by","logos":{"color":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt47302df6e371b596/6930b337a8606c4ef1964fce/KeenelandGradF_Rev_343_1.png"},"white":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltf33c9614ab2b50b5/66e30fb0bc8b1c7ddb3aa315/Logo_Longines_white_RGB(2).png"},"black":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt76743257ff83f611/61f2b4d465ceda6b20b4aaac/60_x140px.png","alt":""}},"sponsoredUrls":["/qa-featured-content-layout","/qa-videos","/qatestenviron"],"sponsoredSection":""}],"sponsorLogo":null,"date":"2026-10-30T18:55:00.000Z","priorYearChampionPhoto":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt03361299f2b52148/69247ccb36d194aac57fd6c4/Juvenile_Turf_Sprint_-_cy_fair.jpg"},"displayPostTime":true,"isCompleted":false,"isLive":false,"purse":"$1,000,000","distance":"5.5 Furlongs","grade":1,"ageV2":"2","division":"Juvenile Turf Sprint","exacta":"","trifecta":"","superfecta":"","superHighFive":"","dailyDouble":"","pick3":"","pick4":"","pick5":"","pick6":"","region":""},"isTvScheduled":true,"broadcast":{"partners":[{"logo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltceb0312138059807/632b128204361d715f5522c1/USA_Network-Logo-SVGs_146x60-USA.svg"},"time":""},{"logo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt29c35e9a30ccbba3/68d1ca298c48984dc7622c30/22-BC-162_New-BCcom_Network-Logo-SVGs_146x60-v1-05-Peacock.svg"},"time":""}]},"trackDetails":[{"uid":"bltc1d1c6b40525bf04","details":{"name":"Keeneland","logo":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt276fb8147db83742/629e62383d4e745ed3ae5859/keeneland.png"},"image":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltb0b7768e84d44449/614ce97164c8007a9bdec19c/Keeneland_Track_Image.jpeg"},"locationBcbc":"Keeneland","timeZone":-4}}],"raceDescription":"\u003ch1\u003eThe world's fastest future stars.\u003c/h1\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe Breeders' Cup Juvenile Turf Sprint made its debut at the 2018 World Championships at Churchill Downs and has quickly become an exhilarating fan favorite. This grass course race, which is open to male and female two-year-olds, carries a $1 million purse and is limited to 12 starters.\u003c/p\u003e","surface":"","bettingCtaOverride":{"cta":[]},"horseType":"pre-entries","horses":[{"sireName":"Yaupon","damName":"Ready to Unleash","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"March, 26 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"BELMONT PARK","raceName":"Matron S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 27 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":2,"earnings":173250,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":2,"earnings":173250,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"100","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"100","placesP":"0","starts":2,"earnings":173250,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eBrickyard Belle is a contender for the Breeders' Cup Juvenile Turf Sprint.\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Hall Stables LLC","uid":"blte965dbe434380df3","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blte965dbe434380df3?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Brickyard Belle","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Brickyard Belle Racing (Mike Fitzgerald), Beggs and Flowers (Ed Farmer Beggs) and Briles Family Stable (Jim Briles)","trainer":"Miguel Clement","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Brickyard Belle","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt2a593915dc30fc4e/6ac6997fe7a20e0a5634c451/Contender_Photo_Brickyard_Belle.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt2a593915dc30fc4e/6ac6997fe7a20e0a5634c451/Contender_Photo_Brickyard_Belle.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Sioux Nation","damName":"Sneaky Snooze (IRE)","sex":"Gelding","color":"Chestnut","foalingDate":"April, 04 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"DONCASTER","raceName":"Carlsberg Danish Pilsner Flying Childers S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"September, 11 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":175651,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"YORK","raceName":"Al Basti Equiworld Dubai Gimcrack S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"August, 21 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":340767,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"THIRSK","raceName":"Ray And Eileen Mclean Memorial Ebf Maiden Stakes (Class 4) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 14 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":14836,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"GOODWOOD","raceName":"British Stallion Studs Ebf Maiden Stakes (Class 2) (Colts And Geldings Only)","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 28 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":79731,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Coventry S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"June, 16 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":268252,"positionAtFinish":7},{"trackName":"LINGFIELD","raceName":"British Stallion Studs Ebf Novice Stakes (Class 2) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 01 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":53827,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":6,"earnings":198677,"show":0,"win":2,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"33","placeP":"33"},"lifetime":{"starts":6,"earnings":198677,"show":0,"win":2,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"33","placeP":"33"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"33","placesP":"33","starts":6,"earnings":198677,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":2},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eFinal Objective (IRE) took a few races to put things together, but once he did his connections quickly settled on the $1 million Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf Sprint (G1) as his fall objective. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe chestnut gelding has won of two of six starts in the U.K. – all at different racetracks and on the lawn -- this year for trainer Hamad al Jehani and owner Wathan Racing. Most recently he captured the Flying Childers Stakes (G2) over 5 furlongs by a desperate neck in a five-horse blanket finish at Doncaster on Sept. 11. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFinal Objective lost his first three starts, sandwiching two competitive maiden races around a seventh-place finish in the Coventry Stakes (Gr. 2) at Royal Ascot in June. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHis breakout came at Thirsk racecourse when ridden for the first time by James Doyle, posting handy 2 ½-length maiden victory at 6 furlongs on Aug. 14. A good second in the Gimcrack Stakes (G2) at York followed, leading to his breakthrough at Doncaster \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFinal Objective is a son of Sioux Nation – a son of Scat Daddy and himself a precocious winner of the Keeneland Phoenix Stakes (G1) at 2 at the Curragh in 2017 -- out of the Exceed and Excel (AUS) mare Sneaky Snooze (IRE). \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHe was bred by Richie Galway and Justin Carthy and now races for Wathnan Racing, the nom de course of Sheikh Tamim bin Hamad Al Thani, the emir of Qatar.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Richie Galway \u0026 Justin Carthy","uid":"blt8d951104a8d6fd10","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt8d951104a8d6fd10?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Final Objective (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Wathnan Racing (Tameem BinHamad KH H Al-Thani)","trainer":"Hamad Al Jehani","country":{"uid":"blt440e3ce320965a9b","title":"United Kingdom / England","abbreviation":"GBR","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt02676e7705186e63/61aa4e462e86841fa22388f0/united-kingdom.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Final Objective","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltf422660ff11a05c0/6ac905d9a5feb06d4feb72f6/Contender_Photo_Final_Objective_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltf422660ff11a05c0/6ac905d9a5feb06d4feb72f6/Contender_Photo_Final_Objective_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Persian Force (IRE)","damName":"Princess Rose (GB)","sex":"Colt","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"March, 19 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"Tattersalls Middle Park S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":364236,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"DUNDALK","raceName":"Irish Stallion Farms E.B.F.","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 18 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":25247,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Norfolk S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"June, 20 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":231602,"positionAtFinish":17},{"trackName":"NAAS","raceName":"Irish E.B.F. Median Sires Series","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 27 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":29245,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CURRAGH","raceName":"Topgear At Capital Stud Irish E.B.F.","grade":" ","raceDate":"March, 15 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":25222,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":115173,"show":0,"win":2,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"40","placeP":"40"},"lifetime":{"starts":5,"earnings":115173,"show":0,"win":2,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"40","placeP":"40"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"40","placesP":"40","starts":5,"earnings":115173,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":2},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eForce Noir (IRE) launched his career at the Curragh on March 15, coming home a close-up second to Ruler’s Control (IRE), who was subsequently fourth in the Windsor Castle Stakes (Listed) at Royal Ascot.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFavored in a 5-furlong maiden at Naas on April 27, Force Noir came home a much-the-best 4 ½-length winner over Lady Patrona (GB). Unable to replicate that form when facing the wolves in the Royal meeting’s June 20 Norfolk Stakes (G2) — a “Win and You’re In” for the Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf Sprint (G1) -- the Irish-bred was 17th behind winner Orthodox (GB) in the 21-horse field.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGiven a three-month respite thereafter, he marked his return with a 2 ½-length score over Hanney Boy (IRE) while negotiating 5 furlongs over the all-weather at Dundalk on Sept. 18 before returning less than two weeks later to finish only a neck behind Orthodox in the Middle Park Stakes (G1) in Newmarket.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred by John Martin McLoughney, the colt, a $152,416 purchase at the Goffs Orby Sale in September 2025, is campaigned by the international horse racing and bloodstock operation Amo Racing, which is led by Kia Joorabchian.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"John Martin McLoughney","uid":"bltfee3cde5aae90b28","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltfee3cde5aae90b28?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Force Noir (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Amo Racing USA (Kiavash Joorabchian)","trainer":"Robson De Aguiar","country":{"uid":"blta32e5b692b12a246","title":"Ireland","abbreviation":"IRE","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt613f9a736c40223a/61aa4c2b2f8b9e70946988d3/ireland.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Force Noir","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt0632e737f3ad4506/6adcb2d35951187f653e088d/Contender_Photo_Force_Noir_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt0632e737f3ad4506/6adcb2d35951187f653e088d/Contender_Photo_Force_Noir_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"War Front","damName":"Gypsy Touch","sex":"Colt","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"February, 13 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"BELMONT PARK","raceName":"Futurity S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KENTUCKY DOWNS","raceName":"Keeneland Sales Kentucky Downs Juvenile Sprint S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 29 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":750000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"ELLIS PARK","raceName":"Riverside Rush S. presented by Sterling Industrial","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 01 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"ELLIS PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 19 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 18 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":120000,"positionAtFinish":4}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":318166,"show":1,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"20","winP":"40","placeP":"20"},"lifetime":{"starts":5,"earnings":318166,"show":1,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"20","winP":"40","placeP":"20"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"20","winsP":"40","placesP":"20","starts":5,"earnings":318166,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":2,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eCherry Valley Farm’s Good to Be King didn’t have the smoothest of debuts, finishing fourth beaten 5 lengths at 17-1 in a 5 ½-furlong Churchill Downs maiden special weight on the grass on June 18.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eReceiving plenty of support as the even-money choice while stretching to a mile at Ellis Park on July 19, the homebred dead-heated for a victory with Sir Hansen.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eReceiving the services of Axel Concepcion for his next two starts, the bay colt was only a length behind the winner in third when cutting back to 5 ½ furlongs over a yielding Ellis turf course in the Aug. 1 Riverside Rush Stakes before finishing a close-up second next time in the Aug. 29 Kentucky Downs Juvenile Sprint (Listed) over 6 ½ furlongs.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAccompanied by Manny Franco for the first time in Belmont’s 6-furlong Futurity Stakes (G3), favored Good to Be King closed from off the pace to defeat Regent’s Park by a length, punching his ticket to the World Championships with the Breeders’ Cup qualifying race victory.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTrainer Rusty Arnold, who has yet to saddle a Breeders’ Cup winner, recorded his best finishes with two thirds -- Gear Jockey (Juvenile Turf in 2019) and Leinster (Turf Sprint in 2020).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGood to Be King is out of Gypsy Touch (Runhappy), a half-sister to dual Grade 1-winning Contested (by Ghostzapper). \u0026nbsp;The 2-year-old colt is by War Front, who is also responsible for the 2015 Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf (G1) winner Hit It a Bomb.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":4,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Cherry Valley Farm, LLC","uid":"bltad36a2f9109ea5be","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltad36a2f9109ea5be?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Good to Be King","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Cherry Valley Farm, LLC (Seth Hancock)","trainer":"George R. Arnold II","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Good to Be King","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltb0e363dc1a31989a/6ac177ee758e4ebe5ee137ad/Good_to_be_King_wins_the_Futurity_3-1.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltb0e363dc1a31989a/6ac177ee758e4ebe5ee137ad/Good_to_be_King_wins_the_Futurity_3-1.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Speaker's Corner","damName":"Toscana","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"April, 20 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"BELMONT PARK","raceName":"Matron S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Spinaway S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 05 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":300000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Schuylerville S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"LAUREL PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 12 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":50175,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":4,"earnings":238200,"show":0,"win":2,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"50"},"lifetime":{"starts":4,"earnings":238200,"show":0,"win":2,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"50"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"50","starts":4,"earnings":238200,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":2},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eHarper’s Corner pronounced herself a force to be reckoned in the juvenile fillies division with an emphatic 7 ¾-length front-running victory in a 5-furlong maiden at Laurel in June.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDespite that impressive initial effort, she was let go at 12-1 for the 6-furlong Schuylerville Stakes (Listed) in Saratoga on July 3 and she produced an almost identical performance as her gaudy career unveiling, winning again on the front end by 5 ¼ lengths.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eUpended by 4 ¾ lengths by favored Summer Starlet in Saratoga’s Spinaway Stakes (G1) on Sept. 5, Harper’s Corner had to settle for second next time when only a half-length behind the victorious Brickyard Belle in the 6-furlong Matron Stakes (G3) at Belmont Park on Oct. 3.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eHarper’s Corner, who was bred in Kentucky by Bishop Racing Inc., is campaigned by Charles Biggs. The filly is by the Street Sense stallion Speaker’s Corner, winner of the 2022 Carter Handicap (G1).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe daughter of Toscana (Speightstown) is trained by Cal Lynch, who has yet to be represented by a Breeders’ Cup runner.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":6,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Bishop Racing, Inc.","uid":"blte194131c04b53d8e","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blte194131c04b53d8e?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Harper's Corner","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Charles L. Biggs","trainer":"Cathal A. Lynch","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Harper's Corner","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltf445d474e587cccb/6ad24fa075da6101413d4f5e/Contender_Photo_Harper_s_Corner.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltf445d474e587cccb/6ad24fa075da6101413d4f5e/Contender_Photo_Harper_s_Corner.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Naval Crown (GB)","damName":"Shamankiyna (FR)","sex":"Colt","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"April, 07 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"Tattersalls Middle Park S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":364236,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"YORK","raceName":"Al Basti Equiworld Dubai Gimcrack S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"August, 21 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":340767,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"GOODWOOD","raceName":"Veuve Clicquot Molecomb S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"July, 29 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":146182,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"HAMILTON PARK","raceName":"John \u0026 Margaret Mccluskey Memorial Celebrations Ebf Maiden Stakes (Class 4) (Hamilton Park 2yo Series Qualifier) (Gb","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 11 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":15412,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"NEWCASTLE","raceName":"Pertemps Network Ebf Novice Stakes (Class 2) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 27 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":42893,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":110784,"show":3,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"60","winP":"20","placeP":"20"},"lifetime":{"starts":5,"earnings":110784,"show":3,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"60","winP":"20","placeP":"20"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"60","winsP":"20","placesP":"20","starts":5,"earnings":110784,"racingYear":2026,"shows":3,"wins":1,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eHell Of A Spin (IRE) has developed a bit of a reputation of outrunning his odds, as was in evidence during his career debut when he came home just a half-length behind the favored winner Barnaby Rudge (IRE) in a 5-furlong test over Newcastle’s all-weather surface on June 23.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBacked down to 7-4 favoritism in his next start at Hamilton on July 11, the Irish-bred colt eked out a neck victory over Casino Star (IRE). Taking a significant step up in class for the July 29 Molecomb Stakes (G3), a Breeders’ Cup “Win and You’re In” qualifier for the Juvenile Turf Sprint (G1), Hell Of A Spin was once again overlooked at odds of 66-1. However, despite the lack of wagering confidence, the Adrian Paul Keatley-trained juvenile crossed the wire only a neck behind runner-up Adonius (IRE), with the victorious favorite Pershaada (IRE) a mere 2 lengths ahead of the second-place finisher.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThird once again -- this time 3 lengths behind winner Arapaho Gold (IRE) -- in Goodwood’s Gimcrack Stakes (G2) at odds of 18-1 on Aug. 21, the bay colt rounded out the top three in his third consecutive start, finishing 1 ¼ lengths adrift of Orthodox (GB) in the 6-furlong Middle Park Stakes (G1) in Newmarket on Sept. 26.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred by Corduff Stud, Hell Of A Spin is out of the Aga Khan bred and raced mare, Shamankiyna (FR) by Azamour (IRE).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSire Naval Crown (GB), winner of the Platinum Jubilee Stakes (G1) at Royal Ascot during his 4-year-old campaign, finished 14th in the 2022 renewal of the Breeders’ Cup Turf Sprint (G1), his only appearance at the World Championships.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Corduff Stud","uid":"blt4fe6fdc7feb0dfc0","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt4fe6fdc7feb0dfc0?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Hell of A Spin (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Phillipa Griffin \u0026 Adrian Paul Keatley","trainer":"Adrian Paul Keatley","country":{"uid":"blt440e3ce320965a9b","title":"United Kingdom / England","abbreviation":"GBR","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt02676e7705186e63/61aa4e462e86841fa22388f0/united-kingdom.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Hell of A Spin","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"No Nay Never","damName":"Ein Gedi (IRE)","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"February, 23 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"Tattersalls Sceptre Sessions Cheveley Park S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":364236,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"YORK","raceName":"Sky Bet Lowther S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"August, 20 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":340161,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"Duchess Of Cambridge S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"July, 10 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":167610,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Albany S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"June, 19 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":165060,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"LEICESTER","raceName":"British Ebf Maiden Stakes (Class 4) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":13507,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":407928,"show":0,"win":3,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"60","placeP":"40"},"lifetime":{"starts":5,"earnings":407928,"show":0,"win":3,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"60","placeP":"40"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"60","placesP":"40","starts":5,"earnings":407928,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":3,"places":2},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eIn just her second career start, Libertango (IRE) proved victorious in the June 19 Albany Stakes (G3) at Royal Ascot. The race drew a field of 25, and although she dwelt at the start, Libertango ran on well to win the 6-furlong contest by a length over race favorite Sun Goddess (IRE). \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLibertango came into the race off her career debut at Leicester on May 26. The 2-year-old filly had a slow start that day as well, but she rallied to win by 1 ½ lengths in the 6-furlong race to become a winner at first asking. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFollowing the Albany, Libertango lined up in the July 10 Duchess Of Cambridge Stakes (G2) at Newmarket. Sent off as the favorite in the 6-furlong race, she finished second by three-quarters of a length behind second choice Senorita Bonita (IRE). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLibertango had another slow start in the 6-furlong Lowther Stakes (G2) at York on Aug. 20 but rallied strongly to hit the front a furlong out and prevail by a half-length over favored Star Of State (IRE) in a field of 17. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBack at Newmarket for the 6-furlong Cheveley Park Stakes (G1) on Sept. 26, Libertango finished second beaten a length by odds-on favorite Sun Goddess (IRE). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGeorge Boughey trains Libertango for Vefa Ibrahim Araci, who acquired the filly at the Tattersalls Craven Breeze-Up sale in April. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred by Lynch Bages and Camas Park Stud, Libertango is by No Nay Never and out of the Oasis Dream (GB) mare Ein Gedi (IRE).\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Lynch Bages \u0026 Camas Park Stud","uid":"bltb2b5b2f464aa7547","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltb2b5b2f464aa7547?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Libertango (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"V I Araci","trainer":"George Boughey","country":{"uid":"blt440e3ce320965a9b","title":"United Kingdom / England","abbreviation":"GBR","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt02676e7705186e63/61aa4e462e86841fa22388f0/united-kingdom.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Libertango","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt339debb03e3cefc0/6a736da55e874b4b8c1aface/Contender_Photo_Libertango_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt339debb03e3cefc0/6a736da55e874b4b8c1aface/Contender_Photo_Libertango_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Churchill (IRE)","damName":"Queen of Silca (GB)","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"April, 05 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"Tattersalls Sceptre Sessions Cheveley Park S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"September, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":364236,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"KEMPTON PARK","raceName":"William Hill Sirenia S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"September, 05 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":101381,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Princess Margaret Japan Cup S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"July, 25 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":106599,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Windsor Castle S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 17 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":167831,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"KEMPTON PARK","raceName":"Try Unibets New Improved Acca Boosts Fillies Novice Stakes (Class 4) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 27 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":13447,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":180814,"show":0,"win":3,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"60","placeP":"20"},"lifetime":{"starts":5,"earnings":180814,"show":0,"win":3,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"60","placeP":"20"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"60","placesP":"20","starts":5,"earnings":180814,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":3,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eIn her third career start, Moonrise (IRE) won the July 25 Princess Margaret Japan Cup Stakes (G3) at Ascot. She kept on strongly at the end of the 6-furlong race to defeat Dee’s Funny Girl (IRE) by a neck and notch her first Group victory. Significantly, the race is a Breeders’ Cup Challenge Series a \"Win and You're In\" contest for the John Deere Breeders' Cup Juvenile Fillies Turf (G1). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMoonrise followed up that victory with a front-running 3 3/4-length victory in the 6-furlong Sirenia Stakes (G3) at Kempton on Sept. 5. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMoonrise made her racing debut May 27 at Kempton going 6 furlongs on the all-weather surface. She won the race by 2 ¼ lengths. Off that victorious start, she entered the listed Windsor Castle Stakes on June 17 during Royal Ascot. She finished second by a half-length to King Of Cloughan (IRE) in the 6-furlong contest, which drew a field of 25. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMoonrise set the pace in her next start, the 6-furlong Cheveley Park Stakes (G1) at Newmarket on Sept. 26 but tired late to finish fourth of six beaten 2 3/4 lengths by the victorious Sun Goddess (IRE). \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAndrew Balding trains Moonrise for Ahmad Alkhallafi, and the bay 2-year-old filly races as a homebred. Moonrise is by Churchill (IRE) and out of the Kingman (GB) mare Queen Of Silca (GB), who also raced for Alkhallafi.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Mr A. A. Alkhallafi","uid":"bltb047aa27786e8cc0","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltb047aa27786e8cc0?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Moonrise (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Ahmad Alkhallafi","trainer":"Andrew Balding","country":{"uid":"blt440e3ce320965a9b","title":"United Kingdom / England","abbreviation":"GBR","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt02676e7705186e63/61aa4e462e86841fa22388f0/united-kingdom.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Moonrise","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9cf9f5a9cbe8d089/6a74b49f0f118a79e22d7314/Contender_Photo_Moonrise.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9cf9f5a9cbe8d089/6a74b49f0f118a79e22d7314/Contender_Photo_Moonrise.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":true,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Ten Sovereigns (IRE)","damName":"Exuding (GB)","sex":"Colt","color":"Brown","foalingDate":"March, 30 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"Newmarket Academy Godolphin Beacon Project Cornwallis S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 09 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":99218,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"AYR","raceName":"British E.B.F. Stallions Harry Rosebery S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 18 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":73471,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"NEWCASTLE","raceName":"Admiral Race To Riches Novice Stakes (Class 4) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":13486,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"YORK","raceName":"Al Basti Equiworld Dubai Gimcrack S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"August, 21 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":340767,"positionAtFinish":6},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Norfolk S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"June, 20 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":231602,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"YORK","raceName":"Tomahawk Ebf Restricted Novice Stakes (Class 3) (For Horses In Bands A, B, C And D) (Ebf Restricted Race Qual.) (Gbb","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 23 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":33578,"positionAtFinish":3}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":6,"earnings":138795,"show":2,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"33","winP":"50","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":6,"earnings":138795,"show":2,"win":3,"place":0,"showP":"33","winP":"50","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"33","winsP":"50","placesP":"0","starts":6,"earnings":138795,"racingYear":2026,"shows":2,"wins":3,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eMussab (GB) recently has been flashing the traits associated with his Arabic name -- “strength, firmness and endurance” – in winning his past two starts in Britain, including a listed stakes. \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe son of Ten Sovereigns (IRE), trained by Richard and Peter Fahey for Sheikh Abdullah Almalek Alsabah, has been improving with experience, \u0026nbsp;\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAfter finishing third of eight in a 6-furlong novice stakes on the turf at York on May 23, Mussab took a big step up in class and managed a late-closing third of 21 in the 5-furlong Norfolk Stakes (G2) at Royal Ascot the next month. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAfter a disappointing run in the 6-furlong Gimcrack Stakes (G2) at York, he rebounded to break his maiden by 4 lengths at 5 furlongs over the all-weather track at Newcastle. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThat led to a 1 1/4-length last out win in the listed Harry Rosebery Stakes, run over a soft turf course at 5 furlongs at Scotland’s Ayr Racecourse. Mussab established a stalking position in that race under recent rider Oisin Orr before surging to the lead in the final furlong and holding on for the win. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOut of the Showcasing mare Exuding (GB), Mussab was bred by Mr. and Mrs. Daniel John Deer and purchased by Sheikh Alsabah for $73,578 at this year’s Tattersalls Guineas breeze-up sale.\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"D. J. and Mrs Deer","uid":"blt623af889da3cc32d","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt623af889da3cc32d?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Mussab (GB)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Sheikh Abdullah Almalek Alsabah","trainer":"Richard A. Fahey","country":{"uid":"blt440e3ce320965a9b","title":"United Kingdom / England","abbreviation":"GBR","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt02676e7705186e63/61aa4e462e86841fa22388f0/united-kingdom.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Mussab","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte755d143700906be/6ac923d1667bc1d7d093d964/Contender_Photo_Mussab.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte755d143700906be/6ac923d1667bc1d7d093d964/Contender_Photo_Mussab.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Extreme Choice (AUS)","damName":"Princess Emmy (NZ)","sex":"Filly","color":"Chestnut","foalingDate":"January, 27 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"CHANTILLY","raceName":"Prix Eclipse - Tattersalls - F.E.E.","grade":"3","raceDate":"September, 19 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":84074,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"DEAUVILLE","raceName":"Prix de Cabourg - F.E.E.","grade":"3","raceDate":"August, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":84424,"positionAtFinish":5},{"trackName":"DEAUVILLE","raceName":"Haras de Fresnay-Le-Buffard Prix de Lisieux","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 12 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":52177,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":72347,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":72347,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"67","placesP":"0","starts":3,"earnings":72347,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003ePrimetime Emmy (AUS) was born ready for the spotlight. The chestnut filly with a big blaze began her career with a victory in a maiden contest at Deauville in France on July 12. Sent off as the betting favorite, she defeated nine others in the 6-furlong race, finishing 2 ½ lengths in front of Amnesia (FR).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOff that winning debut, Primetime Emmy competed in the Aug. 2 Prix de Cabourg (G3) at Deavuille but finished fifth of eight. However, she rebounded from that performance in the Sept. 19 Prix Eclipse (G3) at Chantilly when she defeated Scythe (IRE) by a head in the 6-furlong contest.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFrancis-Henri Graffard trains homebred Primetime Emmy for Matthew Sandblom, who races her in the name of his Hollymount Stud France SC. Although she was born in Australia, Primetime Emmy was bred on Northern Hemisphere time with the intention to campaign her as a 2-year-old in France. Sandblom bred her in the name of his Kingstar Farm.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTwo days before her expected start in the John Deere Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Fillies Turf (G1) at Keeneland, a 25 percent interest in Primetime Emmy will be offered Oct. 28 at the third Championship Sale at Historic Castleton.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePrimetime Emmy is by Extreme Choice (AUS) and out of the King’s Chapel (AUS) mare Princess Emmy (NZ).\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Kingstar Farm","uid":"blte40ad234f964fa79","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blte40ad234f964fa79?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Primetime Emmy (AUS)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Hollymount France SC (Matthew Sandblom)","trainer":"Francis-Henri Graffard","country":{"uid":"blt952f4fa5875984b9","title":"France","abbreviation":"FRA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt32d4aec5d5cd2faf/61490dcf77d06a0c9835e9fd/France_Flag.png"}},"horseName":"Primetime Emmy","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Sioux Nation","damName":"Ocean Life (IRE)","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"March, 10 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"CURRAGH","raceName":"Heider Family Stables Round Tower S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"August, 29 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":81076,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"CURRAGH","raceName":"Keeneland Phoenix S.","grade":"1","raceDate":"August, 09 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":462355,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Princess Margaret Japan Cup S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"July, 25 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":106599,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Queen Mary S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"June, 17 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":234964,"positionAtFinish":8},{"trackName":"NAAS","raceName":"Coolmore Stud Irish E.B.F. Fillies Sprint S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"May, 17 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":81371,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"CURRAGH","raceName":"AES Recycling First Flier S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":58675,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CORK","raceName":"Irish Stallion Farms E.B.F.","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":25340,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":7,"earnings":112493,"show":3,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"43","winP":"29","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":7,"earnings":112493,"show":3,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"43","winP":"29","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"43","winsP":"29","placesP":"0","starts":7,"earnings":112493,"racingYear":2026,"shows":3,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eVelozee (IRE) became a winner at first asking when she gamely took a 5-furlong maiden race by a head at Cork on April 4. She then moved up to stakes company off that win, and in her next start, she won the listed First Flier Stakes at the Curragh on May 4 by 3 ½ lengths.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eIn her next two starts, Velozee finished off the board. On May 17, she finished fourth in the Fillies Sprint Stakes (G3) at Naas, beaten 6 ½ lengths. On June 17, she competed at Royal Ascot, where she finished eighth, beaten 3 ¾ lengths, in the Queen Mary Stakes (G2). Victorious (IRE) won both races.\u0026nbsp;\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eVelozee ran again at Ascot on July 25, where she finished third in the Princess Margaret Japan Cup Stakes (G3). She was a length behind the winner, Moonrise (IRE). Velozee then returned to Ireland and finished third again, this time in the Aug. 9 Phoenix Stakes (G1) at the Curragh. She was 1 ¾ lengths behind the winning Sun Goddess (IRE).\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePaddy Twomey trains\u0026nbsp;Velozee\u0026nbsp;for Gary Matthews, Steve\u0026nbsp;Weston\u0026nbsp;and Lucky Hat. She was bred by Grange \u0026amp; Manister House Studs.\u0026nbsp;Velozee\u0026nbsp;is by Sioux Nation and out of the Territories (IRE) mare Ocean Life (IRE).\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Grange \u0026 Manister House Studs","uid":"blt292edd38645af304","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt292edd38645af304?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Velozee (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Medallion Racing (Phillip Shelton), Parkland Thoroughbreds (Steve Weston), Lucky Hat Racing LLC (Joseph and Patricia Veasey), Mark Stanton, Dan and Nikki Katona","trainer":"Paddy Twomey","country":{"uid":"blta32e5b692b12a246","title":"Ireland","abbreviation":"IRE","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt613f9a736c40223a/61aa4c2b2f8b9e70946988d3/ireland.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Velozee","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltab328c8353478e0a/6ac929796f7ed1fb6ebf3ae3/Contender_Photo_Velozee_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltab328c8353478e0a/6ac929796f7ed1fb6ebf3ae3/Contender_Photo_Velozee_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":false,"eligibleRank":null,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Minzaal (IRE)","damName":"Swirral Edge (GB)","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"March, 14 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"DONCASTER","raceName":"Carlsberg Danish Pilsner Flying Childers S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"September, 11 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":175651,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"YORK","raceName":"Sky Bet Lowther S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"August, 20 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":340161,"positionAtFinish":7},{"trackName":"GOODWOOD","raceName":"Veuve Clicquot Molecomb S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"July, 29 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":146182,"positionAtFinish":10},{"trackName":"DEAUVILLE","raceName":"Prix Yacowlef","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":62784,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Queen Mary S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"June, 17 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":234964,"positionAtFinish":5},{"trackName":"CARLISLE","raceName":"British Stallion Studs Ebf Fillies Novice Stakes (Class 2) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 18 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":53304,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"NEWMARKET","raceName":"Tattersalls40,000 Ebf Fillies Novice Stakes (Class 2) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":54330,"positionAtFinish":3}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":7,"earnings":95560,"show":1,"win":1,"place":2,"showP":"14","winP":"14","placeP":"29"},"lifetime":{"starts":7,"earnings":95560,"show":1,"win":1,"place":2,"showP":"14","winP":"14","placeP":"29"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"14","winsP":"14","placesP":"29","starts":7,"earnings":95560,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":1,"places":2},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eAmo Racing Ltd’s marked her career debut with a close-up third under David Egan in a 5-furlong Novice over Newmarket’s Rowley course on May 3 and was brought right back to finish second as the betting choice at Carlisle two weeks later.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOverlooked at 100-1 odds while stepping up for the Queen Mary Stakes (G2) at Royal Ascot in June, the Kevin Philippart De Fay-trained filly came home a credible fifth, finishing 3 ¼ lengths behind the undefeated filly, Victorious (IRE).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSent off a much more reasonable 4-1 chance in Deauville’s Listed Prix Yacowlef on July 4, the bay filly crossed the line 1 length ahead of subsequent Group 3 scorer Drazinda (FR).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAfter a well-beaten 10th behind favored Pershaada (IRE) in the Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf Sprint (G1) qualifier -- the Molecomb Stakes (G3) at Goodwood on July 29 -- Crownbreaker was seventh in the 6-furlong Lowther Stakes (G2) at York on Aug. 20.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNot given much of a look at 16-1 odds in Doncaster’s Flying Childers Stakes (G2) on Sept. 11, the Irish-bred filly was in contention in the early going, and despite surging in the final yards, she was overtaken late and had to settle for second, beaten a neck by favored Final Objective (IRE).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCrownbreaker, a $774,086 purchase by Amo Racing in Book 1 at Tattersalls October in 2025, is by Minzaal (IRE) out of the Hellvelyn (GB) mare Swirral Edge (GB). The 2-year-old filly is a half-sister to Group 1-winner Mill Stream (IRE) and Asymmetric (IRE), victorious at the Group 2 level.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred by Redpender Stud in Ireland, Crownbreaker is campaigned by the international horse racing and bloodstock operation Amo Racing, which is led by Kia Joorabchian.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Redpender Stud Ltd","uid":"blt1ce0576fe4d42c19","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt1ce0576fe4d42c19?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Crownbreaker (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Amo Racing USA (Kiavash Joorabchian)","trainer":"Kevin Philippart De Foy","country":{"uid":"blt440e3ce320965a9b","title":"United Kingdom / England","abbreviation":"GBR","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt02676e7705186e63/61aa4e462e86841fa22388f0/united-kingdom.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Crownbreaker","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltf63cbd74072448a8/6ac906d04073331779615e77/Contender_Photo_Crownbreaker_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltf63cbd74072448a8/6ac906d04073331779615e77/Contender_Photo_Crownbreaker_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":13,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"13","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Bayside Boy (IRE)","damName":"Bayja (IRE)","sex":"Colt","color":"Chestnut","foalingDate":"April, 08 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"FAIR GROUNDS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"February, 15 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":55000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"FAIR GROUNDS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"January, 04 2025 00:00:00","purseUsa":59000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"December, 01 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":127000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"October, 16 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":110000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 27 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":110000,"positionAtFinish":10},{"trackName":"DONCASTER","raceName":"Carlsberg Danish Pilsner Flying Childers S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"September, 11 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":175651,"positionAtFinish":6},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"American Derby","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 29 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":250000,"positionAtFinish":8},{"trackName":"YORK","raceName":"Julia Graves Roses S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 22 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":136445,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 13 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":110000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"GOODWOOD","raceName":"Veuve Clicquot Molecomb S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"July, 29 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":146182,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"FAIR GROUNDS","raceName":"Risen Star S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"February, 17 2024 00:00:00","purseUsa":400000,"positionAtFinish":9},{"trackName":"NEWBURY","raceName":"Apple Print \u0026 Creative Rose Bowl S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 17 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":67399,"positionAtFinish":5},{"trackName":"AQUEDUCT","raceName":"Remsen S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"December, 02 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":250000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":"Street Sense S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 29 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Windsor Castle S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 17 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":167831,"positionAtFinish":5},{"trackName":"BELMONT AT THE BIG A","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 28 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":90000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"HAMILTON PARK","raceName":"Wyvis Roofing Ebf Maiden Stakes (Class 4) (Hamilton Park 2yo Series Qualifier) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 27 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":15464,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 29 2023 00:00:00","purseUsa":136500,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":6,"earnings":102263,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"33","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":6,"earnings":102263,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"33","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"33","placesP":"0","starts":6,"earnings":102263,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eSale Shark (IRE) got off on a winning note, defeating Jaijai (GB) by 2 ¾ lengths in a 5-furlong maiden test at Hamilton on May 27 before running a credible fifth in a field of 25 — beaten only 3 ¼ lengths by King Of Cloughan (IRE) -- when stepping up to face black-type company in the 6-furlong Windsor Castle Stakes at Royal Ascot on June 17. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eReturning to listed company next time out, the Irish-bred colt was fifth behind subsequent Gimcrack Stakes (G2) winner Arapaho Gold (IRE) in Newbury’s Rose Bowl Stakes on July 17. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTaking the next step up in Goodwood’s Molecomb Stakes (G3), a Win and You’re In qualifier for the Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf Sprint (G1) at Keeneland, Sale Shark was 4 lengths back in fourth to race favorite Pershaada (IRE) in the 5-furlong test on July 29. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eReceiving a class reprieve in the listed Roses Stakes at York on Aug. 22, he came away a 1 ¼-length winner over favored Adonius (IRE). He stepped back up to Group company at Doncaster on Sept. 11 in the 5-furlong Flying Childers (G2)and finished sixth of 11 but beaten by only 1 ½ lengths. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred by Ballylinch Stud, Sale Shark is by Bayside Boy (IRE), who stands at the Co. Kilkenny stud in Ireland.\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Ballylinch Stud","uid":"bltc065d8647478263d","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltc065d8647478263d?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Sale Shark (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Simon Orange, Michael Owen","trainer":"Hugo Palmer","country":{"uid":"blt440e3ce320965a9b","title":"United Kingdom / England","abbreviation":"GBR","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt02676e7705186e63/61aa4e462e86841fa22388f0/united-kingdom.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Sale Shark","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltdc454bc567da3eab/6ac3b7f51cd746936d17c627/Contender_Photo_Sale_Shark.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltdc454bc567da3eab/6ac3b7f51cd746936d17c627/Contender_Photo_Sale_Shark.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":15,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"15","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Munnings","damName":"Minha Paixao","sex":"Filly","color":"Chestnut","foalingDate":"January, 11 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"Indian Summer S. Presented by Keeneland Select","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":350000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"DEL MAR","raceName":"Sorrento S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"August, 09 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":150000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Queen Mary S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"June, 17 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":234964,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 29 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":120000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":4,"earnings":140403,"show":1,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"25","winP":"25","placeP":"25"},"lifetime":{"starts":4,"earnings":140403,"show":1,"win":1,"place":1,"showP":"25","winP":"25","placeP":"25"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"25","winsP":"25","placesP":"25","starts":4,"earnings":140403,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":1,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eRuiva is a contender for the Breeders' Cup Juvenile Turf Sprint.\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":2,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Three Chimneys Farm, LLC","uid":"blt7788314bbf0bc5af","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt7788314bbf0bc5af?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Ruiva","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Three Chimneys Farm LLC (Goncalo Torrealba)","trainer":"Wesley A. Ward","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Ruiva","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltd5b645b173baa854/6ace46ff12c245388f565346/Contender_Photo_Ruiva.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltd5b645b173baa854/6ace46ff12c245388f565346/Contender_Photo_Ruiva.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":16,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"16","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Jackie's Warrior","damName":"Chilly Fashion","sex":"Colt","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"March, 28 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"Indian Summer S. Presented by Keeneland Select","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":350000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Skidmore S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 27 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 31 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":206500,"show":1,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"33","winP":"67","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":206500,"show":1,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"33","winP":"67","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"33","winsP":"67","placesP":"0","starts":3,"earnings":206500,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eHeading up to his career debut at Saratoga, Wood Island seemed destined to excel on the turf. Although the son of Jackie’s Warrior was entered in a maiden special weight on the main track on July 31, trainer George Weaver was in favor of waiting for a turf race instead. However, the 5 ½-furlong test came up light so Weaver decided to forge ahead. Sent off the 2-5 choice in the four-horse contest, the colt did not disappoint, going wire-to-wire to win by 1 ½ lengths under Irad Ortiz Jr. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFinally getting his chance to shine on his favored surface, the colt went off as the 2-1 second choice the Aug. 27 Skidmore Stakes over the Spa’s turf course, Wood Island once again jumped to the front and led throughout en route to a 2 ¾-length victory over Titan Ready.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWood Island next ventured to Keeneland for the 5 1/2-furlong Indian Summer (G3) on Oct. 4. Getting a stalking trip behind the pacesetting Ruvia, Wood Island pounced late as did two others and wound up third beaten a head and a nose.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred by Machmer Hall, the Kentucky-bred colt is out of Artie Schiller’s Chilly Fashion, a half-sister to graded stakes winners Corfu, by Malibu Moon and New York Central, by Tapit. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eWeaver recorded his first winner at the World Championships in 2025 when the filly Cy Fair outgunned the colts to take the Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf Sprint (G1).\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Machmer Hall","uid":"blt99dfffd34533acb8","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt99dfffd34533acb8?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Wood Island","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Smart Choice Stable (Jack Anderson)","trainer":"George Weaver","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Wood Island","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt54f2a8196f6eb8e5/6ac14b5102eecb7eb1074c49/Contender_Photo_Wood_Island_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt54f2a8196f6eb8e5/6ac14b5102eecb7eb1074c49/Contender_Photo_Wood_Island_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":17,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"17","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Soldier's Call (GB)","damName":"Dubai Paradise (IRE)","sex":"Gelding","color":"Chestnut","foalingDate":"April, 11 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"Indian Summer S. Presented by Keeneland Select","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":350000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"YORK","raceName":"Julia Graves Roses S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 22 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":136445,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"GOODWOOD","raceName":"Veuve Clicquot Molecomb S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"July, 29 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":146182,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"CHESTER","raceName":"Caa Stellar Lily Agnes Ebf Conditions Stakes (Class 2) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 06 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":67692,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"MUSSELBURGH","raceName":"Sky Bet Club British Ebf Novice Stakes (Class 2) (Gbb Race)","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 12 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":33642,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"MUSSELBURGH","raceName":"Virgin Bet Supports Safe Gambling Ebf Restricted Maiden Stakes (Class 4) (For Horses In Bands C And D) (Ebf Restrict","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":15842,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":6,"earnings":268798,"show":0,"win":4,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"33"},"lifetime":{"starts":6,"earnings":268798,"show":0,"win":4,"place":2,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"33"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"67","placesP":"33","starts":6,"earnings":268798,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":4,"places":2},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eAdonius (IRE) has been dutifully working through his conditions for Rebecca Menzies and appears to have put his trainer on a crash course to top-level company.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSent off at 12-1 for his career opener in a 5-furlong test at Musselburgh on April 4, the Irish-bred colt and his partner Kaiya Fraser won by 7 lengths and the duo ran back at that venue only eight days later to win a novice stakes by a neck at even-money over the same distance.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eContesting the May 6 Lily Agnes at Chester’s May Festival, the son of Soldier’s Call (GB) showed plenty of speed in the early going, and once again made short work of his rivals, scoring by 1 ¼ lengths over Hickory Lad (IRE).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGiven almost three months to prepare for the Molecomb Stakes (G3) during the “Glorious Goodwood” meeting, Adonius once again flashed his early speed but could not hold off the late-closing filly Pershaada (IRE), who bested the gelding by 2 lengths at the wire. The 5-furlong test is a Challenge Series “Win and You’re In’” qualifier for the Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf Sprint (G1), held at Keeneland on Oct. 30.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdonius ventured to Keeneland for the 5 1/2-furlong Indian Summer (G3) on Oct. 4 in which he did not flash his early speed while exiting the gate next to last in the field of nine. Under jockey John Velazquez, Adonius began picking off horses on the turn, swing four wide into the stretch and got to win by a head \u0026nbsp;in a four-horse photo.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred by Thomas Hassett in Ireland, the £32,000 GOFFS UK yearling purchase is out of Dubai Paradise (IRE), by Exceed And Excel (AUS).\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Thomas Hassett","uid":"blt78f1a1c534056998","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt78f1a1c534056998?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Adonius (IRE)","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Riverdee Stable (Sean \u0026 Anne Clancy), West Paces Racing LLC (Larry Connolly) \u0026 Michael Hughes","trainer":"Rebecca Menzies","country":{"uid":"blt440e3ce320965a9b","title":"United Kingdom / England","abbreviation":"GBR","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt02676e7705186e63/61aa4e462e86841fa22388f0/united-kingdom.png","alt":""}},"horseName":"Adonius","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9a80cc5195aa0f37/6a73993ff71efd0362a43bf3/Contender_Photo_Adonius.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9a80cc5195aa0f37/6a73993ff71efd0362a43bf3/Contender_Photo_Adonius.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":18,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"18","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Flightline","damName":"Starship Jubilee","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"March, 30 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":"bet365 Algonquin S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":250000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Bolton Landing S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 25 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115100,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":176716,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"33"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":176716,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"33"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"67","placesP":"33","starts":3,"earnings":176716,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eHardly a secret when debuting in a 5-furlong turf test Woodbine in July, Go for Launch duly reported home a front-running winner over Royal Foxtrot under Pietro Moran.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eStepping into deeper waters for her next start in the 5 ½-furlong Bolton Landing Stakes (Listed) at Saratoga, she was largely overlooked at odds of 10-1 but she came from just off the pace to win again, this time by 2 ¼ lengths over Allura with Extravaganzoo back in third.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBacked down to 1-2 favoritism in the Algonquin Stakes (G3) when returning to her home base of Woodbine, she was beaten a half-length by the victorious Mrs D.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe filly is campaigned by her breeder, Bonnie Baskin and Adam Corndorf’s Blue Heaven Farm. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred in the purple, the filly is by U.S Horse of the Year and Breeders’ Cup Classic (G1) hero Flightline and she was produced by Starship Jubilee (by Indy Wind), a Canadian Horse of the Year and three-time turf champion female in Canada.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLike Starship Jubilee, Go for Launch is trained by Sovereign Award-winning trainer, Kevin Attard, who collected his first and only win at the World Championships with Moira, winner of the 2024 renewal of the Maker’s Mark Breeders’ Cup Filly \u0026amp; Mare Turf (G1). \r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Blue Heaven Farm","uid":"blt16b92c0d47f41d2c","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt16b92c0d47f41d2c?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Go for Launch","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Blue Heaven Farm (Adam Corndorf and Bonnie Baskin)","trainer":"Kevin Attard","country":{"uid":"bltd313850291635aef","title":"Canada","abbreviation":"CAN","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt4c78a5ec75e090d2/61aa4b152e86841fa22388d7/Flag_of_Canada.jpg","alt":""}},"horseName":"Go for Launch","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte7e3091c35a0260a/6ada37202299f5e18ab96939/Contender_Photo_Go_For_Launch.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte7e3091c35a0260a/6ada37202299f5e18ab96939/Contender_Photo_Go_For_Launch.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":19,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"19","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Jackie's Warrior","damName":"That's the Idea","sex":"Colt","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"January, 26 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"Indian Summer S. Presented by Keeneland Select","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":350000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 10 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":120000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"ELLIS PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":3}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":100260,"show":1,"win":0,"place":2,"showP":"33","winP":"0","placeP":"67"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":100260,"show":1,"win":0,"place":2,"showP":"33","winP":"0","placeP":"67"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"33","winsP":"0","placesP":"67","starts":3,"earnings":100260,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":0,"places":2},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eLove a Warrior has been showing steady improvement with each start, beginning with a third-place effort behind Lifesong in a 6-furlong maiden special weight on the dirt at Ellis Park on July 26.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGaining the services of jockey Luis Saez while negotiating that same distance at Churchill Downs on Sept. 10, the Kentucky-bred colt showed early speed but weakened late over the ground listed as good and had to settle for second behind winner Endrush.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOverlooked at 24-1 while stepping into black-type company for the first time in Keeneland’s Indian Summer Stakes (G3) on Oct. 4, the bay colt had only a head separating him and winner Adonius (IRE) at the wire in the 5 ½-furlong test in his grass debut.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLove a Warrior is by Jackie’s Warrior, the talented Grade 1-winning sprinter who contested the World Championships on three occasions, recording his best finish in 2022 when finishing third in the Breeders’ Cup Sprint (G1) at Keeneland.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTrained by Steve Asmussen, the Kentucky-bred is campaigned by his breeders, Texas-based philanthropists and restaurant entrepreneurs Kirk and Judy Robison.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"J. Kirk Robison \u0026 Judy Robison","uid":"blta4701def7b1ca9b0","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blta4701def7b1ca9b0?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Love a Warrior","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"J. Kirk and Judy Robison","trainer":"Steven M. Asmussen","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Love a Warrior","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltb4e039933ae7c8b5/6ad24ff8667bc17d7893fc05/Contender_Photo_Love_a_Warrior.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltb4e039933ae7c8b5/6ad24ff8667bc17d7893fc05/Contender_Photo_Love_a_Warrior.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":21,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"21","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Golden Pal","damName":"Wendy Wow","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"April, 22 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"Jessamine S. Presented by Keeneland Sales","grade":"2","raceDate":"October, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":400000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"KENTUCKY DOWNS","raceName":"Untapable S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 30 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":750000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ELLIS PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 07 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":576318,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"33"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":576318,"show":0,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"33"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"67","placesP":"33","starts":3,"earnings":576318,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eStakes winner Seneca Park began her racing career a perfect two-for-two. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe juvenile filly made her racing debut on Aug. 7 at Ellis Park in a maiden special weight. Sent off as the betting favorite in a field of 11, Seneca Park showed her ability as she pulled away to win by 4 lengths in the 5 ½-furlong turf contest.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOff that triumphant beginning, Seneca Park stepped up to stakes company in the Aug. 30 Untapable Stakes (Listed) at Kentucky Downs going 6 ½ furlongs. The race is named after champion Untapable, who won the 2014 Breeders’ Cup Distaff (G1). Seneca Park was sent off as the betting favorite again, and once again, she was facing 10 others. This time, she made a late surge in deep stretch to win by a neck over Luminous Beauty. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSeneca Park stepped up to graded stakes company at Keeneland in the 1 1/16-mile Jessamine (G2) on Oct. 2. Sent off as the second choice in the field of 11, she set the pace and led to the sixteenth pole where she was collared by Serenas Ghost and settled for second beaten 1 1/4 lengths.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDallas Stewart trains Seneca Park for Arizona-based Holy Cow Stable, which is the racing operation of cardiologist Himanshu Shukla. He acquired Seneca Park for $70,000 at the OBS March 2-year-olds in training sale. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSeneca Park was bred by Southern Comfort Farm. She is by Golden Pal and out of the Invasor (ARG) mare Wendy Wow.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Southern Comfort Farm LLC","uid":"bltf2a84e6de3282600","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltf2a84e6de3282600?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Seneca Park","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Holy Cow Stable, LLC (Himanshu H. Shukla)","trainer":"Dallas Stewart","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Seneca Park","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt8ecfbe62cf858be4/6a972c33805755f948704811/Contender_Photo_Seneca_Park.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt8ecfbe62cf858be4/6a972c33805755f948704811/Contender_Photo_Seneca_Park.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":22,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"22","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Flameaway","damName":"Sly Beauty","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"February, 22 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"BELMONT PARK","raceName":"Futurity S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"KENTUCKY DOWNS","raceName":"Untapable S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 30 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":750000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Adirondack S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"August, 02 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":225000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":"Schuylerville S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":5},{"trackName":"SARATOGA","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 15 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":120000,"positionAtFinish":2}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":6,"earnings":309750,"show":1,"win":1,"place":3,"showP":"17","winP":"17","placeP":"50"},"lifetime":{"starts":6,"earnings":309750,"show":1,"win":1,"place":3,"showP":"17","winP":"17","placeP":"50"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"17","winsP":"17","placesP":"50","starts":6,"earnings":309750,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":1,"places":3},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eLuminous Beauty has had a productive juvenile campaign. The 2-year-old filly finished second in her debut May 15 in a 5-furlong maiden special weight on dirt at Churchill Downs. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThen, on June 4, she won a maiden special weight by 6 ¼ lengths at Saratoga going 5 ½-furlings on dirt. Off that impressive score, Luminous Beauty competed in the July 3 Schuylerville Stakes (Listed) and finished fifth. Luminous Beauty then lined up in the Aug. 2 Adirondack Stakes (G3) and finished second behind Stress Relief.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLuminous Beauty made the switch to turf when she ran in the Aug. 30 Untapable Stakes (Listed) at Kentucky Downs. She did well in the 6 ½-furlong race and took the lead before being beaten by Seneca Park by a neck. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFor her next start, Luminous Beauty returned to New York to run in the Oct. 3 Futurity Stakes (G3) at Belmont Park against colts. She finished third behind Good to Be King and Regent’s Park.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eJena Antonucci trains Luminous Beauty for Fred Rosen, Steve Dervenis, Cliff Racing and her own horseOlo, which she co-founded with Katie Miranda. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBred by Debby Oxley, Luminous Beauty is by Flameaway and out of the Into Mischief mare Sly Beauty. She was purchased by Horseology as a yearling for $40,000.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":2,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Debby M. Oxley","uid":"blt1ca7e918c07bc902","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt1ca7e918c07bc902?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Luminous Beauty","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"horseOlogy (Katie Miranda), Fredrick Rosen, Steve Dervenis and Cliff Racing LLC (David Schlosser)","trainer":"Jena M. Antonucci","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Luminous Beauty","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltbd10ec8ccd27c4ac/6aabfa4bd1556f43e1728429/Contender_Photo_Luminous_Beauty.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltbd10ec8ccd27c4ac/6aabfa4bd1556f43e1728429/Contender_Photo_Luminous_Beauty.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":23,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"23","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Bolt d'Oro","damName":"True Elegance","sex":"Filly","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"May, 31 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":"bet365 Algonquin S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":250000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":"Catch A Glimpse S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 15 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":150000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":"My Dear S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 12 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":125000,"positionAtFinish":2},{"trackName":"WOODBINE","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 31 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":115100,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":4,"earnings":166039,"show":1,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"25","winP":"50","placeP":"25"},"lifetime":{"starts":4,"earnings":166039,"show":1,"win":2,"place":1,"showP":"25","winP":"50","placeP":"25"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"25","winsP":"50","placesP":"25","starts":4,"earnings":166039,"racingYear":2026,"shows":1,"wins":2,"places":1},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eMrs D got off to a good start when going wire-to-wire as the 8-5 favorite--winning by 3 lengths--in a 5-furlong maiden over Woodbine racetrack’s all-weather surface on May 31. \r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe $100,000 Fasig-Tipton Kentucky Fall Yearling Sale purchase came home second while stepping into black-type company at the Toronto-area oval for the My Dear Stakes (Listed) over 5 ½ furlongs on the all-weather on July 12 before finishing third, 4 lengths behind Meloni, when switching to the grass for the 6 ½-furlong Catch a Glimpse Stakes (Listed) on Aug. 15.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLet go at 7-1 in the 5-furlong Algonquin Stakes (G3) on the Woodbine turf on Oct. 3, the bay filly closed to grab a half-length victory over Go for Launch under her regular jockey Jose Luis Campos.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eThe daughter of Bolt d’Oro is out of True Elegance (by Distorted Humor), a full-sister to Canadian champion female sprinter Hillaby and a half-sister to Grade I winner Cambier Parc (Medaglia d’Oro). Bred by Dixiana Farms, the filly’s granddam is Canadian Horse of the Year and two-time champion Sealy Hill.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCampaigned by JDLP Holdings, Mrs D’s trainer, Woodbine-based Steven Chircop is the nephew of Woodbine fixture, Tino Attard.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Dixiana Farms LLC","uid":"bltca15d8d55f57a826","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltca15d8d55f57a826?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Mrs D","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"JDLP Holdings Inc (Joe Demarinis)","trainer":"Steven Chircop","country":{"uid":"bltd313850291635aef","title":"Canada","abbreviation":"CAN","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt4c78a5ec75e090d2/61aa4b152e86841fa22388d7/Flag_of_Canada.jpg","alt":""}},"horseName":"Mrs D","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt20cf2658539743f3/6ace499be271b4750a006cf0/Contender_Photo_Mrs_D_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt20cf2658539743f3/6ace499be271b4750a006cf0/Contender_Photo_Mrs_D_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":24,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"24","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Corniche","damName":"Pacific Heat","sex":"Filly","color":"Chestnut","foalingDate":"May, 07 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"KEENELAND","raceName":"Indian Summer S. Presented by Keeneland Select","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":350000,"positionAtFinish":5},{"trackName":"ELLIS PARK","raceName":"Riverside Rush S. presented by Sterling Industrial","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 01 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"ASCOT","raceName":"Norfolk S.","grade":"2","raceDate":"June, 20 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":231602,"positionAtFinish":5},{"trackName":"CHURCHILL DOWNS","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"April, 28 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":120000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":4,"earnings":202982,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":4,"earnings":202982,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"0","starts":4,"earnings":202982,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eFanshell Beach won at first asking, taking a 4 ½-furlong maiden special weight by 5 ¼ lengths at Churchill Downs on April 28.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eRepresenting trainer Wesley Ward at Royal Ascot in June, the filly closed from far back to finish fifth of 21 runners in the Norfolk Stakes (G2), a “Win and You’re In” qualifying race for the Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf Sprint (G1) at Keeneland.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFacing a yielding turf course at Ellis Park on the 5 ½-furlong Riverside Rush Stakes on Aug. 1, the $80,000 Keeneland September yearling purchase went wire-to-wire to win by a half-length over Crack On as the 9-5 favorite.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFacing several heavy hitters in Keeneland’s Indian Summer Stakes (G3) on Oct. 4, the chestnut filly closed to be fifth, 1 length behind winner Adonius (IRE).\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSired by champion juvenile Corniche out of the stakes-winning mare Pacific Heat, Fanshell Beach’s name references a scenic location near the Pacific Ocean.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eFanshell Beach is campaigned by Hat Creek Racing, founded by Lexington-based bloodstock agent Gatewood Bell, a third-generation horseman and Vice President of Racing at Keeneland.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Betz Thoroughbreds, Inc./D.J. Stables/Brian Graves/Gainesway","uid":"bltd226654f24ba154c","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltd226654f24ba154c?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Fanshell Beach","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Hat Creek Racing (Gatewood Bell)","trainer":"Wesley A. Ward","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Fanshell Beach","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltd6ca63cbc85ef744/6ad288b6bcf6e07e78e577cd/Contender_Photo_Fanshell_Beach.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/bltd6ca63cbc85ef744/6ad288b6bcf6e07e78e577cd/Contender_Photo_Fanshell_Beach.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":25,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"25","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Frosted","damName":"Firewolves","sex":"Colt","color":"Gray or Roan","foalingDate":"March, 19 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"SANTA ANITA PARK","raceName":"Speakeasy S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"KENTUCKY DOWNS","raceName":"Keeneland Sales Kentucky Downs Juvenile Sprint S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 29 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":750000,"positionAtFinish":4},{"trackName":"ELLIS PARK","raceName":"Riverside Rush S. presented by Sterling Industrial","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 01 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":6},{"trackName":"BELMONT AT THE BIG A","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 18 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":85000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":4,"earnings":143903,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":4,"earnings":143903,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"50","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"50","placesP":"0","starts":4,"earnings":143903,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eArctic Wolf kicked off his career on the right foot, taking a 5 1/2-furlong turf maiden at Aqueduct on June 18. Facing a yielding turf course next time in the 5 ½-furlong Riverside Rush Stakes at Ellis Park on Aug. 1, the gray was a non-factoring sixth — beaten 6 ¼ lengths by Fanshell Beach -- as the 4-1 third betting choice in a field of 11.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAdding a furlong for his next start in the Kentucky Downs Juvenile Sprint (Listed) on Aug. 29, the Kentucky-bred colt weakened late to be fourth, behind winner Mid American and runner-up Good to Be King, who subsequently annexed the Breeders’ Cup “Win and You’re In” Futurity Stakes (G3) at Belmont Park.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eInstalled the 8-5 second choice in the 5-furlong Speakeasy Stakes (Listed) at Santa Anita on Oct. 3, the son of Frosted ran off to a 2 ¼-length score over Fumanos Fire.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Flying B Ranch Thoroughbreds","uid":"blt417efe48f0ae7bb0","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt417efe48f0ae7bb0?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Arctic Wolf","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"MHM Stables LLC (Matthew Mazzucchi), C T R Stables, LLC (Chad Calvert) and John Goldthorpe","trainer":"Jack Sisterson","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Arctic Wolf","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt6208b4534ea6ce8a/6ace45a69355c00a837ab7b5/Contender_Photo_Artic_Wolf_.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt6208b4534ea6ce8a/6ace45a69355c00a837ab7b5/Contender_Photo_Artic_Wolf_.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":26,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"26","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Karakontie (JPN)","damName":"Happy Joy Joy","sex":"Gelding","color":"Bay","foalingDate":"March, 10 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":"Hollywood Beach S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"September, 26 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 23 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":70000,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"June, 13 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":70000,"positionAtFinish":4}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":3,"earnings":69650,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":3,"earnings":69650,"show":0,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"0","winP":"67","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"0","winsP":"67","placesP":"0","starts":3,"earnings":69650,"racingYear":2026,"shows":0,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eBought for just $7,000 at the Keeneland September Yearling Sale, Riyadh Way will try to author a rags-to-riches story when he stretches out in the Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf (G1) at Keeneland.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eA Karakontie (JPN) gelding, Riyadh Way started his career June 13 in a 5-furlong maiden race on dirt at Gulfstream Park and finished fourth.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eShifting to turf for his second start on Aug. 23 at Gulfstream made a huge difference as he led throughout and won a 5-furlong maiden race at the Hallandale Beach track by 4 ¼ lengths in :56.34.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eKept at a 5-fiurlong distance by trainer Tareq Moubarak, the juvenile returned Sept. 26 in the black-type Hollywood Beach Stakes at Gulfstream. Despite breaking slowly and encountering traffic issues, Riyadh Way rallied from seventh and won by 1 ¾ lengths to enter the Breeders’ Cup picture.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOwned by Alwaleed Thamer Alosaimi International Stables, he was bred by Raymond Montgomery in Kentucky out of the Kitten’s Joy mare Happy Joy Joy.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Raymond Montgomery (Chip)","uid":"bltacb12ded9a00f016","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/bltacb12ded9a00f016?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"Riyadh Way","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Alwaleed Thamer Alosaimi International Stables (Mabarak Alotaibi) \u0026 Saleh Saud Al Otaibi","trainer":"Tareq Moubarak","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"Riyadh Way","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blte66e7c3f33facf3b/6334cddf4df1082a16b60e31/Fallback_Horse_Image.png"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":27,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"27","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""},{"sireName":"Omaha Beach","damName":"Under Serviced","sex":"Filly","color":"Dark Bay or Brown","foalingDate":"May, 07 2024 00:00:00","age":2,"pastPerformances":[{"trackName":"BELMONT PARK","raceName":"Futurity S.","grade":"3","raceDate":"October, 03 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":200000,"positionAtFinish":5},{"trackName":"PRAIRIE MEADOWS","raceName":"Prairie Meadows Debutante S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 14 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"ASSINIBOIA DOWNS","raceName":"Debutante S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"August, 04 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":50250,"positionAtFinish":1},{"trackName":"PRAIRIE MEADOWS","raceName":"Prairie Gold Lassie S.","grade":" ","raceDate":"July, 10 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":100000,"positionAtFinish":3},{"trackName":"GULFSTREAM PARK","raceName":" ","grade":" ","raceDate":"May, 15 2026 00:00:00","purseUsa":70000,"positionAtFinish":1}],"record":{"previousYear":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"breedersCup":{"starts":0,"earnings":0,"show":0,"win":0,"place":0,"showP":"NA","winP":"NA","placeP":"NA"},"currentYear":{"starts":5,"earnings":88634,"show":2,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"40","winP":"40","placeP":"0"},"lifetime":{"starts":5,"earnings":88634,"show":2,"win":2,"place":0,"showP":"40","winP":"40","placeP":"0"}},"yearlySummary":[{"showsP":"40","winsP":"40","placesP":"0","starts":5,"earnings":88634,"racingYear":2026,"shows":2,"wins":2,"places":0},{"showsP":"NA","winsP":"NA","placesP":"NA","starts":0,"earnings":0,"racingYear":2025,"shows":0,"wins":0,"places":0}],"morningLineOdds":[],"bio":"\u003cp\u003eSpeed has been the name of the game for Joseph Schumer’s My Kid’s Said No, who set the pace and ran off to an eye-catching 10 ¾-length victory in her career unveiling at Gulfstream Park in May.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSent off the 2-1 second choice in the 5 ½-furlong Prairie Gold Lassie Stakes at Prairie Meadows on July 10, the Florida-bred filly showed plenty of speed early but was caught late, finishing third behind Wild Vekoma and Cardio Cat.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSent off the heavy favorite in the 5-furlong Debutante Stakes at Assiniboia Downs in Manitoba, Canada, on Aug. 4, she had things her own way, scoring by an 11 ¾-length margin.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTrying 6 furlongs for the first time in a muddy edition of the Prairie Meadows Debutante Stakes on Aug. 14, My Kid’s Said No was overtaken late and had to settle for third behind Wild Vekoma.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLet go at 21-1 while facing colts in addition to trying the turf for the first time in Belmont’s Futurity Stakes (G3), a “Win and You’re In” qualifying race to the Breeders’ Cup Juvenile Turf Sprint (G1), the Tena Birdwell-trained filly set the pace and tired late to be fifth, 6 ½ lengths behind winner Good to Be King.\r\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eBy Omaha Beach, My Kid’s Said No is out of Under Serviced (Hook and Ladder). Bred by Helen and Joseph Barbazon, she brought $70,000 at the Ocala Breeders’ Sales March 2-year-olds in Training Sale.\r\u003c/p\u003e","gradedStakesPoints":0,"regionWinnerBadges":[],"breederName":"Helen Barbazon \u0026 Joseph Barbazon","uid":"blt9121452527b140fb","hasAutogeneratedPage":true,"url":"/redirect/horse/blt9121452527b140fb?ht=pre-entries","pageTitle":"My Kid's Said No","jockeyName":"","ownerName":"Joseph A. Schumer","trainer":"Tena Birdwell","country":{"uid":"blt1af49e3a6a89373f","title":"USA","abbreviation":"USA","flag":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt9de45bbdff160673/60d219911e0505677a882fa1/USAFlag.png"}},"horseName":"My Kid's Said No","avatar":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt68ee4eba4700dab6/6ad251508f4f8c4b616bf885/Contender_Photo_My_Kid_s_Said_No.jpg"},"regularImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt68ee4eba4700dab6/6ad251508f4f8c4b616bf885/Contender_Photo_My_Kid_s_Said_No.jpg"},"cta":null,"races":[{"uid":"blt4cb982cb76518f16","ContentTypeUid":"collection_race","challengeSeriesWinner":false,"isEligible":true,"eligibleRank":28,"finishPosition":null,"classicRanking":null,"postPosition":"28","scratched":false,"win":"","place":"","show":"","deadHeat":false,"silks":null}],"isChallengeSeriesWinner":false,"silks":null,"isHoC":false,"year":2026,"isHistoricalEntry":false,"relatedArticles":[],"win":"","show":"","place":""}]}],"assets":{"challengeSeriesWinnerImage":{"src":"https://images.contentstack.io/v3/assets/blt9b0ea57b1efe7a70/blt2f51d9ea0dcd56bd/62d16e22719eb738924973c6/BC_Chall_4cLogo_Tagline.png"}},"raceNames":[{"key":"Breeders' Cup Classic","value":"classic","selected":true,"short":"Classic"},{"key":"Breeders' Cup Turf","value":"turf","selected":false,"short":"Turf"},{"key":"Breeders' Cup Distaff","value":"distaff","selected":false,"short":"Distaff"},{"key":"Breeders' Cup Mile","value":"mile","selected":false,"short":"Mile"},{"key":"Breeders' Cup Filly \u0026 Mare Sprint","value":"filly-mare-sprint","selected":false,"short":"Filly \u0026 Mare Sprint"},{"key":"Breeders' Cup Filly \u0026 Mare Turf","value":"filly-mare-turf","selected":false,"short":"Filly \u0026 Mare Turf"},{"key":"Breeders' Cup Sprint","value":"sprint","selected":false,"short":"Sprint"},{"key":"Breeders' Cup Turf Sprint","value":"turf-sprint","selected":false,"short":"Turf Sprint"},{"key":"Breeders' Cup Dirt Mile","value":"dirt-mile","selected":false,"short":"Dirt Mile"},{"key":"Breeders' Cup Juvenile Turf","value":"juvenile-turf","selected":false,"short":"Juvenile Turf"},{"key":"Breeders' Cup Juvenile","value":"juvenile","selected":false,"short":"Juvenile"},{"key":"Breeders' Cup Juvenile Fillies Turf","value":"juvenile-fillies-turf","selected":false,"short":"Juvenile Fillies Turf"},{"key":"Breeders' Cup Juvenile Fillies","value":"juvenile-fillies","selected":false,"short":"Juvenile Fillies"},{"key":"Breeders' Cup Juvenile Turf Sprint","value":"juvenile-turf-sprint","selected":false,"short":"Juvenile Turf Sprint"}],"horseType":"pre-entries","tooltips":{"silks":"ToolTip- Unique racing \u003cspan style=\"color: rgb(216, 198, 166);\"\u003eSILKS\u003c/span\u003e are used to represent a horse’s owner and to allow race commentators and spectators to easily differentiate between racehorses."},"trackingName":"2026 Contenders"}},{"richTextEditor":{"javascript":"","Metadata":{"uid":"csaab196c17a389aec"},"css":"","html":"\u003ch4\u003eWithdrawals\u003c/h4\u003e\u003cp\u003ePhileas Fogg has withdrawn from the Classic\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNet Par has withdrawn from the Juvenile\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDotsy has withdrawn from the Juvenile Fillies\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eSo Lovely has withdrawn from the Juvenile Fillies Turf\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eAl Hudaiba has withdrawn from the Juvenile Turf \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eCarrry the Flag has withdrawn from the Juvenile Turf Sprint (AE #20)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eDrazinda has withdrawn from the Juvenile Turf Sprint (AE #14)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eNabati has withdrawn from the Juvenile Turf Sprint\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eConstitution River has withdrawn from the Mile \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eGstaad has withdrawn from the Mile \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003ePower Blue has withdrawn from the Mile (AE #22)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eTen Bob Tony has withdrawn from the Mile\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eOmbudsman has withdrawn from the Turf \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eLambourn has withdrawn from the Turf (AE #16)\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003eMinnie Hauk has withdrawn from the Turf \u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u0026nbsp;\u003c/p\u003e","fullWidth":false}},{"stackedCtas":{"uid":"blt80d1a585b59f8265","ctas"